hadiths[421]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1","Allaah aapako taufeeq de, jaan leejiye ki jo shakhs sahee aur zaeef hadis mein farq aur tameez karane ki salaahiyat rakhta ho aur vo bharosemand raviyon (hadees bayan karnevalon) aur muttahim raaviyon (jinapar jhoot vagaira ka ilzam laga ho) ko pehchanata bhee ho to us par vaajib hai ki sivaaey us hadis ke kisi aur hadis ko bayan na kare jo sanad ke aitibaar se sahi ho aur usake bayan karanevaale wo log hon jinke aib aur buraii logon ke saamne na aai hun. aur un logon ki hadis bayan karane se bachen jinapar kisi tarah ka ilzam lagaya gaya ho ya jo log dushmani rakhte hon ya jo log Deen mein nai baat (bidat) paida karte hon. jo kuchh hamne bayan kiya uski daleel ye hai ki Allah rabbul-izzat ne faramaaya aey eimaan-walo! agar tumhaare paas koi fasiq (jhoota ya bad-amal) khabar lekar aaey to tahqeeq (jaanch-padtaal) kar liya karo"
"2","Abu-Bakar bin abi Sheba, Muhammad-bin-Musanna aur ibne-Bashar ne kaha : ham se Muhammad-bin-Jafar (ghandar ( ne Shoba se hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne Mansoor se, unhon-ne Rabai-bin-Hirash se riwayat ki ke unhon-ne Hazrat Ali (Raziallahu anhu) se suna, jab wo khutba de rahe they, kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya mujh par jhoot na bolo"
"3","Hazrat Anas-bin-Malik (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, kaha : mujhey tumharey samney zyada hadisein bayan karne se ye baat rokti hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya tha : jisne jan-boojhkar mujh par jhoot bola wo aag mein apna thikana bana ley."
"4","Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : jisne jan-boojhkar mujh par jhoot bola wo aag mein apna thikana bana ley."
"5","Saeed-bin-Ubaid ne kaha : hamein Ali-bin Rabee waalbi ne hadis bayan ki, kaha : main masjid mein aaya aur (us waqt) Hazrat Mughira (bin Shoba (Raziallahu anhu)) Kufa ke ameer ( governer ( they : Mughira ne kaha : maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suna, aap farma rahe they : mujh par jhoot bolnaa is tarah nahi jaisey ( mere ilawa ( kisi aik ( aam aadmi ( par jhoot bolnaa hai, jisne jaan-bojh kar mujh par jhoot bola wo jahannam mein apna thikana bana ley.'"
"6","Muhammad-bin Qais Asadi ne Ali-bin Rabee Asadi se, unhon-ne Hazrat Mughira-bin-Shoba (Raziallahu anhu) se, unhon-ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se isi tarah riwayat ki lekin 'bila shubah mujh par jhoot bolnaa is tarah nahi jaisey kisi aik ( aam ( aadmi par jhoot bolnaa hai. (ka jumla ( bayan nahi kya."
"7","Ubaidullah-bin-Muaz bin Anbari aur Abdur-Rehman-bin-Mehdi donon ne kaha : ham se Shoba ne bayan kya, unhon-ne Khubaib bin Abdur-Rehman se, unhon-ne Hafs bin Aasim se riwayat ki, kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : aadmi ke jhoota honey ke liye yahi kafi hai ke wo har suni hui baat bayan kar de.'"
"8","abu-Bakar-bin-abi-Sheba ne Ali-bin Hafs se, unhon-ne Shoba se, unhon-ne Khubaib bin Abdur-Rehman se, unhon-ne Hafs bin Aasim se, unhon-ne Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se, unhon-ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se iske jaisi riwayat bayan ki."
"9","Yahya bin Yahyaa, Hasheem, Sulaiman taimii, abu-Usmaan nehdi se riwayat hai, kaha : Umar-bin Khattab (Raziallahu anhu) ne farmaya : aadmi ke liye jhoot se itna kafi hai (jis ki bina par wo jhoota qarar diya ja sakta hai) ke wo har suni hui baat bayan kar de."
"10","ibne- Wahab ne khabar di, kaha : Malik (bin Anas ( ne mujh se kaha : mujhey malum hai ke aisa aadmi ( sahi ( Salim nahi hota jo har suni hui baat ( aagey ( bayan kar de, wo kabhi imam nahi bin sakta ( jabke ( wo har suni hui baat ( aagey ( bayan kar deta hai."
"11","Muhammad-bin-Musanna , Abdur-Rehman , Sufiyan , Abu-Ishaq , abul-Ahwas ne Abdullah (bin Masood (Raziallahu anhu)) se riwayat ki, kaha : aadmi ke jhoot mein yahi kafi hai ke wo har suni hui baat bayan kar de."
"12","Muhammad-bin-Musanna ne kaha : maine Abdur-Rehman-bin-Mehdi se suna keh rahe they : aadmi us waqt tak imam nahi bin sakta ke log uski iqtida (pairvi) karein yahan tak ke wo suni-sunai kuchh baton (ko bayan karne) se baaz aa jaaey."
"13","Sufiyan bin Husain se riwayat hai ke Ayas bin Muawiya ne mujh se mutalba kya aur kaha, main tumhen dekhta hun tum Quran ke ilm se shadeed raghbat rakhtey ho tum mere samney aik sura padho aur uski tafseer karo taake jo tumhen ilm hai main bhi usey dekhun. kaha, maine aisa kya to unhon-ne mujh se farmaya jo baat main tum se kehney laga hun usey meri taraf se hamesha yad rakhna, na-pasandida (munkar) riwayat (ko bayan karne) se bachna ! kyonke aisa na honey ke barabar hai ke kisi ne ye kaam kya ho (munkar riwayat bayan kin) aur wo apni zaat mein zaleel ( na ( hua ho aur uski bayan ki hui hadis ko jhoota ( na ( samjha gaya ho."
"14","abu-Taahir, Hurmala bin Yahya , ibne- Wahab , Yunus , ibne-Shahab, Ubaidullah-bin-Abdullaah-bin-Utba, Hazrat Abdullah-bin-Masood (Raziallahu anhu) ne farmaya : tum kisi qaum ke samney aisi hadis bayan nahi kartey jis (ke sahi mafhoom ( tak unki aqlein nahi pahunch saktin magar wo unmein se kuchh ke liye fitney (ka sabab) bin jati hain."
"15","Muhammad-bin-Abdullah bin Numer , Zuhair-bin-Harab , Abdullah-bin Yazeed , Sad bin abi-Ayub , abu-Haani ne abu-Usmaan Muslim-bin Yasar se, unhon-ne Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se, unhon-ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat ki ke aap ne farmaya : meri ummat ke aakhiri zamaney mein aisey log hongey jo tumharey samney aisi hadisein bayan karengey jo na tumne suni hongi na tumharey bap-dada ne, tum is tarah ke logon se door rehna.'"
"16","Hurmala bin Yahya , Abdullah-bin Hurmala bin Imran tajeebii , ibne- Wahab , Sharaheel bin Yazeed kehtey hain : mujhey Muslim-bin Yasar ne bataya ke unhon-ne Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) ko ye kehtey huey suna ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : aakhiri zamaney main ( aisey ( dajjal ( faraib kaar ( kazzaab (bahut bade jhootey) hongey jo tumharey paas aisi hadisein laaengey jo na tum ne suni hongi aur na tumharey baap-dada ne. tum unse door rehna (kahin) wo tumhen gumrah na kar dein aur tumhen fitney mein na daal dein.'"
"17","abu-Saeed ashajj , Wakee, Aamash , Musaiyab bin Raafe, Aamir bin Abda se riwayat hai, kaha : Hazrat Abdullah-bin-Masood (Raziallahu anhu) ne farmaya : bila shubah shaitan kisi aadmi ki shakl ikhtiyar karta hai, phir logon ke paas aata hai aur unhein jhoot ( par mabni ( koi hadis sunata hai, phir wo bikhar jatey hain, unmein se koi aadmi kehta hai : maine aik aadmi se ( hadis) suni hai, main uska chehra to pehchanta hun par uska naam nahi janta, wo hadis suna raha tha."
"18","Muhammad-bin Raafe , Abdur-Razzaq , Mamar , ibne- Taaus , Taaus ne Hazrat Abdullah-bin Amr-bin-Aas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, kaha : samandar (ki teh ( mein bahut se shaitan qaid hain jinhein Hazrat Sulaiman ‌(al) ne baandha tha, waqt aa raha hai ke wo niklengey aur logon ke samney Quran padhengey."
"19","Muhammad-bin Ibad , Saeed-bin-Umar , ash-Asaa, ibne-Uena, Saeed, Sufiyan , Hisham bin Juhair ne Taaus se riwayat ki, kaha : ye (unki murad Basheer-bin-kab se thi) Hazrat Ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) ke paas aaya aur unhein hadisein sunaney laga, Ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) ne us se kaha : falan-falan hadis dohrao. us ne dohra dein, phir unke samney hadisein bayan kin. unhon-ne isse kaha : falan hadis dobara sunao. us ne unke samney dohraain, phir aap se kaha : main nahi janta ke aap ne meri ( bayan ki hui ( saari hadison pehchan li hain aur us hadis ko munkar jana hai ya sab ko munkar jana hai aur usey pehchan liya hai? Hazrat Ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) ne us se kaha : jab Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) par jhoot nahi bola jata tha ham Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se hadisein bayan kartey they, phir jab log (har ( mushkil aur aasan sawari par Sawar honey lagey ( bila tameez sahi w zaeef riwayat bayan karne lagey ( to ham ne ( seedhey-seedhey (aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se hadis bayan karna tark kar diya."
"20","Muhammad-bin Raafe , Abdur-Razzaq , ibne- Taaus , Taaus ke betey ne apne walid ( Taaus ( se, unhon-ne Hazrat Ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, unhon-ne kaha : ham Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki hadisein hifz kartey they aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se ( marwi) hadis ki hifazat ki jati thi magar jab se tum logon ne ( baghair tameez ke) har mushkil aur aasan par sawari shuru kar di to phir mamla hath se jata raha (yani phir hamne riwayat bayan karni band kari dii)."
"21","Mujahid se riwayat hai ke Bashir-bin-kab Adwi Hazrat Abdullah-bin-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) ke paas aaya aur us ne hadisein bayan kartey huey kehna shuru kar diya : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya, Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya, Hazrat Ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu)) ne ye rawaiya rakha ke) na usko dhyaan se suntey they na uski taraf dekhtey they. wo kehney laga : aey Ibne-Abbas ! mere sath kya ( mamla ( hai, mujhey nazar nahi aata ke aap meri ( bayan ki hui ( hadis sun rahe hain? mein aapko Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se hadis suna raha hun aur aap suntey hi nahi. Hazrat Ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) ne farmaya : aik waqt aisa tha ke jab ham kisi ko ye kehtey suntey : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya to hamari nazrein fauran uski taraf uth jaatiin aur ham kaan laga kar ghaur se uski baat suntey, phir jab logon ne ( bila tameez (har mushkil aur aasan par sawari ( shuru ( kar di to ham ne logon se koi hadis qabool na ki siwaey us ( hadis) ke jisey ham jantey they."
"22","ibne-abi-Mulaika se riwayat hai, kaha : maine Hazrat Abdullah-bin-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) ki taraf likha aur unse darkhaast ki ke wo mere liye aik kitab likhein aur (jin baton ki sihat mein koi shak ho ya jo na likhney ki hon wo) baatein mujh se chipa lein. unhon-ne farmaya : ladka khalis hadison ka talabgaar hai, main uske liye ( hadis se mutaalliq ( tamam maamlo mein) sahi ka ( intikhab karunga aur) mozu aur ghadi hui hadison ko) hata doonga (kaha : unhon-ne Hazrat Ali (Raziallahu anhu) ke faisley mangwaaey (aur unmein se cheezein likhnii shuru kiin aur (ye hua ke) koi cheez guzarti to farmatey : b-khudaa ! ye faisla Hazrat Ali (Raziallahu anhu) ne nahi kya, siwaey iske ke) khuda-n-khasta ( wo gumrah ho gaey hon (jab ke aisa nahi hua. ("
"23","Amr-Naqid, Sufiyan-bin-Uena, hishaam-bin-hujair, Taaus se riwayat hai, kaha : Hazrat Ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) ke paas aik kitab laai gaee jis mein Hazrat Ali (Raziallahu anhu) ke faisley ( likhe huey) they, to unhon-ne is qadr chhod kar baqi (sab kuchh ( mitaa diya aur Sufiyan-bin-Uena ne hath ( jitni lambai (ka ishara kya."
"24","Hasan-bin-Ali Hulwani , yahyaa-bin-aadam , ibne-Idrees , Aamash , Abu-Ishaq se riwayat hai, kaha : jab ( bazahir Hazrat Ali (Raziallahu anhu) ka naam leney waale) logon ne Hazrat Ali (Raziallahu anhu) ke baad (unke naam par) ye cheezein eiijaad kar lein to unke sathiyon mein se aik shakhs ne kaha : Allah un ( logon ( ko ghaarat karey! unhon-ne kaisa ( azimushshan ( ilm bigaad diya."
"25","Ali-bin-khashram , Abu-Bakar bin Ayash ne hamein bataya , kaha : maine Mughira se suna, farmatey they : Hazrat Ali (Raziallahu anhu) se marwi (bayan) hadison mein kisi cheez ki tasdeeq na ki jati thi, siwaey iske jo Abdullah-bin-Masood (Raziallahu anhu) ke shagirdon se riwayat ki gaee ho."
"26","Hasan-bin-Rabee, Hammad-bin-Zaid, Ayyoob, Hisham, Muhammad, Mina Fuzail, Hishaam, Makhlad-bin-Husain, Hishaam, unhon-ne Muhammad-bin Sirin se riwayat ki, ye ilme-deen hai, isliye (achi tarah) dekh lo ke tum kin logon se apna Deen akhaz kartey ho."
"27","Aasim ahwal ne Ibne-Sirin se riwayat ki, kaha : ( shuruati daur mein hadis ke aalim ( asnaad ke barey mein koi sawal na kartey they, jab fitna pad gaya to unhon-ne kaha : hamarey samney apne logon (hadees bayan karnewalon) ke naam lo taake ahale-sunnat ko dekh kar unse hadis li jaey aur ahale-bidat ko dekh kar unki hadis qabool na ki jaaey."
"28","Auzai ne Sulaiman-bin-Musa se riwayat ki, unhon-ne kaha, mein Taaus ‌ (Rahmatullahi-alaih) se mila aur unse kaha, mujhey falan shakhs ne is-is tarah hadis sunai. unhon kaha, agar tumharey sahib ( ustad ( poori tarah qaabile-bharosa hain to unse le-lo."
"29","Saeed-bin-Abdul-Azeez ne Sulaiman-bin-Musa se riwayat ki, unhon-ne kaha : maine Taaus ‌ (Rahmatullahi-alaih) se kaha : falan ne in-in alfaz se mujhey hadis sunai. unhon-ne kaha : agar tumharey sahib bharose mein poore hain to unse le-lo."
"30","( Abdur-Rehman ( bin-abii-Zanad ne apne walid se riwayat ki, kaha : main Madina mein sau (ahle-ilm) se mila jo ( Deen main to ( mehfooz w maamoon they ( lekin) unse hadis nahi li jati thin, kaha jata tha ye us (ilm (ke ahal nahin."
"31","Misar se riwayat hai, kaha : maine Sad bin Ibrahim (bin Abdur-Rehman-bin-Auf ( se suna, keh rahe they : qaabile-bharosa rawiyon ke ilawa aur koi shakhs Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se hadis bayan na kare."
"32","Muhammad-bin-Abdullah-bin-Qahzaad ne (jo marw ke baashindon mein se hain) kaha : maine Abdan-bin-Usman se suna, keh rahe they : maine Abdullah-bin-Mubarak (Raziallahu anhu) ko ye kehtey huey suna : asnaad (silsila sanad se hadis riwayat karna) Deen mein se hai. agar sanadon ka silsile na hota to jo koi jo kuchh chahta, keh deta (Imam Muslim (Rahmatullahi-alaih) ne) kaha : aur Muhammad-bin-Abdullah ne kaha : mujhey abbaas-bin-abi-razma ne hadis sunai, kaha : maine Abdullah (bin-Mubarak) ko ye kehtey huey suna : hamarey aur logon ke darmyan (faisla-kun cheez, bayan ki janey wali khabron ke) paaun, yani sanadein hain (jin par riwayat is tarah khadi hoti hain jis tarah jaandaar apne paon par khadey hotey hain) Muhammad (bin-Abdullah-bin-Qahzad) ne kaha maine Abu-Ishaq Ibrahim-bin-Esa Taliqani se suna, kaha : maine Abdullah-bin-Mubarak se kaha : abu-abdur-Rehmaan! (wo ( hadis kaisi hai jo (in alfaz mein) aai hai : neki ke baad (doosrii) neki ye hai ke tum apni Namaz ke sath apne waalidain ke liye Namaz padho aur apne rozon ke sath apne waalidain ke liye rozey rakho? kaha, Abdullah (bin-Mubarak) ne kaha : ye kis (ki sanad) se hai, kaha : maine kaha : ye Shahab-bin-Kharash ki (bayaan ki hui) hadis hai, unhon-ne kaha : qabile-bharosa hai, (phir) kis se? kaha : maine kaha : Hujjaj-bin-Dinar se kaha : qabile-bharosa hai (phir) kis se? kaha : maine kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya, kehney lagey : abu-Ishaq! Hujjaj-bin-Dinar aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke darmyan bahut dooriyaan hain jinko paar kartey huey oontniyon ki gardanein kat (kar gir) jati hain lekin sadqa (maiyat ke liye faayde-mand hai is) ke barey mein koi ikhtilaf nahin. muhammad ne kaha : maine Ali-bin-Shaqiq se suna keh rahe they : maine Abdullah-bin-Mubarak ko sab ke samney ye kehtey suna : Amr-bin-Sabit ki (riwayat ki hui) hadis tark kar do, kyonke wo salaf saaleheen ko gaaliyan diya karta thaa."
"33","abu-Nazar Hashim bin-Qasim ne hadis bayan ki, kaha : ham se Buhaiya ke Maula abu-Aqeel (Yahya-bin-Mutawakkil) ne hadis bayan ki, kaha : main Qasim-bin-Ubaidullah (bin-Abdullaah-bin-umar jinki walida umme-Abdullah-bint-Qasim-bin-Muhammad-bin-abi-Bakr thin) aur Yahya-bin-Saeed ke paas betha hua tha ke Yahya ne Qasim-bin-Ubaidullah se kaha : janab abu-Muhammad ! aap jaisi shakhsiyat ke liye ye aib hai, bahut badi baat hai ke aap se is Deen ke kisi mamley ke barey mein) kuchh ( puchha jaey aur aap ke paas iske hawale se na ilm ho na koi hal ya (ye alfaz kahey ( na ilm ho na nikalney ki koi raah. to Qasim ne unse kaha : kis wjah se? (Yahya ne) kaha : kyonke aap hidayat ke 2 imamon Abu-Bakar aur umr (Raziallahu anhu) ke farzand hain. kaha : Qasim usse kehney lagey : jis shakhs ko Allah ki taraf se aql mili ho, uske nazdeek us se bhi bd-tar baat ye hai ke main ilm ke baghair kuchh keh dun ya usse riwayat karun jo qaabile-bharosa na ho. (ye sun kar yahyaa) khamosh ho gaey aur unhein koi jawab nahi diya."
"34","Bishr-bin-hakam abdii ne mujh se bayan kya, kaha : maine Sufiyan-bin-Uena se suna, keh rahe they : mujh se bahut se logon ne Buhaiya ke Maula abu-Aqeel se (sun kar) riwayat ki ke (kuchh) logon ne Hazrat Abdullah-bin-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) ke aik betey se koi baat poochhi jiske barey mein unke ilm mein kuchh na tha to Yahya-bin-Saeed ne unse kaha : main usko bahut badi baat samajhta hun ke aap jaisey insan se (jabke aap hidayat ke 2 imaamon yani umr aur ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) ke betey hain, koi baat poochhi jaey (aur) iske barey mein aapko kuchh ilm na ho. unhon-ne kaha : ba-khuda ! Allah ke nazdeek aur us shakhs ke nazdeek jisey Allah ne aql di us se bhi badi baat ye hai ke main ilm ke baghair kuchh kahun ya kisi aisey shakhs se riwayat karun jo qaabile-bharosa nahi. (sufiyaan ne) kaha : abu-Aqeel Yahya-bin-Mutawakkil (bhi) unke paas maujood they jab unhon-ne ye baat ki."
"35","Yahya-bin-Saeed ne kaha : maine Sufiyan Sory , Shoba , Malik aur ibne-Uena se aisey aadmi ke barey mein puchha jo hadis mein pori tarah qaabile-bharosa na ho, phir koi aadmi aaey aur mujh se iske barey mein sawal karey? to un sab ne kaha : iske barey mein bata do ke wo poori tarah qaabile-bharosa nahi hai."
"36","Nazar kehtey hain ke Ibne-Aun se Shahar (bin Hoshab ( ki hadis ke barey mein sawal kya gaya, (us waqt) wo (apnii) dahleez par khadey they, wo kehney lagey : unhon (muhaddeseen) ne yaqinan «Shahar» ko matoon (malamati) thehraya hai, Imam Muslim (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha : logon ki zabanon ne unhein nishana banaya, unke barey mein baatein kin."
"37","hamein Shababa ne bataya , kaha : Shoba ne kaha : main ( Shahar ( se mila lekin (riwaayat hadis ke hawale se) maine unhein ahmiyat nahi di."
"38","Abdullah-bin-Mubarak ne kaha : maine Sufiyan Sory se arz kya : bila shubah Ibaad-bin-Kaseer aisa hai jiska haal aapko malum hai. jab wo hadis bayan karta hai to badi baat karta hai, kya aap ki raey hai ke main logon se keh diya karun is se ( hadis) na lo ? Sufiyan kehney lagey : kyon nahi ! Abdullah ne kaha : phir ye ( mera mamool (routine) (ho gaya ke jab main kisi ( ilmi ( majlis mein hota jahan Ibad ka zikr hota to main Deen ke hawale se uski tareef karta aur) sath ye bhi) kehta is se ( hadis) na lo. ham se Muhammad ne bayan kya, kaha : ham se Abdullah-bin-Usman ne bayan kya, kaha : mere walid ne kaha : Abdullah-bin-Mubarak ne kaha : main Shoba tak pahuncha to unhon-ne ( bhi) kaha : ye Ibaad-bin-Kaseer hai tum log us se ( hadis bayan karne mein) ehtiyat karo"
"39","Fazal-bin-Sahal ne bataya , kaha : maine Mu-alla Razi se Muhammad-bin-Saeed ke barey mein, jis se Ibaad-bin-Kaseer ne riwayat ki, puchha to unhon-ne mujhey Esa-bin-Yonus ke hawale se bayan kya, kaha : main iske darwazey par tha, Sufiyan uske paas maujood they jab wo bahar nikal gaya to maine un ( Sufiyan ( se iske barey mein puchha to unhon-ne mujhey bataya ke wo bahut bada jhoota hai."
"40","Muhammad-bin-abi-Itab ne kaha : mujh se Affaan ne Muhammad-bin Yahya-bin-Saeed qattaan se hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne apne walid se riwayat ki, kaha : ham ne nek logon ( soofiya ( ko hadis se badh kar kisi aur cheez mein jhoot bolney wala nahi paya. ibne-abi Attab ne kaha : main Muhammad-bin Yahya-bin-Saeed qattaan se mila to us ( baat ke) barey mein poochha, unhon-ne apne walid se riwayat kartey huey kaha : tum ahle-khair (parhezgaron) ko hadis se zyada kisi aur cheez mein jhoota nahi paogey Imam Muslim ne kaha ke Yahya-bin-Saeed ne farmaya : unki zaban par jhoot jari ho jata hai, wo jaan-bojh kar jhoot nahi boltey."
"41","Khalifa-bin-Musa ne khabar di, kaha : main Ghalib-bin-Ubaidullah ke yahan aaya to usne mujhey likhwana shuru kya : Mak-hool ne mujh se hadis bayan ki, Mak-hool ne mujh se hadis bayan ki. usi beech mein peshab ne usey majbur kya to wo uth gaya, maine (jo ( uski copy dekhi to is mein is tarah tha : mujhey Aban ne Anas se ye hadis sunai, Aban ne falan se hadis riwayat ki. is par maine usey chhod diya aur uth khada hua. (Imam Muslim ne kaha : (aur maine Hasan-bin-Ali Hulwani se suna, keh rahe they : maine Affaan ki kitab mein abu-miqdaam Hisham ki (wo) riwayat dekhi (jo Umar-bin Abdul-Azeez ki hadis hai) (us mein tha :) Hisham ne kaha : mujh se aik shakhs ne jisey Yahya-bin-fulan kaha jata tha, Muhammad-bin-Kab se hadis bayan ki, kaha : maine Affaan se kaha : ( ahale-ilm ( kehtey hain : Hisham ne ye ( hadis) Muhammad-bin-Kab se suni thi. to wo kehney lagey : wo ( Hisham ( usi hadis ki wjah se fitney mein padey . (pahley ( wo kaha kartey they : mujhey Yahya ne Muhammad (bin Kab) se riwayat ki, uske baad ye dawa kar diya ke unhon-ne ye (hadees barahe-rast) Muhammad se suni hai."
"42","mujhey Muhammad-bin-Abdullah Qohzaz ne hadis sunai, kaha : maine Abdullah-bin-Usman bin Jabla se suna, keh rahe they : maine Abdullah-bin-Mubarak se kaha : ye kon hai jis se aap ne Abdullah-bin-Amr (Raziallahu anhu) ki hadis : Eidul-fitr ka din inaamaat ka din hai. riwayat ki? kaha : Sulaiman-bin Hajjaj, unmein se jo (hadisein) tum ne apne paas (likh ( rakhi hain (ya maine tumhen uski jo hadisein di hain) unmein (achchhi tarah) nazar karna (ghaur kar lena) ibne-Quhzaz ne kaha : maine Wahab-bin-Zama se suna, wo Sufiyaan-bin-Abdul-Malik se riwayat kar rahe they, kaha : Abdullah, yani ibne-Mubarak ne kaha : maine aik dirham ke barabar khoon wali hadis ke rawi Rooh-bin-Ghutaif ko dekha hai. main uske sath aik majlis mein betha to main apne sathiyon se sharm mehsus kar raha tha ke wo mujhey us se hadis bayan karne ke na-pasandida honey ke bawajud iske sath betha dekhein ( uski hadis na-pasandidgi ki wjah se aur uski riwayat mein na maqbooli ki wjah se)"
"43","ibne-Qohzaz ne kaha, maine Wahab se suna, unhon-ne Sufiyan se aur unhon-ne Abdullah-bin-Mubarak se riwayat ki, kaha : Baqiiya zaban ke sachey hain lekin wo har aaney janey waley ( ilme-hadees mein maharat rakhney waley aur na rakhney waley har shakhs) se hadis ley letey hain."
"44","Qutaiba-bin-Saeed, Jarir ne Mughira se, unhon-ne Shabi se riwayat ki, kaha : mujhey Haris Aawar Hamdani ne hadis sunai aur wo kazzaab tha."
"45","abu-Aamir Abdullah-bin Baraad-Ashari, abu-Usama , Mufazzal-bin-Mughira se riwayat ki, kaha : maine Shabi ko kehtey huey suna : mujh se Haris Aawar ne riwayat bayan ki aur (ye ke) wo gawahi detey hain ke wo ( Haris ( jhooton mein se aik tha."
"46","Qutaiba-bin-Saeed, jareer, Mughira ne Ibrahim se riwayat ki, kaha : Alqama ne kaha : maine 2 saal mein Quran padha (ghaur-fikr kartey huey khatm kya.) to Haris ne kaha : Quran aasan hai, wahi us se zyada mushkil hai."
"47","Hajjaaj-bin Shaair , Ahmed bin Yunus ne Ibrahim Nakhai se riwayat ki ke Haris ( Aawar ( ne kaha : maine Quran teen saal mein seekha aur wahi 2 saal main (ya kaha ( : wahi teen saal main aur Quran 2 saal mein."
"48","Mansoor aur Mughira ne Ibrahim se riwayat ki ke Haris muttahim rawi hai"
"49","Hamza Zayyat se riwayat hai, kaha : Murra Hamdani ne Haris se koi baat suni to us se kaha : tum darwazey hi par baitho (andar na aao ( . phir wo ( ghar mein) dakhil huey aur apni talwaar utha li to Haris ne bura anjam mehsus kar liya aur chal diya."
"50","( Abdullah (bin Aun se riwayat hai, kaha : Ibrahim ( Nakhai ( ne ham se kaha : tum log Mughira bin Saeed aur abu abdur-Raheem se bach kar raho, wo kazzaab hain"
"51","hamein Aasim ne hadis bayan ki, kaha : ham bilkul nau (9) umr ladkey they jo abu Abdur-Rehman Salma ke paas hazir hotey they, wo ham se kaha kartey they : abu-Ahwas ke siwa doosrey qissa go'on (waaizon) ki majlison mein mat baitho aur Shaqiq se bach kar raho. Shaqiq khawaarij ka nuqta nazar rakhta tha, ye abu-waayel nahi (balke Shaqiq zabi hai.)"
"52","Jarir kehtey hain : main jaabir-bin-Yazeed jau'fii se mila to maine us se hadis na likhi , wo raj'at (nabi ya imam ke dobara lautkar aane ke aqeede) par eman rakhta tha."
"53","Misar ne kaha : ham se jaabir-bin-Yazeed (jau'fii) ne un bid'aton se pahley, jo us ne ghadiin, hadis bayan ki."
"54","Sufiyan ne kaha : Jaabir ne jis ( aqeedey (ka izhar kya uske izhar se pahley log us se hadis letey they, jab us ne apna aqeeda zahir kar diya to logon ne usey uski (bayaan ki hui) hadis ke barey mein laanat-malaamat ki aur kuchh ne usey chhod diya. unse puchha gaya is ne kis cheez ka izhar kya tha? kaha raj'at (kisi Nabi ya imam ke dobara lautkar aane ke aqeede) par eman kaa."
"55","jarraah-bin-maleeh kehtey hain : maine jaabir-bin-Yazeed ( jau'fii ( ko ye kehtey suna : mere paas abu-Jafar ( Muhammad baaqar-bin-Ali-bin-husain-bin-Ali (Raziallahu anhu)) ki 70 hazaar hadisein hain jo sab ki sab Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se (riwaayat ki gai) hain."
"56","Zuhair kehtey hain : Jaabir ne kaha ya maine Jaabir (bin Yazeed ( ko ye kehtey suna : bila shubah mere paas pachaas hazaar hadisein ( aisi ( hain jin mein se maine koi hadis bayan nahi ki, phir aik din us ne aik hadis bayan ki aur kaha : ye (un ( pachaas hazaar hadison mein se (eik ( hai."
"57","Salaam-bin abi mutee' kehtey hain : maine Jaabir jau'fii ko ye kehtey suna : mere paas Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se (riwaayat ki hui ( pachaas hazaar ahaadeesein hain."
"58","Sufiyan (bin Uena ( ne kaha : maine aik aadmi se suna, us ne Jaabir se irshaad-rabbaanii : فلن أبرح الأرض حتى يأذن لي أبي أو يحكم الله لي وهو خير الحاكمينab mein us zamin se hargiz na hiloonga yahan tak ke mera bap mujhey ijazat de ya Allah mere liye faisla kar de aur wo sab faisla karne walon se behtar hai."" ke barey mein sawal kya"
"59","Sufiyan se riwayat hai, kaha : maine Jaabir ko taqriban tees hazaar hadisein bayan kartey huey suna hai. main unmein se aik hadis bayan karna bhi halal nahi samajhta , chahey (iske badley ( mere liye itna aur itna ho. (imaam) Muslim ne kaha : maine Abu-Ghassan Muhammad-bin Amr Razi se suna, kaha : maine Jarir bin abdul-Hameed se poochha, maine kaha : (ye jo ( Haris bin haseera hai, aap us se miley hain? kaha : haan, lambi khamoshi wala boodha hai. aik bahut badi baat par israar karta hai."
"60","Abdur-Rehman-bin-Mehdi ne Hammad-bin-Zaid se riwayat ki, kaha : Ayub ne aik din aik shakhs ka zikr kya aur kaha : wo zaban ka jhoota (tohmat lagaanewaalaa aur bd-zabaani karnewaala) tha aur doosrey ka zikr kya to kaha : wo raqam (cheezon par likhi hui qeemat) mein izafa kar deta tha."
"61","Sulaimaan-bin-Harab ne kaha : hamein Hammad-bin-Zaid ne bayan kya, kaha : Ayub ne kaha : mera aik padausi hai, phir (parhezgaarii mein) uski fazeelat ka zikr kya, agar wo mere samney 2 khajhooron ke barey mein gawahi de to main (is mein bhi) uski shahadat qaabile-qabool na samjhoonga."
"62","Mamar ne kaha, maine Ayub ko kabhi kisi ki peeth peechhey usey bura kehtey nahi suna, siwaey abdul-kareem, yani abu-Umayya ke. unhon-ne iska zikr kya to kaha, Allah is par raham karey, ghair qaabile-bharosa hai, usne mujhse Ikrima se riwayat ki gaee aik hadis ke barey mein sawal kya, phir (logon se) kaha : maine Ikrima se suna hai."
"63","Affaan-bin-Muslim ne kaha : Hammam ne ham se bayan kya, kaha : Abu-Dawud aama hamarey yahan aaya aur ye kehna shuru kar diya : hamein Bara (Raziallahu anhu) ne hadis sunai aur hamein Zaid-bin-Arqam (Raziallahu anhu) ne hadis bayan ki. ham ne ye baat Qatada ko batai , unhon-ne kaha is ne jhoot bola. us ne unse nahi suna, wo to aik mangtaa tha, aur taaoon (ek tarah ki bimari ke dauraan) mein logon ke samney hath phailaataa phirtaa tha."
"64","Yazid-bin-Harun ne kaha : hamein Hammam ne khabar di ke Abu-Dawud aama Qatada ke yahan aaya, jab wo khada hua (aur chala gaya) to logon ne kaha : usey ye zaum hai ke usne atthaara Badri sahaba se mulaqat ki. is par Qatada kehney lagey : (taaoon ki) wabaaey-aam se pahley ye aik mangtaa tha, iska (ilme-hadees) aisi kisi cheez se koi sarokaar na tha, wo us barey mein baat tak na karta tha. ba-khuda na Hasan (Basrii) ne (kabhii) kisi Badri se bilaa-waasta hadis hamein sunai, na Saeed-bin-Musaiyab ne aik sa'd-bin-maalik (Raziallahu anhu) ke siwa kisi aur Badri se baraahe-raast suni hui koi hadis sunai."
"65","Jarir ne raqba (bin masqala bin-Abdullah abdii koofii (Rahmatullahi-alaih) Jaleelul-qadr taaba'ii) se riwayat ki ke abu-Jafar ( abdullaah-bin-mas'ood-bin-a'un-bin-ja'far-bin-abii taalib) haashmii madaainii hadison ghadaa karta tha, sachchai (ya hikmat) par mabni kalam (pesh kartaa) wo kalam Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke faraameen mein se na hota tha lekin usey wo Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat karta tha."
"66","Abu-Dawud Tiyalisi ne Shoba se, unhon-ne yoonus-bin-ubaid se riwayat kartey huey bayan kya, (yoonus ne) kaha : Amr-bin-Ubaid (ma'roof moa'tazilii jo pahley Hazrat hasan-Basrii ki majlis mein hazir raha karta tha) hadis (ki riwaayat) mein jhoot bola karta tha."
"67","Muaaz-bin-Muaaz kehtey hain : maine Auf-bin-abii jameela se kaha : Amr-bin-Ubaid ne Hazrat Hasan Basri se (riwaayat kartey huey) ye hadis sunai : jisne ham par hathiyar uthaya to wo ham mein se nahi. unhon-ne kaha : b-khudaa ! Amr ne (is hadis ki riwayat Hasan Basri ki taraf mansub karne mein) jhoot bola lekin wo chahta hai ke us ( sahi hadis) ko apni jhooti baat se mila de."
"68","Ubaidullah-bin-Umar qawaareerii ne kaha : ham se Hammad-bin-Zaid ne bayan kya, kaha : aik aadmi tha, wo Ayub sakhtiyan ki ilmi majlis mein betha karta tha aur unse hadisein suna karta tha. Ayub ne usey ghair hazir pa kar uske barey mein puchha to logon ne bataya : janab Abu-Bakar (Ayyoob ki kunniyat)! wo Amr-bin-Ubaid se munsalik ho gaya hai. Hammad ne kaha : aik din mein Ayub ke sath tha, ham subah sawerey bazar ki taraf gaey to us aadmi ne Ayub ka istiqbaal kya. Ayub ne usey salam kaha aur (haal ahwaal) poochha, phir Ayub kehney lagey : mujhey ye baat pahunchi hai ke tum us aadmi ke sath jud gaey ho. Hammad ne kaha : unhon-ne iska, yani Amr ka naam liya. wo kehney laga : haan, janab Abu-Bakr! wo ajeeb w ghareeb baatein (jinhein koi nahi jaantaa) hamarey samney laataa hai. kaha : Ayub us se kehney lagey : ham unhi ajeebo-ghareeb baton se bhaagtey hain ya dartey hain (ke ye jhooti aur man-ghadat hoti hain.)"
"69","Sulaimaan-bin-Harab ne kaha : ham se ibne-zaid , yani Hammad ne bayan kya, kaha : Ayub se puchha gaya : Amr-bin-Ubaid ne Hazrat Hasan Basri se riwayat bayan ki hai (ke unhon-ne ( kaha : jisey nabeez ( sharab ( se nasha ho jaey usey kode na maarey jaaein. to unhon-ne ( Ayub sakhtiyan ( ne kaha is ne jhoot bola, maine ( khud) Hasan se suna, wo kehtey they : jisey nabeez se nasha ho jaey usey kode maarey jaaein."
"70","Salaam-bin abi mutee' kehtey hain. janab Ayub sakhtiyan ko ye khabar pahunchi ke main Amr (bin Ubaid (ke yahan ( dars mein) jata hun to aik din wo mere paas aaey aur kaha, tum ne ghaur kya aik aisa aadmi aaya jiske Deen par tumhen eitibaar na ho, tum uski hadis par kaisey aitimad karogey !"
"71","Sufiyan ne bayan kya, kaha : maine abu-Musa ( Israel bin-Musa Basri , nazeel hind) se suna, keh rahe they : hamein Amr-bin-Ubaid ne bidat ka shikar honey se pahley hadis sunai."
"72","Muaz Anbari ne kaha : maine waasit ke qazi abu-Sheba ke barey mein malum karne ke liye Shoba ki taraf likha to unhon-ne jawab mein meri taraf likh bheja , us se koi cheez riwayat na karo aur mera khat phaad do."
"73","Affaan (bin-Muslim ( ne kaha : maine Hammaad-bin-Salma ko Saaleh-murrii ke waastey se aik hadis sunai jo usney Sabit se riwayat ki to unhon-ne ( Hammad ( kaha is ne jhoot bola. (usi tarah) maine Hammam ko Saaleh-murrii se aik hadis sunai to unhon-ne bhi kaha is ne jhoot bola."
"74","Abu-Dawud ne bayan kya, kaha : Shoba ne mujh se kaha : Jareer-bin-Haazim ke paas jao aur us se kaho : tumharey liye halal nahi ke tum Hasan-bin-Umaara se ( hadis) riwayat karo kyonke wo jhoot boltaa hai. Abu-Dawud ne kaha : maine Shoba se kaha : wo kaisey ? to unhon-ne kaha is ne hamein Hakam se (riwaayat ki hui ( hadison sunain jinki ham ne asl na paai . (kaha ( maine kaha : kya cheez riwayat ki? kaha : maine Hakam se kaha : kya Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Uhud ke shaheedon ki namaaze-janaaza ada farmaaii? to unhon-ne jawab diya : aap ne unki namaaze-janaaza nahi padhi ( jabke ( Hasan-bin-Umaara ne Hakam hi se Miqsam ke hawale se Ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) se ye riwayat bayan ki ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unki namaaze-janaaza padhi aur unhein dafn kya. (usi tarah) maine Hakam se puchha : aap zina se paida hui aulad ke barey mein kya kehtey hain? kaha : unka janaaza padha jaeyga maine puchha : ye riwayat kis hawale se bayan ki jati hai, kaha : Hazrat Hasan Basri se ( jabke ( Hasan-bin-Umaara ne kaha : ham se Hakam ne Yahyaa-bin-Jazaar ke hawale se ye riwayat Hazrat Ali (Raziallahu anhu) se bayan ki."
"75","Hasan Hulwani ne kaha : maine Yazid-bin-Harun se suna, unhon-ne Ziyaad-bin-Memoon ka zikr kartey huey kaha : maine Halaf uthaya hai ke main us se aur Khalid-bin mahdooj se kabhi riwayat na karunga (aur kaha : ( mein Ziyaad-bin-Memoon se mila, us se aik hadis sunaney ka kaha to usne mujhey wo hadis Bakr Muzni se riwayat karke sunai, phir ( kuchh waqt baad) mein dobara uske paas gaya to usne wahi hadis muwarriq se bayan ki, phir aik baar aur uske paas gaya to usne wahi hadis Hasan ( Basri) se sunai. wo ( Yazid-bin-Harun ( un donon ( Ziyaad-bin-Memoon aur Khalid-bin mahdooj ( ko jhoot ki taraf mansub kartey they. Hulwani ne kaha : maine Abdus-Samad se hadis suni aur unke samney Ziyaad-bin-Memoon ka zikr kya to unhon-ne uski nisbat jhoot ki taraf ki."
"76","Mehmood-bin Ghelaan ne kaha : maine Abu-Dawud Tiyalisi se kaha : aap ne Ibaad-bin-Mansoor se bahut zyada riwaayatein li hain, phir kya hua ke aap ne utara wali riwayat jo Nazar-bin-Shumail ne hamarey samney bayan ki, unse nahi sunii? unhon-ne mujh se kaha : khamosh raho, main aur Abdur-Rehman-bin-Mehdi Ziyaad-bin-Memoon se miley aur us se poochhtey huey kaha : ye hadison jo tum Hazrat Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat kartey ho (kya hain?) to wo kehney laga : tum donon dekho ke aik aadmi gunah karta hai, phir tauba kar leta hai to kya Allah uski tauba qabool nahi karta ! kaha : ham ne kaha : haan. usne kaha : maine un ( hadison ( mein se Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se kuchh nahi suna, na kam na zyada , agar log nahi jantey to (kya) tum donon bhi nahi jantey ke main Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se nahi milaa!  Abu-Dawud ne kaha : phir hamein ye khabar pahunchi ke wo ( wahi ( riwaayatein bayan karta hai to main aur Abdur-Rehman uske paas aaey to wo kehney laga : main tauba karta hun, phir iske baad bhi wo wahi hadisein bayan karta tha to ham ne usey (iske haal par) chhod diya."
"77","Hasan Hulwani ne bayan kya, kaha : maine Shababaa se suna (kaha : Abdul-Quddoos hamarey samney hadis bayan karta tha aur kehta tha : Suwed-bin-Aqla) Shababaa ne kaha : maine Abdul-Quddoos se suna, kehta tha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne, 'Rauh ko zameen,' banaaney se mana farmaya hai (kahaa) us se kaha gaya : iska kya matlab hai? to usne kaha : matlab ye hai ke diwar mein suraakh rakha jaey taake usmein hawa dakhil ho. (imaam) Muslim ne kaha : maine Ubaidullah-bin-Umar qawaareerii se suna, keh rahe they : maine Hammad-bin-Zaid se suna, wo (Mahdii-bin-Hilaal ke ilmi majlis lagaane ke kuchh din baad) aik aadmi se keh rahe they : ye namkeen chashma kya hai jo aap ki taraf se phootaa hai? usne kaha : haan , aey abu-Ismaaiil! (aap ki baat theek hai)."
"78","Affaan ne kaha : maine abu-Awana se suna, kaha : mujhey Hasan ( Basri) se koi hadis na pahunchi magar main usey Abaan-bin-abii-Ayaash ke paas ley gaya to usne usey mere samney padha ."
"79","Ali-bin-Mus-hir ne bayan kya, kaha : maine aur Hamza Zayyat ne Abaan-bin-abii-Ayaash se taqriban aik hazaar hadison sunein . Ali ne kaha : phir ( kuchh waqt baad) mein Hamza se mila to usne mujhey bataya ke usne khuwab main Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko dekha to wo hadison jo Aban se suni thin aap ki khidmat mein pesh kin. aap ne unmein bahut maamooli hissey , panch ya chh hadison ke siwa kisi cheez ko na pehchaana ."
"80","Zakariiyaa-bin Adi ne kaha : mujh se Abu-Ishaq fazari ne kaha : Baqiiya se wahi hadison likho jo usney Maruf logon se riwayat ki hain, wo na likho jo usney ghair Maruf logon se riwayat ki hain aur Ismail bin Ayash se, jo usney Maruf logon se riwayat kiin ya ghair Maruf se, kuchh na likho ."
"81","Ishaq-bin-Ibrahim Hanzali ne bayan kya, kaha : maine Abdullah ke ashaab ( shaagirdon) mein se aik se suna, kaha : ibne-Mubarak ne farmaya : Baqiiya achchha aadmi hai agar ye naamon ko kunniyaton se badal deta aur kunniyaton ko naamon se. wo aik zamaney tak hamein abu-Saeed w haazii se riwaayatein sunata raha, ham ne achi tarah ghaur kya to wo Abdul-Quddoos nikla ."
"82","Abdur-Razzaq kehtey hain : maine ibne-Mubarak ko) aisa kartey ( nahi dekha ke wo khul kar apni ye baat ( raey ( keh dein ke falan jhoota hai, siwaey Abdul-Quddoos ke. maine unhein khud ye kehtey suna ke wo jhoota hai."
"83","Abdullah-bin Abdur-Rehman Darmi ne mujh se bayan kya, kaha : maine abu-Naeem se suna (aur unhon-ne Mu-allaa-bin-Irfaan ka zikr kya (aur kaha : usne kaha : ham se abu-Waail ne bayan kya, kaha : safain mein ibne-Masood (Raziallahu anhu) hamarey samney nikley to abu-Naeem ne kaha : unke barey mein tumhari raey hai ke wo maut ke baad dobara zinda ho gaey they?"
"84","Affaan-bin-Muslim se riwayat hai, kaha : ham Ismaaeel-bin-Ulaih ke yahan they, to aik aadmi ne aik doosrey aadmi se riwayat ( bayan ( ki. maine kaha : wo mazbut (qaabile-bharosa ke jaisa) nahi. to us aadmi ne kaha : tum ne uski gheebat ki hai. Ismail kehney lagey : unhon-ne uski gheebat nahi ki balke Hukm (faisla) bayan kya hai wo (sabt) nahi hai."
"85","Bishr-bin-Umar ne ham se bayan kya, kaha : maine imam Malik-bin-Anas se Muhammad-bin Abdur-Rehman ke barey mein puchha jo Saeed-bin-Musaiyab se hadison riwayat karta hai to unhon-ne kaha : wo qaabile-bharosa nahi. maine Malik-bin-Anas se abu-Huwairis ke barey mein sawal kya to unhon-ne farmaya : wo qaabile-bharosa nahi. ( phir ( maine unse us Shoba ke barey mein sawal kya jis se ibne-abi-Ze-ib riwayat kartey hain to farmaya : wo qaabile-bharosa nahi. maine unse Saleh Maula Tawaama ke barey mein sawal kya to kaha : qaabile-bharosa nahi. maine unse haram bin Usman ke barey mein puchha to farmaya : qaabile-bharosa nahi. maine Imam Malik se un panchon ke barey mein poochha, unhon-ne farmaya : ye sab hadis ke bayan karne mein qaabile-bharosa nahi. maine unse aik aur shakhs ke barey mein puchha jiska ( ab ( mein naam bhool gaya hon to unhon-ne kaha : kya tum ne meri kitaabon mein iska naam dekha hai. maine kaha : nahi. farmaya : agar qaabile-bharosa hota to tum iska zikr meri kitaabon mein dekhtey ."
"86","ham se Hajjaj ne bayan kya, kaha : ham se ibne-abi-Ze-ib ne Shurehbil bin Sad ke hawale se hadis bayan ki aur wo muttahim (Jis par jhoot ka ilzam laga ho) thaa."
"87","Abu-Ishaq Taliqani kehtey hain : maine Abdullah-bin-Mubarak se suna, keh rahe they : (eik waqt tha) agar mujhey ikhtiyar diya jata ke jannat mein dakhil hon ya Abdullah-bin muharrir se miloon to main iska intikhab karta ke pahley mein us se mil loon phir jannat mein jaunga, phir jab maine usey dekh liya to iske muqaabley mein aik mengni bhi mujhey zyada behtar lagi"
"88","Waleed-bin-Saaleh ne bayan kya, kaha : Ubaidullaah-bin-Amr ne kaha : Zaid , yani ibne-abi Aneesa ne kaha : mere bhai ( Yahya-bin-abi-Unaisa ( se riwayat na lo."
"89","Abdullah-bin Jafar Raqii ne Ubaidullaah-bin-Amr ke hawale se bayan kya, kaha : Yahya-bin-abi-Unaisa jhoota tha."
"90","Hammad-bin-Zaid se riwayat hai, kaha : Ayub sakhtiyan ke samney Farqad ka zikr kya gaya to unhon-ne kaha : Farqad hadis (ki maharat rakhney) wala nahi."
"91","mujh se Abdur-Rehman bin Bishr abdii ne bayan kya, kaha : maine Yahya-bin-Saeed qattaan se suna, jab unke samney Muhammad-bin-Abdullah bin Ubaid-bin-Umair Lesi ka zikr kya gaya to unhon-ne usey intihai zaeef qarar diya. (imaam) Yahya se kaha gaya : haan. phir kaha : main nahi samajhta ke koi aik insan bhi Muhammad-bin-Abdullah bin Ubaid-bin-Umair se riwayat kar sakta hai."
"92","Bishr-bin-hakam ne bayan kya, kaha : maine Yahya-bin-Saeed qattaan se suna, unhon-ne Hakeem-bin-Jubair aur Abdul-Aala ko zaeef qarar diya aur (usi tarah) Yahya ne Moosaa-bin-Diinaar ko bhi zaeef qarar diya (aur ( kaha : uski ( bayan ki hui ( hadis hawa (jaisii) hai aur Moosaa-bin-dahqaan aur Esa abi Esa madni ko) bhi) zaeef qarar diya. kaha : aur maine Hasan-bin- Esa se suna, keh rahe they : mujh se ibne-Mubarak ne farmaya : tum jab Jarir ke paas pahuncho to teen ( rawiyon ( ki hadison ke siwa iska Sara ilm likh lenaa. Ubaida-bin mau'tab , Sirii-bin Ismail aur Muhammad-bin-Saalim ki hadisein us se na likhnaa. ‏‏‏‏ Imaam Muslim (Rahmatullahi-alaih) ne kaha : aur uske jaisi jo ham ne zikr kya ahale-hadees ka kalam muttahim rawiyon main aur unke uyoob bahut hain jiske bayan karne se kitab lambi ho jaeygi aur jis qadr ham ne bayan kya wo kafi hai us shakhs ke liye jo qaum ka mazhab samajh bojh jaey. ‏‏‏‏ aur hadison ke imaamon ne rawiyon ka aib khol dena zaroori samjha aur is baat ka fatwa diya. jab unse puchha gaya isliye ke ye bada aham kaam hai. kyonke Deen ki baat jab naql ki jaeygi to wo kisi baat ke halal honey ke liye hogi ya haram honey ke liye ya usmein kisi baat ka hukm hoga ya kisi baat ki manaahii hogi ya kisi kaam ki taraf raghbat dilai jaey ya kisi kaam se daraayaa jaaeyga.bahar-haal jab rawi sachcha aur amaanatdaar na ho phir us se koi riwayat karey jo iske haal ko janta ho aur wo haal doosrey se bayan na karey jo na janta ho to gunahgaar hoga aur dhokaa dene wala hoga aam musalmanon ko. isliye ke kuchh log un hadison ko sunengey aur un sab par ya kuchh par amal karengey aur shayad wo sab ya unmein se aksar jhooti hun. (aur kuchh nuskhon mein ye hai ke unmein kam ya bahut jhooti hon) jinki asl na ho halanke sahi hadisein qaabile-bharosa logon ki aur jinki riwayat par qanaa'at ho sakti hai kya kam hain ke be-eitibaar aur jinki riwayat par qanaa'at nahi ho sakti unki riwayaton ki zarurat padey. Mina aur main samajhta hun ke jin logon ne us qism ki zaeef hadisein aur majhool sanadein naql ki hain aur unmein masroof hain aur wo jantey hain unki kamzori ko, to unki gharaz ye hai ke Awam ke nazdeek apna kasarate-ilm Sabit karein aur isliye ke log kahin sub'haan Allaah! falan shakhs ne kitni zyada hadisein jama ki hain. aur jis shakhs ki ye chaal hai aur iska ye tariqa hai, uska ilm, hadis mein kuchh nahi aur wo jaahi kahlaaney ka zyada haqdaar hai aalim kahlaaney se. ‏‏‏‏ Imaam Muslim (Rahmatullahi-alaih) farmatey hain ke hamarey zamane mein kuchh aisey logon ne jinhoney jhoot-moot apne aapko muhaddis qarar diya hai, beech ki sihat mein aik qaul bayan kya hai. agar ham bilkul usko naql na karein aur uska radd na likhein to umda tajwiz hogi aur theek rasta hoga isliye ke ghalat baat ki taraf tawajjoh na karna usko mitaaney ke liye aur uske kehney waley ka naam khodney ke liye behtar hai aur munasib hai jaahilon ke liye taake unko khabar bhi na ho us ghalat baat ki magar us wjah se ke ham anjam ki burai se dartey hain aur ye baat dekhtey hain ke jaahi nai baat par farefta ho jatey hain aur ghalat baat par jald yaqin kar letey hain jo ulma ke nazdeek naaqaabile-bharosa hoti hai, hamne us qaul ki ghalati bayan karna aur usko radd karna iska bura hona aur jhoot hona aur kharabiyan zikr karna logon ke liye behtar aur faayde-mand khayal kya aur iska anjam bhi nek hoga agar izzat aur jalaal waaley Allah chaahey. Mina aur us shakhs ne jiske qaul se ham ne guftgu shuru ki aur jiske fikr aur khayal ko ham ne baatil kaha yun guman kya hai ke jo asnaad aisi hon jis mein 'fulaan se fulaan' ho aur ye baat malum ho gaee ke wo donon aik zamane mein they aur mumkin ho ke ye hadis aik ne doosrey se suni ho aur usse mila ho magar ham ko ye malum nahi hua ke usne us se suna hai, na hamne kisi riwayat mein is baat ki tasreeh paai ke wo donon miley they aur unmein munh dar munh baat cheet hui thi to aisi sanadon se jo hadis riwayat ki jaey wo hujjat nahi hai jab tak ye baat malum na ho ke kam se kam wo donon apni umr mein aik baar miley they aur aik ne doosrey se baat cheet ki thi ya aisi koi hadis riwayat ki jaey jis mein us baat kaa bayan ho ke un donon ki mulaqat aik ya zyada baar hui thi. agar is baat ka ilm na ho aur na koi hadis aisi riwayat ki jaey jis se mulaqat aur samaa, ka saboot ho to aisi hadis naql karna jis se mulaqat ka ilm na ho aisi haalat mein hujjat nahi hai aur wo hadis moquf rahegii, yahan tak ke un donon ka samaa, thoda ya bahut dusri riwayat se malum ho. aur ye qaul asnaad ke baab mein Allah tujh par raham karey aik nayaa eiijaad kya hua hai jo pahley kisi ne nahi kaha na hadis ke aalimon ne uski muwafiqat ki hai isliye ke mashhoor mazhab jis par ittifaq hai ahale-ilm ka agley aur pichhlon ka, wo ye hai ke jab koi qaabile-bharosa shakhs kisi qaabile-bharosa shakhs se riwayat karey aik hadis ko aur un donon ki mulaqat jaaiz aur mumkin ho (umr aur saal k lihaaz se) us wjah se ke wo donon aik zamaney mein maujood they, agarche kisi hadis mein is baat ki wazaahat na ho ke wo donon miley they ya unmein roo-baroo baat cheet hui thi to wo hadis hujjat hai aur wo riwayat Sabit hai. albatta agar us baat ki wahan koi khuli daleel ho ke dar-haqiqat ye rawi doosrey rawi se nahi mila ya us se kuchh nahi suna to wo hadis hujjat na hogi lekin jab tak ye baat mubham rahe (yani golmol aur koi daleel na sunney aur na milney ki na ho) to sirf mulaqat ka mumkin hona kafi hoga aur is riwayat ke baare me taslim kiya jaayega ki ismein samaa, Sabit hai. ‏‏phir jis shakhs ne ye qaul nikala hai ya uski himaayat karta hai us se yun guftgu karengey ke khud terey hi sarey kalam se ye baat nikli ke aik qaabile-bharosa shakhs ki riwayat doosrey qaabile-bharosa shakhs se hujjat hai jis par amal karna wajib hai. phir tone khud aik shart baad mein badha di ke jab ye baat malum ho jaey ke wo donon apni umr mein aik baar miley they ya zyada aur aik ne doosrey se suna tha. ab us shart ka saboot kisi aisey shakhs ke qaul se paanaa hai jiska maannaa zaroori ho. agar aisa qaul nahi hai to aur koi daleel apne da'wey par laanaa. ‏‏‏‏ agar wo ye kahey ke is baab mein salaf ka qaul hai yani us shart ke saboot ke liye to kaha jaeyga kahan hai? la ! phir na usko koi qaul milega aur na kisi aur ko aur agar wo aur koi daleel qaaim karna chahey to poochhegey wo daleel kya hai? Mina phir agar wo shakhs ye kahey : maine ye mazhab isliye ikhtiyar kya hai ke maine hadis ke tamam agley aur pichhley rawiyon ko dekha ke aik doosrey se hadis riwayat kartey hain halanke us aik ne doosrey ko dekha hai na usse suna to jab maine dekha ke unhon-ne jaaiz rakha hai mursal ko riwayat karna baghair samaa, ke aur mursal riwayat hamarey aur ilm walon ke nazdeek hujjat nahi hai to zarurat padi mujh ko rawi ke samaa, dekhney ki jis ko wo riwayat karta hai doosrey se. phir agar mujhey kahin zara bhi Sabit ho gaya ke usne suna hai doosrey rawi se to uski tamam riwaayatein usse durust ho gaiin. agar bilkul mujhey malum na hua ke usne usse suna hai to main riwayat ko moquf rakhoonga aur mere nazdeek wo riwayat hujjat na hogi isliye ke mumkin hai iska mursal hona (daleel ho mukhalif ki. ab iska jawab aagey mazkoor hota hai). Mina to usse kaha jaeyga agar terey nazdeek hadis ko zaeef karne ki aur usko hujjat na samajhney ki illat sirf irsaal ka mumkin hona hai (jaisey usne khud kaha ke jab samaa, Sabit na ho to wo riwayat hujjat na hogi kyonke mumkin hai iska mursal honaa) to lazim aata hai ke to kisi asnaad ko na maaney jab tak awwal se lekar aakhir tak usmein tasreeh na ho samaa, ki (yani har rawi doosrey se yun riwayat karey ke maine us se sunaa) maslan jo hadis ham ko pahunchi Hisham ki riwayat se, usne apne bap Urwa se, usne Sayeda Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se suna hai jaisey ham is baat ko bil-yaqeen jantey hain ke Sayeda Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suna hai bawajud iske is baat ki gunjaaish zaroor hai ke agar kisi riwayat mein Hisham yun na kahey ke maine Urwa se suna hai ya Urwa ne mujhey khabar di (balke sirf (Urwa se) kahey) to Hisham aur Urwa ke beech mein aik aur shakhs ho jisne Urwa se sun kar Hisham ko khabar di ho aur khud Hisham ne apne bap se is riwayat ko na suna ho lekin Hisham ne usko mursalan riwayat karna chaha aur jiske zariey se suna iska zikr munasib na jana aur jaisey ye ehtimaal Hisham aur Urwa ke beech mein hai, waisey hi Urwa aur Sayeda Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ke beech mein ho sakta hai. isi tarah har aik asnaad mein jis mein samaa, ki tasreeh nahi bhale hi ye baat malum ho jaey ke aik ne doosrey se bahut si riwaayatein suni hain. magar ye ho sakta hai ke kuchh riwaayatein us se na suni hon balke kisi aur ke zariey se sun kar usko mursalan naql kya ho par jiske zariey se suna iska naam na liya aur kabhi us ijmaa 'ko rafa' karne ke liye iska naam bhi ley diya aur irsaal ko tark kya. ‏‏‏‏ Imaam Muslim (Rahmatullahi-alaih) farmatey hain ke ye ehtimaal jo ham ne bayan kya (sarf farzii aur khayaalii nahi hai) balke maujood hai hadis main aur jari hai bahut se qaabile-bharosa muhaddeseen ki riwayaton mein. ham thodi si aisi riwaayatein bayan kartey hain Allah chahey to unse daleel poori hogi bahut si riwayaton par. pehli riwayat wo hai jo Ayub sakhtiyan aur ibne-Mubarak aur Wakee aur ibne-numair aur aik jamat ne siwaey unke Hisham se naql ki, usne apne bap Urwa se, usne Sayeda Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se ke main khushbu lagaatii Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke ehram kholtey waqt aur ehram baandhtey waqt jo sabse umda mujh ko miltii. usi riwayat ko jyon ka tyon Lais-bin-Sad aur Dawud attaar aur Humaid bin Aswad aur Wuhaib bin Khalid aur abu-Usama ne Hisham se riwayat kya. Hisham ne kaha : khabar di mujh ko Usman bin Urwa ne, usne Urwa se, usne Sayeda Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se, unhon-ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se. ‏‏‏‏ doosrii riwayat Hisham ki hai, apne bap Urwa se, usne Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) jab aetikaf mein hotey to apna sar meri taraf jhukaa detey. mein aap ke sar mein kanghi kar deti halanke main haaiza hoti. usi riwayat ko jyon ka tyon Imam Malik (Rahmatullahi-alaih) ne Zohri se riwayat kya hai. usne Urwa se, usne Umra se, usne Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se unhon-ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se. teesrii riwayat wo hai jo Zohri aur Saleh bin abi Hassan ne abu-Salma se naql kya usne Sayeda Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) bosa letey they aur aap roze-daar hotey . Yahya-bin-abi-Kasir ne us bose ki hadis ko yun riwayat kya khabar di mujhey abu-Salma-bin-Abdur-Rehman ne, unko khabar di Umar-bin Abdul-Azeez ne unko khabar di Urwa ne unko Aaisha Siddiqa (Raziallahu anha) ne ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) unka bosa letey aur aap roze-daar hotey. ‏‏‏‏ chauthii riwayat wo hai jo Sufiyan-bin-Uena wghaira ne Amr-bin-Dinar se ki, unhon-ne Jaabir (Raziallahu anhu) se ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne ham ko khilaaya ghodon ka gosht aur mana kya paaltu gadhon ke gosht se. isi hadis ko riwayat kya Hammad-bin-Zaid ne Amr se, unhon-ne Muhammad-bin Ali (yani imam Baaqar ( se, unhon-ne Jaabir se (to Hammad-bin-Zaid ne Amr-bin-Dinar aur Jaabir ke beech mein aik waasta aur naql kya Muhammad-bin Ali ka jo pehli asnaad mein nahin) aur usi qism ki hadisein bahut hain jinka shumaar bahut hai aur jitni ham ne bayan kiin wo samajhney walon ke liye kafi hain. Mina phir jab illat us shakhs ke nazdeek jiska qaul ham ne uper bayan kya hadis ki kharabi aur tauheen ye hui ke aik rawi ka samaa, jab doosrey rawi se malum na ho to irsaal mumkin hai to iske qaul ke b-mojib usko lazim aata hai tark karna hujjat ka un riwayaton ke sath jinke rawi ka samaa, doosrey se malum ho chuka hai (lekin khas is riwayat mein samaa, ki tasreeh nahin) albatta us shakhs ke nazdeek sirf wahi riwayat hujjat hogi jis mein samaa, ki tasreeh hai kyonkey uper ham bayan kar chukey hain ke hadis riwayat karne waley imaamon ka haal mukhtalif hota hai kabhi to wo irsaal kartey aur jis se unhon-ne suna ho iska naam nahi letey aur kabhi khush hotey aur hadis ki poori asnaad jis tarah se unhon-ne suna hai, bayan kar detey phir agar unko utaar hota to utaar batlatey aur jo chadhaao hota to chadhaao batlatey jaisey ham uper saaf bayan kar chukey hain. Mina aur ham ne salaf ke imaamon mein se jo hadis ko istemal kartey they aur asnaad ki sihat ko malum kartey they jaisey Ayub sakhtiyan aur ibne-Aun aur Malik-bin-Anas aur Sho'ba-bin-Hujjaaj aur Yahya-bin-Saeed qattaan aur Abdur-Rehman-bin-Mehdi aur jo unke baad hain kisi ko nahi suna ke wo asnaad mein samaa, ki tahqeeq kartey hon jaisey ye shakhs dawa karta hai jiska qaul uper ham ne bayan kya. albatta jinhoney unmein se rawiyon ke samaa, ki tahqeeq ki hai to wo un rawiyon ke jo mashhoor hain tadlees mein. is waqt beshak aisey rawiyon ke samaa, se behas kartey hain aur uski malum kartey hain taake unse tadlees ka marz door ho jaey lekin samaa, ki tahqeeq us rawi mein jo mudallis (hadees ka wo raawi jo hadis ka silsile na bataaye) na ho jis tarah us shakhs ne bayan kya to ye ham ne kisi imam se nahi suna un imaamon mein se jinka zikr ham ne kya aur jinka nahi kya. ‏‏‏‏ is qism ki riwayat mein se Abdullah-bin Yazeed Ansari (Raziallahu anhu) ki riwayat hai (jo khud sahabi hain) unhon-ne dekha hai Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko aur riwayat ki hai Huzefa bin Yamaan aur Abu-Masood ( Aqba-bin-Amr Ansari badrii) se, har aik se eik-eik hadis ko jis ko unhon-ne jama kya hai Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) tak, magar un riwayaton mein is baat ki tasreeh nahi ke Abdullah-bin Yazeed ne suna un donon se (yani Huzefa aur Abu-Masood se sunaa) aur na kisi riwayat mein ham ne ye baat paai ke Abdullah, Huzefa aur Abu-Masood (Raziallahu anhu) se roo-baroo miley aur unse koi hadis suni aur na kahin ham ne paya ke Abdullah ne un donon ko dekha kisi khalis riwayat mein (magar chunkey Abdullah khud sahabi they) aur uski umr itni thi ke mulaqat unki Huzefa (Raziallahu anhu) aur Abu-Masood (Raziallahu anhu) se mumkin hai isliye riwayat 'An' ke sath mahmool hai ittisaal par to sirf imkan mulaqat kafi hua jaisey Imam Muslim ka mazhab hai aur kisi ilm waley se nahi suna gaya na agley logon se, na unse jin se ham miley hain ke unhon-ne ta'an kya ho un donon hadison mein jinko Abdullah ne riwayat kya Huzefa aur abi Masood (Raziallahu anhu) se ke ye zaeef hain balke ye hadisein aur jo unke jaise hain sahi hadison mein se hain aur qawii hain un imaamon ke nazdeek jin se ham miley hain aur wo unka istemal jaaiz rakhtey hain aur unse hujjat letey hain halanke yahi hadisein us shakhs ke nazdeek jiska qaul uper ham ne bayan kya (jo saboot mulaqat shart karta hai) waahii hain aur be-kaar hain jab tak samaa, Abdullah ka Huzefa aur abu Masood se tahqeeq na ho chuki ho. Mina aur agar ham sab aisi hadison ko, jo ahale-ilm ke nazdeek sahi hain aur us shakhs ke nazdeek zaeef hain, bayan karein to unka zikr kartey kartey ham thak jaaengey (is qadr kasarat se hain) lekin ham chahtey hain ke thodi unmein se bayan karein taake baqi ke liye wo namoona hun. ‏‏‏‏ abu Usman nehdi (Abdur-Rehmaan bin mil jo aik so tees baras ke ho kar marey) aur abu-Raafe Saaigh (naqeea madni ( un donon ne zamana jahiliyat ka paya hai (lekin Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki sohbat muyassar na hui aisey logon ko mukhzim kehtey hain) aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke badey-badey Badri sahaabiyon se miley hain aur riwaayatein ki hain. phir unse hat kar aur sahaba se yahan tak ke Abu-Hurera aur ibne-Umar aur unke manind (tarah) sahaabiyon se, unmein se har aik ne aik hadis Ubai-bin-Kab se riwayat ki hai, unhon-ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se halanke kisi riwayat se ye Sabit nahi hui ke un donon ne Ubai-bin-Kab ko dekha ya unse kuchh sunaa. aur abu-Amr Shebani ( Sad bin Ayas ( ne jisne jahiliyat ka zamana paya hai aur wo Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke zamane mein jawan mard tha aur abu-Ma'mar Abdullaah-bin-Sanjara ne har aik ne unmein se 2-2 hadisein Abu-Masood Ansari se riwayat kin, unhon-ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se aur Ubaid-bin-Umair ne, Ummul-Momenin Umme-Salma (Raziallahu anha) se aik hadis riwayat ki unhon-ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se, aur Ubaid paida huey Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke zamane main aur Qais-bin abi Hazim ne jisne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ka zamana paya hai Abu-Masood Ansari se teen hadisein riwayat kiin aur Abdur-Rehman bin abi Laila ne jisne saiyedna umr (Raziallahu anhu) se suna hai aur saiyedna Ali (Raziallahu anhu) ki sohbat mein rahaa. eik hadis Anas-bin-Malik (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki aur Rabaii-binHaraash ne Imran-bin-Husain se 2 hadisein riwayat kin, unhon-ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se aur Abu-Bakra se aik hadis , unhon-ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se aur Rabaii ne saiyedna Ali (Raziallahu anhu) se suna hai aur unse riwayat ki hai aur Naafe bin Juber bin Mut-im ne abu-Shuraih Khuzai se aik hadis riwayat ki. unhon-ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se aur Nauman bin abi Ayash ne Abu-Saeed Khudri (Raziallahu anhu) se teen hadisein riwayat kiin unhon-ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se aur Ata-bin-Yazeed Lesi ne Tameem daari se aik hadis riwayat ki unhon-ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se aur Sulaiman-bin-Yasar ne Rafe-bin-Khadeej se aik hadis riwayat ki unhon-ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se aur Ubaid bin Abdur-Rehman Himyari ne Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se kai hadisein riwayat kiin unhon-ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se. Mina phir ye sab Tabe-een (Rahmatullahi-alaih) jinhoney sahaba (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki hai jinka zikr ham ne uper kya, unka samaa, un sahaba (Raziallahu anhu) se kisi muaiyan riwayat mein malum nahi hua, na mulaqat hi un sahaba (Raziallahu anhu) ke sath riwayat se zahir hui bawajud iske ye sab riwaayatein hadis aur riwayat ke pahchaanney walon ke nazdeek (yani aimma hadis ke nazdeek ( sahi sanad hain aur ham nahi jantey ke kisi ne unmein se kisi riwayat ko zaeef kaha ho ya usmein samaa, ki talash ki ho, isliye ke samaa, mumkin hai iska inkar nahi ho sakta kyonke wo donon aik zamane mein maujood they aur ye qaul jis ko us shakhs ne nikala hai jiska bayan uper ham ne kya hadis ke zaeef honey ke liye us illat ki wjah se mazkoor hui us laaiq bhi nahi ke us taraf tawajjoh karein ya iska zikr karein, isliye ke ye qaul nayaa nikala hua hai aur ghalat aur faasid hai koi ahale-ilm salaf mein se iska qaail nahi hua aur jo log salaf ke baad guzrey unhon-ne iska inkar kya to us se iske radd karne ki haajat nahi. jab us qaul ki aur uske kehney waley ki ye waq'at hai jaisey bayan hui aur Allah madad karne wala hai is baat ko radd karne ke liye jo aalimon ke mazhab ke khilaf hai aur usi par bharosa hai. tamam hua muqaddima Muslim kaa. ab shuru hota hai bayan eman ka jo asl hai tamam aamaal ka aur jis par moquf hai nijat aakhirat ke azab se."
"128","Abu Zuber ne Hazrat Jaabir (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : Mujhey hukm diya gaya hai ke main logon se ladun yahan tak ke wo (laa ilaaha illallaah) ke qaail ho jaaein, jab wo (laa ilaaha illallaah) ke qaail ho jaeinge to unhon-ne meri taraf se apne khoon aur maal mehfooz kar liye, siwaey-iske ke us (kalimey ke) haq ka (taqaazaa) ho, aur unka hisab Allah ke sipurd hai. phir aapne (ye aayat) tilawat farmai : aap to bas nasihat karne waley hain, aap unpar zabardastii karne waley nahi hain."
"209","Sufiyan ne ( Sulaiman ( Aamash ke hawale se khabar di ke Zakwan ne Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, unhon-ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se bayan kiya, farmaya : zaanii zina nahi karta ke jab wo zina kar raha ho. . . . . aagey ( Sufiyan ne) Shoba ki hadis ki tarah bayan kiya."
"248","Mansoor bin abi Mazaahim aur Muhammad-bin-Jafar bin Ziyad ne kaha : humein Ibrahim bin Sad ne ibne-Shihaab se hadis sunai, unhon-ne Saeed-bin-Musayyib se aur unhon-ne Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, unhon-ne kaha ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se puchha gaya : kon sa amal sabse afzal hai? aap ne farmaya : Allah azz-wa-jall par eman lana . puchha gaya : phir iske baad kon sa ? aap ne farmaya : Allah ke rastey mein jihad karnaa.' puchha gaya : phir kon sa ? farmaya : hajje mabroor ( aisa Haj jo saraasar neki aur taqwa par mabni aur mukammal ho. ( Muhammad-bin-Jafar ki riwayat mein, , Allah aur uske rasool par eman , ke alfaz hain."
"637","abu-Muawiya aur Esa-bin-Yonus ne Aamash se, unhon-ne Hakam se, unhon-ne Abdur-Rehmaan-bin-abii-Laila se, unhon-ne Kab-bin-Ujra (Raziallahu anhu) se aur unhon-ne Hazrat Bilal (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mozon par aur sar dhaanpney waley kapdey par masah kya. Esa ki hadis mein, Hakam se (riwaayat ki), aur, Bilal se riwayat ki, ke bajaey mujhey Hakam ne hadis sunai aur mujhey Bilal ne hadis sunai, ke alfaz hain."
"638","aur yahi riwayat mujh (Imam muslim) ko Suwed-bin-Saeed ne Ali-bin-Mus-hir se aur unhon-ne Aamash se uper zikr ki gaee sanad ke sath bayan ki. usmein (yaqeenan Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne) ke bajaey (maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko dekhaa) ke alfaz hain."
"794","ibne-Shahab ne kaha : mujhey Ali-bin Abdullah-bin-Abbas ne apne walid (Abdullah-bin-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu)) se aur unhon-ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se yahi hadis bayan ki hai."
"852","Abda ne Talha bin Yahya (bin Talha bin Ubaidullah ( se aur unhon-ne apne chacha (Eisaa bin Talha bin Ubaidullah ( se riwayat ki, unhon-ne kaha : main Muawiya bin abi Sufiyan (Raziallahu anhu) ke paas tha, unke paas muazzan unhein Namaz ke liye bulaney aaya. to Muawiya (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha : maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suna, aap farmatey they : qiyamat ke din muazzan , logon mein sabse zyada lambi gardanon waley hongey. ,"
"853","Sufiyan ne Talha bin Yahya se aur unhon-ne (apne chacha ( Esa-bin-Talha se riwayat ki, kaha : maine Muawiya (Raziallahu anhu) se suna, wo keh rahe they ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : . . . . . . . . . .) aagey ( pichhli riwayat ki manind (tarah) hai."
"881","abu-Ovais ne kaha : mujhey Alaa ne khabar di, kaha : maine apne walid se aur abu-Saaib se suna, wo donon Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) ke saathi they, un donon ne kaha ke Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : jisne koi Namaz ada ki aur is mein fatihatul-kitab (Sura Fatiha) na padhi to wo (namaz ( adhoori hai. aap ne teen baar ye jumla farmaya, . . . aagey uper zikr ki gaee asaatza ( Malik , Sufiyan , ibne-Juraij ( ki hadis ki tarah hai"
"1220","Yahya-bin-Saeed ne Hisham se isi sanad ke sath Hazrat Mueqeeb (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki ke logon ne Nabi akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se Namaz (ke doran ( mein hath se ( kankariyaan wghaira) saaf karne ke barey mein sawal kya to aap ne farmaya : aik baar (ki ja sakti hain. ("
"1221","Khalid-bin Haris ne kaha : hamein Hisham ne isi sanad se hadis sunai aur) (Muaiqeeb sey) ke bajaey) (Muaiqeeb ne hadis sunai) kaha,"
"1222","Hisham ke bajaey) Sheban ne Yahya se baqi bachi isi sanad ke sath riwayat ki ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne us aadmi ke barey mein jo sajdey ki jagah ki mitti barabar karta hai, farmaya : agar tum ne aisa karna hi hai to aik baar karo."
"1251","Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : jisne us paudey mein se kuchh khaya ho wo hargiz hamari masjid ke qareeb na aaey aur na hamein lehsun ki bu se takleef de."
"1332","Abdullah-bin Shaqiq ne Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se aur unhon-ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat ki ke Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) qabr ke azab se, jahannam ke azab se aur dajjal ke fitney se panah maanga kartey they."
"1350","Hamza Zayyat ne hamein hukm se hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne Abdur-Rehman bin abi Lela se, unhon-ne Hazrat Kab-bin-Ujra (Raziallahu anhu) se aur unhon-ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat ki, aap ne farmaya : aik doosrey ke baad kahey janey waley ( kuchh ( kalimaat hain, unko kehney wala. ya ada karne wala. nakaam ya namuraad nahi rehta. har ( farz ( Namaz ke baad tentis baar ( Subhan-Allah ( , tentis martaba ( al-hamdulillah (aur chauntis baar ( Allahu-akbar ( kehna ."
"1351","Amr bin Qais Mulai ne Hakam se isi sanad ke sath usi ki manind (tarah) hadis bayan ki."
"1354","Jarir ne Ammara-bin-Qaqa se, unhon-ne Abu-Zaraa se aur unhon-ne Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, unhon-ne kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) jab ( shuruat ( Namaz ke liye takbeer kehtey to qirat karne se pahley kuchh der sukoot farmatey, maine kaha : aey Allah ke rasool! mere maan-baap aap par qurbaan ! dekhiye ye jo takbeer aur qirat ke darmyan aap ki khamoshi hai (iske doran mein) aap kya kehtey hain? aap ne farmaya : main kehta hun : (اللہم باعدبینی وبین خطایای کما باعدت بین المشرق والمغرب اللہم نقنی من خطایای کما ینقی الثوب الابیض من الدنس ، اللہم اغسلنی من خطایای بالثلج والماء والبرد) aey Allah ! mere aur mere gunahon ke darmyan is tarah doori daal de jis tarah tu ney mashriq aur maghrib ke darmyan doori dali hai. aey Allah ! mujhey mere gunahon se is tarah paak saaf kar de jis tarah safaid kapda mail kuchail se saaf kya jata hai. aey Allah ! mujhey mere gunahon se paak kar de barf ke sath , pani ke sath aur olon ke sath."
"1355","ibne- Fuzel aur abdul-Wahid bin Ziyad donon ne, Ammara-bin-Qaqa se, isi sanad ke sath , Jarir ki hadis ki tarah riwayat ki."
"1365","Muhammad-bin-Hatim aur Ubaidullah bin Saeed ne kaha : hamein Yahya-bin-Saeed ne Hajjaj sawaaf se hadis sunai, unhon-ne kaha : hamein Yahya-bin-abi-Kasir ne abu-Salma aur Abdullah-bin-abi-Qatada se hadis sunai, unhon-ne Hazrat abu Qatada (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, unhon-ne kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : jab Namaz ke liye iqamat kahi jaey to us waqt tak khadey na hua karo jab tak mujhey na dekh lo aur ibne- Hatim ne kaha : jab iqamat kahi jaey ya ( jamat ke liye) pukara jaey."
"1366","abu-Bakar-bin-abi-Sheba ne kaha : hamein Sufiyan-bin-Uena ne Mamar se hadis sunai, Abu-Bakar (bin abi-Shabih ne mazeed ( kaha : hamein ibne-Ulaih ne Hajjaj-bin-abi-Usman se hadis sunai, neez Ishaq-bin-Ibrahim ne kaha : hamein Esa-bin-Yonus aur Abdur-Razzaq ne Mamar se khabar di. Ishaq ne ( mazeed ( kaha : hamein Waleed bin Muslim ne Sheban se khabar di, un sab (Mamar, Hajjaj-bin abi Usman aur Sheban ( ne Yahya-bin-abi-Kasir se riwayat ki, unhon-ne Abdullah-bin-abi-Qatada se, unhon-ne apne walid se aur unhon-ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat ki. Ishaq ne Mamar aur Sheban se jo hadis riwayat ki usmein ye izafa kya hai. yahan tak ke tum mujhey dekh lo ke main bahar nikal aaya hun."
"1428","Fuzel bin marzooq ne Shaqiq bin Aqba se aur unhon-ne Hazrat Bara-bin-Aazib (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki ke ye aayat (isi tarah) (حافظوا Ali الصلوٰت وصلاۃ العصر) nazil hui, jab tak Allah Taala ko manzoor hua ham ne usey padha, phir Allah Taala ne usey mansukh kar diya aur aayat is tarah utri : (حفظوا Ali الصلوٰت والصلوٰۃ الوسطیٰ) namazon ki nigehdasht karo aur (khususan) darmyan ki Namaz ki is par aik aadmi ne, jo Shaqiq ke paas betha hua tha, unse kaha : to phir us se murad Asr ki Namaz hui? Hazrat Bara (Raziallahu anhu) ne farmaya : main tumhen bata chuka hun ke ye aayat kaisey utri aur Allah Taala ne kaisey usey mansukh kya, ( asl haqiqat ( Allah hi behtar janta hai"
"1429","Aswad-bin-Qais ne Shaqeeq-bin-Aqba se, unhon-ne Hazrat Bara-bin-Aazib (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki unhon-ne kaha : ham ye aayat aik waqt tak Nabi akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath (usi tarah) padhtey rahe. padhi. ( aagey ( Fuzail-bin-marzooq ki (pichhli) hadis ki manind (tarah) hai."
"1648","Hammad-bin-Zaid ne Ayub se riwayat ki, unhon-ne Amr-bin-Dinar se unhon-ne Ata-bin-Yasar se unhon-ne Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se aur unhon-ne Nabi akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se pichhli hadis ki manind (tarah) riwayat ki. Hammad ne kaha : phir main (seedhey-seedhey) Amr (bin Dinar) se mila to unhon-ne mujhey ye hadis sunai lekin unhon-ne us hadis ko Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki taraf mansub nahi kya. ( Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) ka qaul riwayat kya ("
"1718","Amr-bin-Haris ne ibne-Shahab se isi sanad ke sath Nabi akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki bevi Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat ki, unhon-ne kaha Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) isha ki Namaz se jis ko log utma kehtey hain faraghat ke baad se fajr tak gyara (11) rakaat padhtey they. har 2 rakaat par salam phertey aur witr aik rakaat padhtey . jab muazzan subah ki Namaz ki azan keh kar khamosh ho jata aap ke samney subah waazeh ho jati aur muazzan aap ke paas aa jata to aap uth kar do halki rakatein padhtey phir apne daahiney pahlu ke bal let jatey yahan tak ke muazzan aap ke paas iqamat (ki itlaa deney) ke liye aa jata."
"1719","Hurmala ne mujhey ye hadis bayan ki (kaha ( hamein ibne- Wahab ne khabar di, unhon-ne kaha, mujhey Yunus ne ibne-Shahab se isi sanad ke sath khabar di. aagey Hurmala ne pichhli hadis ki manind (tarah) hadis bayan ki albatta usmein Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke samney subah ke roshan ho janey aur muazzan aap ke paas aata ke alfaz zikr nahi kiye aur iqamat ka zikr kya. baqi hadis bilkul Amr ki hadis ki tarah hai."
"1778","Shoba ne Abu-Ishaq se isi sanad ke sath mazkura (uper zikr) hadis bayan ki, albatta Mansoor ki riwayat mukammal aur zyada (tafseelaat par muheet) hai."
"2045","Sufiyan-bin-Uena ne kaha : ham se Ayub ne hadis bayan ki unhon-ne kaha maine Ata se suna unhon-ne kaha maine Hazrat Ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) ko ye kehtey huey suna ke main Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke barey mein shahadat deta hun, aap ne Namaz eid khutbe se pahley padhi phir aap ne khutba diya phir aap ne dekha ke aap ne aurton ko (apni baat ( nahi sunai to aap unke paas aaey aur unko yad dahaanii ( talqeen ( farmai aur unhein nasihat ki aur sadqa karne ka hukm diya aur Bilal (Raziallahu anhu) apna kapda phailaey huey they koi aurat (is kapdey mein) anguthi phainktii thi (koii halqey daar zewar ( chhalley, baaliyaan, kadey, kangan (aur koi dusri cheezein dalti thi."
"2046","Hammad aur Ismail-bin-Ibrahim ne Ayub se isi sanad ke sath isi tarah hadis bayan ki."
"2057","Muaz Anbari ne kaha : ham se Shoba ne hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne Adi se riwayat ki, unhon-ne Saeed-bin-Jubair se aur unhon-ne Hazrat Ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) eidul-azha ya eidul-fitr ke din bahar nikley aur 2 rakatein padhaain, us se pahley ya baad mein koi Namaz nahi padhi. phir aurton ke paas aaey jabke Bilal (Raziallahu anhu) aap ke sath they, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne aurton ko sadqey ka hukm diya to koi aurat apni baaliyan (Bilal (Raziallahu anhu) ke kapdey mein) dalti thi aur koi apna ( long wghaira ka khushbu daar ( haar dalti thi."
"2058","Muhammad-bin Idrees aur ghandar donon ne Shoba se isi sanad ke sath us ( uper zikr ki gaee hadis) ke ham mana hadis bayan ki."
"2093","Abdur-Rehman-bin namir ne khabar di ke unhon-ne ibne-Shahab se suna, wo Urwa aur Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se khabar de rahe they ke Nabi akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Salat (Durud) ( chaand ya suraj girahan ki Namaz ( mein buland awaz se qirat ki aur do rakaton mein char rukoo aur char sajdey karke Namaz ada ki."
"2100","Ismail-ibne-Ulaih ne Hisham dustwaai se riwayat ki, unhon-ne kaha : hamein abu-Zubair ne Jabir-bin-Abdullah (Raziallahu anhu) se hadis sunai, unhon-ne kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke zamaney mein aik intihai garm din suraj ko grahan lag gaya to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne apne sathiyon ( sahaba (Rizwaanullahi anhum ajmaeen) (ke sath Namaz padhi, aap ne ( itna ( lamba qiyam kiya ke kuchh log girney lagey. phir aap ne rukoo kiya aur usey lamba kiya, phir ( rukoo se) sar uthaya aur lamba ( qiyam ( kiya. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne phir rukoo kiya aur lamba kya. phir Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne ( rukoo se) sar uthaya aur (is qiyam ko lamba ( kiya. phir do sajdey kiye, phir aap (doosri rakaat ke liye) uthey aur isi tarah kiya, is tarah char rukoo aur char sajdey ho gaey. phir aap ne farmaya : bila shubah mujh par har wo cheez ( hashr-nashr , pul siraat , jannat aur dozakh ( jis mein se tum guzrogey , pesh ki gaee. mere samney jannat pesh ki gaee yahan tak ke agar main usmein se aik guchchhey ko lena chahta to usey pakad leta . ya aap ne ( yun ( farmaya : maine aik guchchha lena chaha to mera hath us tak na pahuncha. aur mere samney jahannam pesh ki gaee to maine usmein Bani-Israeel ki aik aurat dekhi jisey apni billi (ke mamley ( mein azab diya ja raha tha. us ne usey baandh diya na usey kuchh khilaaya ( pilaya ( na usey chhoda hi ke wo zamin ke chhotey-motey jaandaar parindey wghaira kha leti aur maine abu Samama Amr (bin-Aamir ( bin-Malik (jiska laqab luhayii tha aur khuza'aa uski aulad mein se tha) ko dekha ke wo aag main apni antadiyaan ghaseet raha tha, log kaha kartey they ke suraj aur chaand kisi azeem shakhsiyat ki maut par hi be noor hotey hain. halanke wo Allah Taala ki nishaniyon mein se do nishaniyan hain. jo wo tumhen dikhaataa hai, jab unhein girahan lagey to us waqt tak Namaz padhtey raho ke wo (girahan) chhat jaey."
"2101","abdul-Malik-bin-Sabaah ne Hisham dustwaai se isi sanad ke sath usi (pichhli hadis) ki tarah hadis bayan ki, magar unhon-ne kaha : (aap ne farmaya : ( maine aag mein balaad hameer ki) rehney wali) aik siyah lambi aurat dekhi aur unhon-ne  (Bani-Israeel ki) ke alfaz nahi kahey ."
"2104","abu-Usama ne Hisham se, unhon-ne Fatima se aur unhon-ne Hazrat Asma (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat ki, unhon-ne kaha : main Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ke paas aai to us waqt log (namaz mein) khadey they aur wo bhi Namaz padh rahi thin. maine puchha : logon ko kya hua? aur) aagey ( Hisham se ibne-Numair ki (pichhli ( hadis ki tarah hadis bayan ki."
"2105","Urwa se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha : suraj ke liye ( kasaf ( na kaho , balke ( khasaf (ka lafz istemal karo. ( urdu mein donon ka mana girahan hi hai.)"
"2149","Ayub ne Abdullah-bin-Ubai Muleka se riwayat ki, unhon-ne kaha : main Hazrat ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) ke pahlu mein betha hua tha. ham Hazrat Usman (Raziallahu anhu) ki sahibzadi Umme- Aban ke janazey ka intizar kar rahe they jabke Amr-bin-Usman bhi unke paas they itney mein Hazrat Ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) aaey unhein lekar aaney wala aik aadmi laya mere khayal mein us ne Hazrat Ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) ko Hazrat ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) ki baithney ki jagah ke barey mein bataya to wo aa kar mere pahlu mein baith gaey mein un donon ke darmyan mein tha achcha ghar (ke andar ( se ( roney ki) awaz aai to ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) ne. aur aisa lagta tha wo Amr (bin-Usman) ko ishara kar rahe hain ke wo uthein aur unko rokein. kaha maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko ye farmatey huey suna hai bila shubah maiyat ko iske ghar walon ke ro ne se azab diya jata hai. ( Abdullah-bin-Ubai Muleka ne) kaha : Hazrat Abdullah (Raziallahu anhu) ne usko bila shart w qaid (yani har tarah ke ro ne ke hawale se) bayan kiya. is par Hazrat Ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha : ham ameer-ul-mou-mineen Hazrat umr bin-Khattab (Raziallahu anhu) ke sath they yahan tak ke jab ham beda ke maqam par pahunchey to unhon-ne aik aadmi ko darakht ke saaey mein padao daley dekha unhon-ne mujh se kaha : jao aur mere liye pata karo ke wo kon aadmi hai main gaya to dekha wo Suheb (Raziallahu anhu) they mein unke paas wapas aaya aur kaha : aap ne mujhey hukm diya tha ke main aap ke liye pata karun ke wo kon shakhs hain to wo Suheb (Raziallahu anhu) hain. unhon-ne kaha : ( jao aur) unko hukm (pahuncha) do ke wo hamarey sath ( qafley mein) aa jaaein. maine kaha : unke sath unke ghar waley hain unhon-ne kaha : chahey unke sath unke ghar waley ( bhi) hain ( shamil ho jayen ). kabhi-kabhi Ayub ne ( bas yahan tak kaha ( unse kaho ke wo hamarey sath ( qafley mein) shamil ho jaaein.   ...jab ham Madina pahunchey to zyada waqt na guzra tha ke ameer-ul-mou-mineen  zakhmi kar diye gaey Suheb (Raziallahu anhu) ye kehtey huey aaey haaye mera bhai ! haaye mera sathi ! to umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha kya tumhen malum nahi ya (kaha : tum ne suna nahi. padhi. Ayub ne kaha : ya unhon-ne (iske bajaey)  kya tumhen pata nahi aur tum ne suna nahi ke alfaz kahey . ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : maiyat ko iske ghar walon ke kuchh ( tarah ke) roney se azab diya jata hai) ibne-abi-Mulaika ne) kaha : Hazrat Abdullah (Raziallahu anhu) ne us ( roney ke lafz ( ko bila qaid bayan kiya. jabke Hazrat umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne ( lafz ( kuchh (ki qaid (ke sath kaha tha. main ( ibne-abi-Mulaika ( uth kar Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ki khidmat mein hazir hua aur Hazrat ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) ne jo kaha tha unko bataya unhon-ne kaha nahi Allah ki qism ! Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne ye kabhi nahi farmaya ke maiyat ko kisi aik ke roney ki wjah se azab diya jata hai balke aap ne farmaya hai : Allah Taala kaafir ke azab mein iske ghar walon ke ro ne ki wjah se izafa kar deta hai (kyonke kafiron ne apni aulad ko buland awaz se ronaa sikhaya hota hai raha baghair awaz ke ronaa to uski zimme-dari roney waley par nahi kyonke ( be-shak Allah hi hai jisne hansaayaa aur rulaayaa aur bojh uthaney wali koi jaan kisi dusri ka bojh nahi uthaey gii .) awaz ke baghair mahz aansuon se roney ka na roney waley ko gunah hai na iske badon ko kyonke wo bhi iske zimme daar nahi.) Ayub ne kaha : ibne-abi-Mulaika ne kahan mujh se Qasim-bin-Muhammad ne bayan kiya unhon-ne kaha : jab Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ko Hazrat umr aur ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu)  ki ye baat pahunchi to unhon-ne kaha : tum mujhey aisey do afraad ki hadis bayan kartey ho jo na ( khud ( jhoot bolney waley hain aur na jhutlaaey janey waley hain lekin) kabhi-kabhi ( samaa, ( sunnaa ( ghalat ho jata hai (kyonke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne aik aur siyaaq mein ye baat ki thi dekhiye hadis number 2153 , 2156 ( . padhi."
"2150","ibne-Juraij ne kaha : mujhey Abdullah-bin-Ubai Muleka ne khabar di unhon-ne kaha : Hazrat Usman-bin-Affan (Raziallahu anhu) ki sahibzadi Makka mein fout ho gaee to ham unke janazey mein shirkat ke liye aaey Hazrat ibne-Umar aur Hazrat Ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) bhi tashrif laey. mein un donon ke darmyan mein betha tha. main unmein se aik ke paas betha tha phir doosra aa kar mere pahlu mein baith gaya. Hazrat Abdullah-bin-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) ne Amr-bin-Usman se aur wo unke ru-baro baithey huey they kaha : tum ro ne se roktey kyon nahi ? be-shak Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya tha maiyat ko iske ghar walon ke is par roney se azab diya jata hai. is par Ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha : Hazrat umr (Raziallahu anhu) iske kuchh ( kuchh tarah ke roney se) kaha kartey they phir unhon-ne ( mukammal ( hadis bayan ki kaha : main umr (Raziallahu anhu) ke sath Makka se lota yahan tak ke jab ham maqam beda par pahunchey to achcha unhein darakht ke saaey taley kuchh oont sawar dikhai diye unhon-ne kaha : ja kar dekho ye oont sawar kon hain? maine dekha to wo Suheb (Raziallahu anhu) they maine ( aa kar) unhein bataya to unhon-ne kaha : unhein mere paas bulao . main lot kar Suheb (Raziallahu anhu) ke paas gaya. maine kaha : chaliye ameerul-momeneen ke sath ho jaaiye iske baad jab Hazrat umr (Raziallahu anhu) zakhmi kar diye gaey to Suheb (Raziallahu anhu) rotey huey andar aaey keh rahe they haaye mera bhai ! haaye mera sathi ! to Hazrat umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha Suheb ! kya tum mujh par ro rahe ho? halanke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya hai : maiyat ko iske ghar walon ke kuchh ( tarah ke) roney se azab diya jata hai. Hazrat Ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha : jab Hazrat umr (Raziallahu anhu) wafat pa gaey to maine ye baat Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se bayan ki unhon-ne kaha : Allah umr (Raziallahu anhu) par raham farmaai ! Allah ki qism ! nahi Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne ye nahi farmaya ke Allah Taala momin ko kisi ke roney ki wjah se azab deta hai. balke aap ne farmaya : Allah Taala kafir ke azab ko iske ghar walon ke is par roney ki wjah se badha deta hai. kaha aur Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ne kaha : aur tumharey liye Quran kafi hai (jis mein ye hai) aur bojh uthaney wali koi jaan kisi dusri jaan ka bojh nahi uthaey gii . uskey sath Hazrat Ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha aur Allah hi hansaataa hai aur rulaa ta hai. ibne-abi-Mulaika ne ne kaha : Allah ki qism ! Hazrat ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) ne ( jawab mein) kuchh nahi kaha."
"2225","Shoba ne Amr-bin-Murra se aur unhon-ne ibne-abi-Lela se riwayat ki ke Hazrat Qais-bin-Sad aur Sahal-bin-Haneef (Raziallahu anhu) qaadsiya main ( muqeem ( they ke unke paas se aik janaaza guzra to wo donon khadey ho gaey is par un donon se kaha gaya ke wo isi zamin (ke zimmii ( logon mein se hai to un donon ne kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas se aik janaaza guzra to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) khadey ho gaey, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se puchha gaya : ye to Yahudi (ka janaaza ( hai to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : kya ye aik jaan nahi !?"
"2232","ibne-Wahab ne kaha : mujhey Muawiya-bin-Saleh ne Habib-bin-Ubaid se khabar di, unhon-ne us hadis ko Jubair-bin-Nufair se suna, wo kehtey they : maine Hazrat Auf-bin-Malik (Raziallahu anhu) se suna, wo kehtey they : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne aik janaaza padhaayaa to maine Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki dua mein se ye yad kar liya, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) farma rahe they : aey Allah ! usey bakhsh de is par raham farma aur usey aafiyat de, usey maaf farma aur uski baa-izzat ziyaafat (mehmaan nawazi) farma aur uske dakhil honey ki jagah ( qabr ( ko wasee farma aur us (ke gunahon ( ko pani , barf aur olon se dho de. usey gunahon se is tarah saaf kar de jis tarah tu ney safaid kapdey ko mail kuchail se saaf kiya aur usey us ghar ke badley mein behtar ghar , iske ghar walon ke badley mein behtar ghar waley aur uski biwi ke badley mein behtar biwi ata farma aur usko jannat mein dakhil farma aur qabr ke azab se aur aag ke azab se apni panah ata farmaa. kaha : yahan tak hua ke mere dil mein aarzoo paida hui ke ye maiyat mein hota ! (Muaawiya ne) kaha : mujhey Abdur-Rehman-bin-Juber ne hadis bayan ki. unhon-ne apne walid se hadis sunai, unhon-ne Hazrat Auf-bin-Malik (Raziallahu anhu) se, unhon-ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se ( Habib-bin-Ubaid ki) usi hadis ki tarah riwayat ki."
"2243","Wakee ne Sufiyan se, unhon-ne Habib-bin-abi-Sabit se, unhon-ne abu-Waail se aur unhon-ne abu-hayyaj Asadi se riwayat ki, unhon-ne kaha : Hazrat Ali-bin abi-Talib (Raziallahu anhu) ne mujh se kaha : kya main tumhen us ( muhim ( par rawaana na karun jis par Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mujhey rawaana kiya tha? (wo ye hai) ke tum kisi tasweer ya mujassamey ko na chhodnaa magar usey mitaa dena aur kisi buland qabr ko na chhodnaa magar usey ( zamin ke) barabar kar dena."
"2295","bukair ne ( Abu-Saleh ( Zakwan se hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se aur unhon-ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat ki, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : jab insan apne oonton mein Allah ka haq ya zakat ada nahi karta. padhi. aagey Suhel ki riwayat ki tarah hadis bayan ki."
"2339","Suhel ke walid ( Abu-Saleh ( ne Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya qiyamat qaaim nahi hogi yahan tak ke maal badh jaeyga aur) pani ki tarah) bahney lagega aur aadmi apne maal ki zakat lekar niklega to usey aik shakhs bhi nahi milega jo usey uski taraf se qabool kar ley aur yahan tak ke Arab ki sar zamin dobaara charaagahon aur nehron mein badal jaeygi."
"2381","Imam Malik ne Khubaib-bin-Abdur-Rehman se unhon-ne Hafs-bin-Aasim se aur unhon-ne Hazrat Abu-Saeed Khudri (Raziallahu anhu) . ya Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) . se riwayat ki, unhon-ne kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya, padhi. ( aagey ( jis tarah Ubaidullah ki hadis hai aur unhon-ne (aisa aadmi jiska dil masjid mein atkaa hua hai ke bajaey) kaha : (رجل معلق بالمسجد اذا خرج منه حتي يعود اليه ) ''wo aadmi jab masjid se nikalta hai to usi ke sath muallaq rehta hai yahan tak ke usmein lot aaey.''"
"2810","Muhammad-bin-Bakr se riwayat hai kaha mujhey ibne-Juraij ne khabar di, kaha mujhey abu-Zubair ne khabar di ke unhon-ne Jabir-bin-Abdullah (Raziallahu anhu) se suna unse maqam talbiya ke mutaalliq sawal kya gaya tha ( Jaabir (Raziallahu anhu) ne) kaha maine suna. mera khayal hai ke unhon-ne hadis ki nisbat Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki taraf ki. aap ne farmaya : Madina walon ka maqam talbiya (ehram baandhney ki jagah) zul-Hulaifa hai aur doosrey rastey (se aaney walon ka maqam ( ) Johfa ( hai. Iraq walon ka maqam talbiya zaat arq, Najad walon ka Qarn ( manaazil (aur Yaman walon ka Yalamlam hai."
"2892","Hammad ne Amr-bin-Dinar aur Ayub se unhon-ne Saeed-bin-Jubair se unhon-ne Ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki (ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) ne) kaha : aik shakhs Arafaat mein Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath waquf mein tha ke apni sawari se gir gaya Ayub ne kaha : uski sawari ne uski gardan tod dali . ya kaha : usey usi waqt mar dala. padhi. aur Amr ne kaha, ''uski gardan ka manka tod diya.''  Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko ye baat batai gaee to farmaya : usey pani aur berii ke patton se ghusl do, usey do kapdon mein kafan do, isey khushbu lagaao na iska sar dhaanapo . Ayub ne kaha : bila shubah Allah Taala qiyamat ke din usey usi haalat mein talbiya kehta hua uthaaeyga aur Amr ne kaha : bila shubah Allah Taala usey qiyamat ke din uthaaeyga . wo talbiya pukar raha hoga."
"2893","Ismail-bin-Ibrahim ne Ayub se hadis bayan ki. kaha mujhey Saeed-bin-Jubair se khabar di gaee, unhon-ne Ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki ke aik shakhs Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath waquf kar raha tha aur ehram ki haalat mein tha ( aagey ( Ayub se Hammad ki riwayat ki manind (tarah) hadis zikr ki."
"2978","Hammam ne kaha : hamein Qatada ne Mutarrif ke waastey se Hazrat Imran-bin-Husain (Raziallahu anhu) se hadis bayan ki, kaha : ham ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath ( Haj mein) tamatto kya tha aur uske baad iske mutaalliq Quran nazil na hua (ke ye durust nahi hai iske mutaalliq ( aik shakhs ne apni raey se jo chaha keh diya."
"2979","Muhammad-bin waase ne Mutarrif bin-Abdullah-bin Shikhkhir se, unhon-ne Hazrat Imran-bin-Husain (Raziallahu anhu) se yahi hadis bayan ki, ( Imran-bin-Husain (Raziallahu anhu) ne) kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne ( Haj mein) tamatto ( Haj w Umerey ko aik sath ada ( kya aur ham ne bhi aap ke sath ( Haj mein) tamatto kya tha. ( Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Quran ki sura mein Haj w Umra ikattha ada kya, jo qurbaniyan sath na laey they unhon-ne unhi dinon mein alag alag ehram baandh kar donon ko ada kya ("
"3023","Abdul-Aala bin Abdul-Aala ne hadis bayan ki, (kaha ( hamein Dawud ne abu-Nazara se unhon-ne Abu-Saeed Khudri (Raziallahu anhu) se hadis bayan ki, kaha ham Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath intihai buland awaz se Haj ka talbiya pukaartey huey nikley. jab ham Makka pahunchey to aap ne hamein hukm diya ke jinke paas qurbani hai unke ilawa ham tamam usey ( Haj ko) Umerey mein badal dein. jab ( tarwiya ( aath (8) zul-hijja ka din aaya to ham ne ehram baandha Mina ki taraf rawaana huey aur Haj ka talbiya pukara."
"3028","Hushaim ne Yahya bin abi Ishaq , Abdul-Azeez bin Suheb aur Humaid se khabar di ke un sab ne Hazrat Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se suna unhon-ne farmaya : maine Allah ke Rasool (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko) Haj w Umra ( donon ka talbiya pukaartey huey suna ye kehtey huey 'aey Allah! main Haj w Umra ke liye hazir hun, main Haj w Umra ke liye hazir hun."""
"3029","Ismail bin Ibrahim ne Yahya bin abi Ishaq aur Humaid Taweel se khabar di Yahya ne kaha : maine Hazrat Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se suna, keh rahe they ke maine Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suna wo farma rahe they : aey Allah ! main Haj w Umra ki niyat se terey dar par hazir hun. Humaid ne kaha : Hazrat Anas (Raziallahu anhu) ne bayan kya ke maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko ye kehtey huey suna : aey Allah! main Haj w Umra (ki niyat (ke sath hazir hun."
"3038","ibne-Juraij ne kaha : mujhey Ata ne khabar di, kaha : maine Ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) se suna wo hamein hadis bayan kar rahe they. kaha Allah ke rasool (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne aik Ansariya aurat se farmaya, Ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) ne uska naam bataya tha lekin main bhool gaya hun. tumhen hamarey sath Haj karne se kis baat ne rok diya ? us ne jawab diya : hamarey paas pani dhoney waley 2 hi oont they. aik par uske betey ka walid ( shauhar (aur beta Haj par chaley gaey hain aur aik oont hamarey liye chhod gaey ham is par pani dhotey hain. aap ne farmaya : jab Ramazan aaey to tum Umra kar lena kyonke us ( Ramazan ( mein Umra karna Haj ke barabar hai."
"3039","Habib muallim ne hamein hadis sunai, unhon-ne Ata se unhon-ne Hazrat Ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki ke Allah ke rasool (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne aik Ansari aurat se jisey Umme- Sanan kaha jata tha kaha : tumhen kis baat ne roka ke tum hamarey sath Haj kartin ? usne kaha : abu fulaan. iske khawind ke paas pani dhoney waley 2 oont they, aik par usne aur uske betey ne Haj kya aur doosrey par hamara ghulam pani dhota tha. aap ne farmaya : Ramzanul-Mubarak mein Umra Haj ya mere sath Haj (ki kami ( ko pura kar deta hai."
"3087","Ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) ke aazad karda ghulam Kureb ne Hazrat Usama-bin-Zaid (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki kaha : Arafaat se ( waapsii ke waqt) main Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath ( ontni par) sawar hua, jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) daain taraf wali us ghaati par pahunchey jo Muzdalfa se zara pahley hai aap ne apna oont bithaya peshab se farigh huey phir ( wapas ( tashrif laey to maine aap (ke hathon ( par wuzu ka pani dala. aap ne halka wuzu kiya phir maine kaha : aey Allah ke rasool (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ! Namaz ? aap ne farmaya : Namaz aagey ( Muzdalfa mein) hai. iske baad Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) sawar huey yahan tak ke Muzdalfa tashrif laey aur Namaz ada ki. phir (agley din) Muzdalfa ki subah Hazrat Fazal (bin-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu)) Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath ontni par Sawar huey. Kureb ne kaha : mujhey Abdullah-bin-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) ne Fazal (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat kartey huey khabar di ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) jamara ( Aqba ( pahunchne tak talbiya pukaartey rahe."
"3092","Hushaim ne kaha : hamein Husain ne kaseer-bin-mudrik Ashjai se khabar di, unhon-ne Abdur-Rehman-bin-Yazeed se riwayat ki ke Hazrat Abdullah (Raziallahu anhu) (bin-Masood ( ne Muzdalfa se lot'tey waqt talbiya kaha : to kaha gaya : kya ye dehati ( baddoo ( hain? is par Abdullah (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha : kya log bhool gaey hain ya gumraah ho gaey hain? maine us hasti se suna jin par sura Baqra nazil ki gaee wo us jagah par) لبيك اللهم لبيك ( keh rahe they."
"3093","Sufiyan ne hamein Husain se isi sanad ke sath ( yahi ( hadis bayan ki."
"3108","Sulaiman-bin Bilal ne Yahya-bin-Saeed se riwayat ki, (kaha : ( mujhey Adi-bin Sabit ne khabar di ke Abdullah-bin Yazeed khutmi (Raziallahu anhu) ne unhein hadis bayan ki, abu Ayub Ansari (Raziallahu anhu) ne unhein khabar di ke unhon-ne Hijjatul-wada ke mauqe par Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath maghrib aur isha ki namazein Muzdalfa mein ada kin."
"3109","Quteba aur ibne- Rumeh ne Lais-bin-Sad se aur unhon-ne Yahya-bin-Saeed se isi sanad ke sath bayan ki, ibne- Rumeh ne apni riwayat mein kaha : Abdullah-bin Yazeed khitmi (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai aur wo ibne-Zubair (Raziallahu anhu) ke door hukumat mein Kufa ke governer they."
"3222","hamein Leis ne ibne-Shahab se hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne abu-Salma aur Urwa se riwayat ki ke Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ne kaha Safiya-binte-Huyi (Raziallahu anhu) tawaaf ifaaza karne ke baad haaiza ho gain Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ne kaha : maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke samney unke haiz ka tazkira kiya to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : kya wo hamein (waapsii se) rokney wali hain? ( Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ne) kaha : maine kaha : aey Allah ke rasool! wo ( tawaaf ifaaza ke liye) gaee thin aur Baitullah ka tawaaf kiya tha phir ( tawaaf ( ifaaza karne ke baad haaiza hui hain to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : to ( phir hamarey sath hi ( kooch karein."
"3223","Yunus ne ibne-Shahab se isi sanad ke sath khabar di (Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ne) kaha Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki bevi Safiya-binte-Huyi (Raziallahu anhu) hujjatul-wadaa' ke mauqe par tahaarat (paakizgi) ki haalat mein tawaaf ifaaza kar leney ke baad haaiza ho gain . aagey Leis ki hadis ki tarah hai."
"3224","Abdur-Rehman-bin-Qasim ne apne walid ( Qasim-bin-Muhammad-bin-abi-Bakr ( se unhon-ne Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat ki ke unhon-ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke samney zikr kiya ke Safiya (Raziallahu anhu) haaiza ho gaee hain aagey Zohri ki hadis ke ham mana (alfaz hain.)"
"3225","Aflah ne hamein Qasim-bin-Muhammad se hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat ki unhon-ne kaha ham dar rahi thin ke Hazrat Safiya (Raziallahu anhu) tawaaf ifaaza karne se pahley haaiza na ho jaaein. kaha Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) hamarey paas tashrif laey aur farmaya : kya Safiya hamein rokney wali hain? ham ne kaha wo tawaaf ifaaza kar chuki hain aap ne farmaya to phir nahi (rokengii)."
"3226","Umra binte-Abdur-Rehman ne Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat ki ke unhon-ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se kaha : aey Allah ke rasool! Safiya-binte-Huyi (Raziallahu anhu) haaiza ho gaee hain to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : shayad hamein ( waapsii se) rok lein gii. kya unhon-ne tumharey sath Baitullah ka tawaaf ( tawaaf ifaaza ( nahi kiya? unhon-ne kaha kyon nahi aap ne farmaya : to phir kooch karo."
"3227","abu-Salma ne Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat ki ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Hazrat Safiya (Raziallahu anhu) se aisa koi kaam chaha jo aik aadmi apni biwi se chahta hai to sab ( beeviyon ( ne kaha : aey Allah ke rasool! wo haaiza hain aap ne farmaya : to (kya) ye hamein ( kooch ( karne se) rokney wali hain? unhon-ne kaha : aey Allah ke rasool! unhon-ne qurbani ke din tawaaf ziyaarat ( tawaaf ifaaza ( kar liya tha. aap ne farmaya : to wo bhi tumharey sath kooch karen."
"3228","Hakam ne Ibrahim se unhon-ne Aswad se aur unhon-ne Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat ki unhon-ne kaha Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne jab rawaangii ka irada kiya to achcha (dekha ke) Hazrat Safiya (Raziallahu anhu) apne khemey ke darwazey par parieshaan khadi thin aap ne farmaya : tumhara na koi baal na bachcha ! ( phir bhi) tum hamein ( yahin ( rokney wali ho. phir aap ne unse puchha : kya tum ne qurbani ke din tawaaf ifaaza kiya tha? unhon-ne jawab diya : ji haan aap ne farmaya : to ( phir ( chalo. (yani unke paas ja kar unse bhi puchha aur tasdeeq ki)"
"3229","Aamash aur Mansoor donon ne ibrahim se unhon-ne Aswad se unhon-ne Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se unhon-ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat ki. (aagey) hakam ki hadis ke ham mana riwaayat hai albatta wo donon (unke) ghamzada aur pareshan honey ka zikr nahi kartey."
"3262","Shoba ne hamein abdul-Malik-bin-Umair se hadis bayan ki, kaha : maine Qaza' se suna, unhon-ne kaha maine Abu-Saeed Khudri (Raziallahu anhu) se suna, unhon-ne kaha : maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se char baatein sunein jo mujhey bahut achi lagein aur bahut pasand aaein. aap ne mana farmaya ke koi aurat do din ka safar karey magar is tarah ke uske sath uska shoher ya koi mehrem ho. aur aagey baqi hadis bayan ki."
"3463","hamein Muhammad-bin-Musanna ne hadis bayan ki, kaha : hamein Abdus-Samad ne hadis sunai, kaha : hamein Shoba ne Aamash se, unhon-ne Abu-Saleh se, unhon-ne Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se, unhon-ne Nabi akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat ki magar unhon-ne kaha : apne bhai ke saudey par aur apne bhai ke paigham nikah par. (riwaayat : 3461 mein musalman ke alfaz hain. ("
"3499","Hazrat abu-Musa (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne us shakhs ke barey mein, jo apni londi ko aazad karta hai, phir us se shadi karta hai, farmaya : uske liye 2 ajr hain. ( aazad karne ka ajr aur uske baad shadi ke zariey usey izzat ka maqam dene ka ajr.)"
"3525","Ziyad bin Sad ne kaha : maine Sabit (bin ayaaz) Aaraj se suna, wo Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se hadis bayan kar rahe they ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : badtareen khana (aisey) walimey ka khana hai ke jo usmein aata hai usey us se roka jata hai aur jo us (mein shumooliyat ( se inkar karta hai usey bulaya jata hai. aur jis shakhs ne dawat qabool na ki, us ne Allah aur uske rasool ki nafarmani ki."
"3695","Mamar ne Zohri se, unhon-ne Ubaidullah bin-Abdullah-bin abi Sor se, unhon-ne Hazrat Ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, unhon-ne kaha : main shiddat se khahish mand raha tha ke Hazrat umr (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki beeviyon mein se un 2 ke barey mein sawal karun jinke mutaalliq Allah Taala ne farmaya : agar tum donon Allah se tauba karti ho to yaqinan tumharey dil aagey jhuk gaey hain yahan tak ke Hazrat umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne Haj (ka safar ( kya aur maine bhi unke sath Haj kya, (wapsi par) ham rastey ke aik hissey mein they ke umr (Raziallahu anhu) (apni zarurat ke liye rastey se) aik taraf hat gaey aur main bhi pani ka bartan lene unke sath hat gaya, wo sehra mein chaley gaey, phir mere paas aaey to maine unke hathon par pani undela, unhon-ne wuzu kya to maine kaha : aey ameerul-momeneen! Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki beeviyon mein se wo 2 kon si thin jinke barey mein Allah Taala ne farmaya hai : agar tum donon Allah se tauba karo to yaqinan tumharey dil jhuk gaey hain? umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha : Ibne-Abbas ! tum par tajjub hai ! . Zohri ne kaha : Allah ki qism ! unhon (ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu)) ne jo sawal unse kya, wo unhein bura laga aur unhon-ne ( iska jawab ( chhipaaya bhi nahi. padhi. unhon-ne kaha : wo Hafsa aur Aaisha (Raziallahu anhunna) thin. phir Hazrat umr (Raziallahu anhu) baat sunaney lagey aur kaha : ham Quraish ke log aisi qaum they jo apni aurton par ghalib they, jab ham Madina aaey to ham ne aisey log paaey jin par unki auratein ghalib thin, chunanche hamari aurton ne bhi unki aurton se seekhna shuru kar diya. (mardon ko palat kar jawab dene lagin.) umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha : mera ghar oopri ilaaqey bani Umayya bin Zaid ke mahalley mein tha, aik din main apni biwi par naraz hua, to wo mujhey palat kar jawab dene lagi, mujhey iska jawab dena bada na-gawar guzra to usne kaha : tumhen ye na-gawar guzarta hai ke main tumhen jawab dun? Allah ki qism ! Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki beeviyan bhi Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko jawab de deti hain, aur unmein se koi aik to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko raat tak pura din chhod bhi deti hai (roothi rehti hai.) main chala, Hafsa (Raziallahu anha) ke yahan gaya aur kaha : kya tum Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko palat kar jawab de deti ho? unhon-ne kaha : ji haan. maine (phir) puchha : kya tum mein se koi unhein raat tak din bhar ke liye chhod bhi deti hai? unhon-ne kaha : ji haan ! maine kaha : tum mein se jisne bhi aisa kya wo naakaam hui aur khasaarey mein padi. kya tum mein se koi is baat se be-khof ho jati hai ke apne rasool (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki narazgi ki wjah se Allah ( bhi) is par naraz ho jaeyga to wo tabah w barbad ho jaeygi? (aainda) tum Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko na jawab dena, na unse kisi cheez ka mutalba karna, tumhen jo chahiye mujh se maang lena. tumhen ye baat dhokey mein na daal de ke tumhari hamsaai (saukan) tum se zyada khoobsurat aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko zyada mehbub hai. unki murad Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se thi. Hazrat umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha : Ansar mein se mera aik padosi tha. padhi. ham baari-baari (oopri ilaaqey se) utar kar Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir hotey they. aik din wo utarta aur aik din main utarta, wo mere paas wahi wghaira ki khabrein laata aur main bhi (apni baari ke din) uske paas isi tarah ki khabrein laata aur (un dinon) ham aapas mein baatein kar rahe they ke ghassani hamarey sath ladai karne ke liye ghodon ko khadiyan laga rahe they, mera sathi ( Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir honey ke liye awaali se) utra , phir isha ke waqt mere paas aaya, mera darwaza khatkhataya, phir mujhey awaz di, main bahar nikla to usne kaha : aik bahut bada waqia roonuma ho gaya hai. maine puchha : kya hua? kya ghassani aa gaey? usne kaha : nahi, balke wo us se bhi bada aur lamba-chauda ( mamla) hai. Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne apni beeviyon ko talaaq de di hai. maine kaha : Hafsa (Raziallahu anha) to naakaam hui aur khasaarey mein pad gaee. main to (pahley hi) samajhta tha ke aisa honey wala hai. (doosrey din) jab main subah ki Namaz padh chuka to apne kapdey pahney , Madina mein aaya aur Hafsa (Raziallahu anha) ke paas gaya, wo ro rahi thi. maine puchha : kya Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne tum sab ko talaaq de di hai? usne kaha : main nahi janti, albatta aap alag thalag us baala-khaaney mein hain. main aap ke siyah faam ghulam ke paas aaya, aur usey kaha, umr (Raziallahu anhu) ke liye ijazat maango. wo gaya, phir meri taraf bahar aaya aur kaha : maine Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke samney tumhara zikr kya magar aap khamosh rahe. main chala aaya yahan tak ke member ke paas aa kar baith gaya, to wahan bahut se log baithey they, unmein se kuchh ro rahe they, mein thodi der betha, phir jo kaifiyat mujh par taari thi wo mujh par ghalib aa gaee. main phir ghulam ke paas aaya aur kaha : umr ke liye ijazat maango, wo andar dakhil hua, phir meri taraf bahar aaya aur kaha : maine Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke samney tumhara zikr kya, magar aap khamosh rahe. main peeth pher kar muda to achcha ghulam mujhey bulaney laga, aur kaha : andar chaley jao, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne tumhen ijazat de di hai. main andar dakhil hua, Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko salam arz kya to dekha ke aap banti ki aik chataai par sahara lekar baithey they, jisne aap ke pahlu par nishan daal diye they, maine kaha : kya aap ne Allah ke rasool! apni beeviyon ko talaaq de di hai? aap ne meri taraf (dekhtey huey) apna sar Mubarak uthaya aur farmaya : nahi. maine kaha : Allahu-akbar . Allah ke rasool! agar aap hamein dekhtey to ham Quraish aisi qaum they jo apni beeviyon par ghalib rahtey they. jab ham Madina aaey to ham ne aisi qaum ko paya jinki auratein un par ghalib thin, to hamari aurton ne bhi unki aurton (ki aadat ( se seekhna shuru kar diya, chunanche aik din main apni biwi par barham hua to wo mujhey palat kar jawab dene lagi mujhey iska jawab dena intihai na-gawar guzra, usne kaha : tumhen ye na-gawar guzarta hai ke main tumhen jawab deti hun? Allah ki qism ! Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki beeviyan bhi aapko jawab de deti hain, aur unmein se koi to aapko raat tak chhod bhi deti (rooth bhi jati) hai. to maine kaha : unmein se jisne aisa kya wo naakaam hui aur khasaarey mein padi . kya (ye kaam karke ( unmein se koi is baat se be khof ho sakti hai ke apne rasool ki narazagi ki wjah se Allah is par naraz ho jaey (agar aisa hua) to wo tabah ho gaee. is par Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) muskura diye to maine kaha : Allah ke rasool! main Hafsa ke paas gaya aur us ne kaha : tumhen ye baat kisi dhokey mein na daal de ke tumhari hamsaai ( saukan ( tum se zyada khoobsurat aur Allah ke rasool (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko tum se zyada mahboob hai. is par aap dobara muskuraaey to maine kaha : Allah ke rasool! ( kuchh der baith kar) baat cheet karun? aap ne farmaya : haan. chunanche main baith gaya aur maine sar uper karke ghar mein nigah daudaai to Allah ki qism ! usmein teen chamdon ke siwa kuchh na tha jis par nazar padti, maine kaha : Allah ke rasool! dua farmaiye ke Allah aap ki ummat par faraakhi farmaey. faarsiyon aur roomiyon par wusat ki gaee hai halanke wo Allah Taala ki ibadat nahi kartey. is par Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) seedhey ho kar baith gaey, phir farmaya : ibne-khattaab ! kya tum kisi shak mein mubtala ho? ye aisey log hain jinhein un (ke hissey ( ki achi cheezein jald hi duniya mein de di gaee hain. maine kaha : Allah ke rasool! mere liye bakhshish talab kijiye aur aap ne un ( beeviyon ( par sakht ghussey ki wjah se qism kha li thi ke aik mahina unke paas nahi jaengey. yahan tak ke Allah Taala ne aap par itaab farmaya, (ke beeviyon ki baat par aap kyon ghamzada hotey aur halal chizon se door rehney ki qism khaatey hain. ("
"3725","Humaid-bin-Naafe ne Zainab-binte-abi-Salma (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki ke unhon-ne in ( Humaid ( ko ye teen hadisein bayan kein, kaha : Zenab (Raziallahu anha) ne kaha : jab Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki bevi mohtarma Hazrat Umme-Habiba (Raziallahu anhu) ke walid Abu-Sufiyan (Raziallahu anhu) faut huey to main unke yahaan gaee, Umme-Habiba (Raziallahu anhu) ne zard rang mili makhloot ya koi aur khushbu mangwaai , usmein se (pahley ( aik bachchi ko lagai (taake ( hath par uski miqdar bahut kam ho jaey) phir apne rukhsaaron par hath mal liya. phir kaha : Allah ki qism ! mujhey khushbu ki zarurat na thi magar ( baat ye hai ke) maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suna, aap member par irshad farma rahe they : kisi aurat ke liye jo Allah Taala aur aakhirat ke din par eman rakhti ho, halal nahi ke wo kisi bhi marney waley par teen din se zyada sog manaaey, magar khawind par, char maah das din (sog manaaey)."
"3726","Zenab ( binte-abi-Salma (Raziallahu anhu)) ne kaha : phir main Zainab-binte-( Jahash ( (Raziallahu anhu) ke yahan us waqt gaee jab unke bhai ( Ubaidullah-bin-Jahash ( faut huey, to unhon-ne bhi khushbu mangwaai aur lagai , phir kaha : Allah ki qism ! mujhey khushbu ki zarurat na thi magar ( baat ye hai ke) maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suna, aap member par irshad farma rahe they : kisi aurat ke liye jo Allah par aur aakhirat ke din par eman rakhti hai, halal nahi ke wo kisi marney waley par teen din se zyada sog karey magar shauhar par, char mahiney das din (sog kare)."
"3727","Zenab (Raziallahu anha) ne kaha : maine apni walida Umme-Salma (Raziallahu anha) se suna wo keh rahi thin, aik aurat Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir hui aur kaha : Allah ke rasool! meri beti ka shauhar faut ho gaya hai. aur uski aankhon mein takleef hai. kya ham usey surma laga dein? to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : nahi do ya teen baar ( puchha gaya) har baar aap farmatey : nahi, phir farmaya : ye to sirf char maah das din hain. halanke jahiliyat main tum mein se aik aurat ( pura ( aik saal guzarney ke baad mengni phainkaa karti thi."
"3730","Zenab ne unhein ( Humaid ko) apni walida (Hazrat Umme-Salma (Raziallahu anha) ( se aur Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki ahliya Hazrat Zenab (Raziallahu anha) se ya Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki beeviyon mein se kisi se yahi hadis bayan ki."
"3792","Zayda ne Sulaiman (Aamash) se, unhon-ne Abu-Saleh se, unhon-ne Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se aur unhon-ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat ki ke aap ne farmaya : jisne apne aazad karne walon ki ijazat ke baghair kisi (doosri ( qaum ki 'walaa' ikhtiyar ki, is par Allah ki, farishton ki aur sab logon ki laanat hai, aur qiyamat ke din us se koi fidya qabool kya jaeyga na koi sifarish ."
"3836","Hammad ne hamein Amr-bin-Dinar se hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne Taaus se aur unhon-ne Hazrat Ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : jisne ghalla khareeda to wo usey pura kar leney se pahley aagey farokht na kare. Hazrat Ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha : main har cheez ko usi ki tarah khayal karta hun."
"3842","Ubaidullah ne Naafe se, unhon-ne Hazrat ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : jo shakhs ghalla khareedey to wo usey pura kar leney tak aagey farokht na kare."
"3845","Abdullah-bin-Dinar se riwayat hai ke unhon-ne Hazrat ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) se suna, unhon-ne kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : jo shakhs ghalla khareedey to usey qabzey mein leney se pahley aagey farokht na kare."
"4251","uper wali hadis isi sanad se marvi hai ‌."
"4252","Rauh bin Ubada ne hamein hadis bayan ki, (kaha :) hamein ibne-Juraij ne hadis sunai, (kaha : ( mujhey Yahya bin Ayub ne khabar di ke unhein Yazeed bin abi Habib ne isi sanad se khabar di. padhi. Abdur-Razzaq ki hadis ki tarah ."
"4435","Leis ne ibne-Shahab se, unhon-ne Ubaidullah-bin-Abdullah-bin-Utba-bin-Masood se, unhon-ne Hazrat Abu-Hurera aur Hazrat Zaid-bin-Khalid Juhni (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki ke un donon ne kaha : baadiya nasheen (jangal ke rehne wale) mein se aik aadmi Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas aaya aur kehney laga : aey Allah ke rasool ! main aapko Allah ki qism deta hun, aap mere liye Allah ki kitab ke mutabiq faisla karein. (iske ( mukhalif fareeq ne kaha : aur wo us se zyada samajh daar tha, ji haan , hamarey darmyan Allah ki kitab ki taraf se faisla kijiye aur mujhey ( kuchh kehney ki) ijazat dijiye. to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : kaho. usne kaha : mera betaa iske yahaan mazdoor tha, us ne iski biwi se zina kiya aur mujhey bataya gaya ke mere betey par rajm (sangsaar) (ki saza) hai, chunanche maine uski taraf se aik sau bakriyan aur aik londi bataur fidya di, aur ahale-ilm se puchha to unhon-ne mujhey bataya hai ke mere betey par (to) aik sau kode aur aik saal ki jilaa watani hai aur rajm (sangsaar) uski aurat par hai. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya is zaat ki qism jiske hath mein meri jaan hai ! main tumharey darmyan Allah ki kitab ke mutabiq faisla karunga, londi aur bakriyan tujhey wapas milein gi, tumharey betey par aik sau kode aur aik saal ki jilaa watani hai. unnais ! ( Anas-bin-zuhhak Aslami (Raziallahu anhu) murad hain. aurat unhi ke qabeeley se thi) us (doosrey aadmi) ki aurat ke yahan jao, agar wo aetiraaf karey to usey rajm (sangsaar) kar do. kaha : wo iske yahaan gaey to usne aetiraaf kar liya, Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne us (ko rajm (sangsaar) karne) ka hukm diya, chunanche usey rajm (sangsaar) kar diya gaya."
"4436","Yunus , Saleh aur Mamar sab ne Zohri se isi sanad ke sath isi tarah hadis bayan ki."
"4504","mujhey Abdullah-bin Wahab ne khabar di, kaha : mujhey Suhak bin Usman ne abu-Nazar se hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne Basar-bin-Saeed se aur unhon-ne Hazrat Zaid-bin-Khalid Johni (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, unhon-ne kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se ( kisi ki) giri aur bhuli hui cheez ke barey mein puchha gaya to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : aik saal uski tashheer karo, agar uski shanaakht na ho paaey (koi usey apni cheez ki haisiyat se na pehchan sakey ( to uski thaili aur bandhan ki shanaakht kar lo, phir usey khaao (istemal karo), phir agar uska Malik aa jaey to usey uski adaaeygi kar do."
"4505","Abu-Bakar Hanfi ne Suhak bin Usman se isi sanad ke sath hadis bayan ki aur unhon-ne hadis mein kaha : agar usey pehchan liya jaey to ada kar do warna uski thaili , bandhan , (jis ( bartan (main band thi) aur tadaad ki pehchan (mehfooz) rakho."
"4521","abu-Bakar-bin-abi-Sheba ne kaha : hamein Wakee-bin-Jarraah ne Sufiyan se hadis bayan ki, neez Ishaq-bin-Ibrahim ne kaha : hamein yahya-bin-Aadam ne khabar di, kaha : hamein Sufiyan ne khabar di, kaha : ye hadis unhon-ne hamein imlaa karwaai."
"4522","neez Abdullah-bin Hashim ne kaha, padhi. alfaz unhi ke hain. padhi. mujhey Abdur-Rehman-bin-Mehdi ne hadis bayan ki, kaha : hamein Sufiyan ne Alqama bin-Marsad se hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne Sulaiman-bin-Barida se aur unhon-ne apne walid se riwayat ki, unhon-ne kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) jab kisi badey lashkar ya chhotey dastey par kisi ko ameer muqarrar kartey to usey khas uski apni zaat ke barey mein Allah se darney ki aur un tamam musalmanon ke barey mein, jo uske sath hain, bhalai ki talqeen kartey, phir farmatey : Allah ke naam se Allah ki raah mein jihad karo, jo Allah Taala se kufr kartey hain unse lado, na khayanat karo, na bad-ehdi karo, na musla karo aur na kisi bachchey ko qatl karo aur jab mushrikon mein se apne dushman se takraao to unhein teen baton ki taraf bulao , unmein se jisey wo taslim kar lein, (usi ko) unki taraf se qabool kar lo aur un ( par hamley ( se ruk jao. unhein Islam ki dawat do, agar wo maan lein to usey un (ki taraf ( se qabool kar lo aur (jang se) ruk jao, phir unhein apne ilaaqey se muhajireen ke ilaaqey mein aa janey ki dawat do aur unhein bataao ke agar wo aisa karengey to unke liye wahi huquq hongey jo muhajireen ke hain aur un par wahi zimmedariyaan hongi jo muhajireen par hain. agar wo wahan se naqle-makaani karne par inkar karein to unhein bataao ke phir wo baadiya-nasheen musalmanon ki tarah hongey, un par Allah ka wahi hukm Nafiz hoga jo mominon par Nafiz hota hai aur ghaneemat aur fai mein se unke liye kuchh na hoga magar is sura mein ke wo musalmanon ke sath mil kar jihad karein. agar wo inkar karein to unse jiziye ka mutalba karo, agar wo taslim kar lein to unki taraf se qabool kar lo aur ruk jao aur agar wo inkar karein to Allah se madad maango aur unse lado aur jab tum kisi qiley (mein rehney) walon ka muhaasra karo aur wo tum se chaahein ke tum unhein Allah aur uske Nabi ka ehado-paimaan ata karo to unhein Allah aur uske Nabi ka ehdo-paimaan na do balke apni aur apne sathiyon ki taraf se ehad w amaan do, kyonke ye baat ke tum log apne aur apne sathiyon ke ahado-paimaan ki khilaf-warzi kar baitho, iski nisbat halki hai ke tum Allah aur uske rasool (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ka ahado-paimaan tod 2 aur jab tum qila band logon ka muhaasra karo aur wo tum se chaahein ke tum unhein Allah ke hukm par (qiley se) nichey utarney do to unhein Allah ke hukm par nichey na utarney do balke apne hukm par unhein nichey utaaro kyonke tumhen malum nahi ke tum unke barey mein Allah ke sahi hukm par pahunch patey ho ya nahi. ( ibne- Hisham ne kaha : ( Abdur-Rehman ne yahi kaha ya isi tarah kaha, Ishaq ne apni hadis ke aakhir mein ye izafa kya : yahya-bin-Aadam se riwayat hai ke) Alqama ne) kaha : maine ye hadis muqaatil bin Hayyan se bayan ki. padhi. Yahya ne kaha : yani Alqama ne ibne- hayyan se bayan ki. padhi. to unhon-ne kaha : mujhey Muslim-bin Haisam ne Hazrat Nauman bin Muqrin (Raziallahu anhu) ke waastey se Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se isi tarah hadis bayan ki."
"4680","Sabit ne Hazrat Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki ke Hunain ke din Hazrat Umme-Sulaim (Raziallahu anhu) ne aik khanjar (apne paas rakh ( liya, wo unke sath tha, Hazrat abu-Talha (Raziallahu anhu) ne usey dekh liya to unhon-ne kaha : Allah ke rasool ! ye Umme-Sulaim (Raziallahu anhu) hain, inke paas aik khanjar hai. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unse puchha : ye khanjar kaisa hai? unhon-ne kaha : maine ye isliye liya hai ke agar mushrikon mein se koi mere qareeb aaya to main is se uska pet chaak kar dun gii. (ye sun kar) Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) hansney lagey. unhon-ne kaha : aey Allah ke rasool ! hamarey baad daayra Islam mein shamil honey waale, jinhein (fatah Makka ke din) maafi di gaee thi ( Hunain ke din) aapko chhod kar bhag gaey, unhein qatl karwaa dijiye. to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : Umme-Sulaim ! bila shubah Allah Taala kafi ho gaya ( unka bhagna jang haarney ka baais na bana (aur us ne ehsan farmaya. (ke hamein fateh ata kar di.)"
"4681","Ishaq-bin-Abdullah-bin-abi-Talha ne (apne chacha (Hazrat Anas-bin-Malik (Raziallahu anhu) se (apni daadi ( Umme-Sulaim (Raziallahu anhu) ke waqiey ke hawale se Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se Sabit ki hadis ki tarah riwayat ki."
"4725","Ubaidullah-bin-Umar, Ayub, Suhak bin Usman aur Usama (bin Zaid Lesi ( sab ne Naafe se, unhon-ne ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) se isi tarah hadis bayan ki jis tarah Leis ne Naafe se bayan ki."
"4726","Ubaidullah (bin Umar-bin Hafs ( ne Naafe se, unhon-ne Hazrat ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) se isi tarah hadis bayan ki jis tarah Leis ne Naafe se bayan ki."
"4747","Mughira bin Abdur-Rehman ne abu-Zanad se, unhon-ne Aaraj se, unhon-ne Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se, unhon-ne Nabi akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat ki, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : jisne meri itaat ki usne Allah ki itaat ki aur jisne meri nafarmani ki usne Allah ki nafarmani ki aur jisne ameer ki itaat ki usne meri itaat ki aur jisne ameer ki nafarmani ki usne meri nafarmani ki."
"4748","ibne-Uena ne abu-Zinad se isi sanad ke sath riwayat ki, unhon-ne ye bayan nahi kya : jisne ameer ki nafarmani ki us ne meri nafarmani ki."
"4780","hamein Khalid-bin Haris ne hadis bayan ki, kaha : hamein Shoba bin Hajjaj ne Qatada se hadis sunai, unhon-ne kaha : maine Hazrat Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se suna, wo Hazrat Usaid-bin-Huzair (Raziallahu anhu) se hadis bayan kar rahe they ke aik Ansari ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se tanhai mein baat ki, usi (pichhli hadis) ki tarah."
"4781","Muaz ne Shoba se isi sanad ke sath hadis sunai aur ye nahi kaha is ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se tanhai mein baat ki."
"4819","abu-Awana ne Tariq se, unhon-ne Saeed-bin-Musaiyab se riwayat ki, kaha : mere walid bhi un logon mein se they jinhoney darakht ke nichey Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se bait ki thi. unhon-ne kaha : jab ham agley saal Haj ke liye gaey to hamein uski jagah nahi mili , agar tum logon ko wo jagah malum ho gaee hai to tum log zyada jaanney waley ho."
"4820","Sufiyan ne taariq-bin-Abdur-Rehman se hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne Saeed-bin-Musaiyab se, unhon-ne apne walid se riwayat ki ke (baite-rizwan ke saal wo log Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath they, phir agley saal wo log us darakht ko bhool chukey they."
"4905","Husain ne Yahya (bin-abi-kaseer ( se hadis bayan ki, kaha : mujhey Mehri ke Maula abu-Saeed ne hadis bayan ki, kaha : mujhey Hazrat Abu-Saeed Khudri (Raziallahu anhu) ne hadis bayan ki ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne aik lashkar bheja , usi (pichhli hadis) ki tarah."
"4906","Sheban ne Yahya se isi sanad ke sath usi ki tarah riwayat ki."
"4968","Rooh ne kaha : hamein Shoba ne isi sanad ke sath hadis bayan ki."
"4969","Wakee ne Sufiyan se, unhon-ne Maharib se, unhon-ne Hazrat Jaabir (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, kaha : Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne is baat se mana farmaya hai ke insan raat ko) achcha ( ghar walon ke paas ja pahunchey aur unko khayanat (jis tarah khawind ne kaha hua hai, is tarah na rehney (ka mujrim samjhey aur unki kamzoriyaan dhoondey."
"4970","Abdur-Rehman ne kaha : hamein Sufiyan ne isi sanad ke sath hadis bayan ki. Abdur-Rehman ne kaha : Sufiyan ne kaha : mujhey malum nahi ke unko khayanat ka murtakib samjhey aur unki kamzoriyaan talash karey ke alfaz hadis mein hain ya nahi."
"4971","hamein Shoba ne Maharib se hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne Hazrat Jaabir (Raziallahu anhu) se, unhon-ne Nabi akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se ( achcha (raat ko ghar aaney ki karaahat bayan ki aur ye jumla bayan nahi kiya : unko  khayanat karne wala samjhey aur unki kamzoriyaan talash kare."
"5112","abu Mus-hir ne kaha : hamein Yahya bin Hamza ne hadis bayan ki, kaha : mujhey Zubaidi ne Abdur-Rehman bin Jubair-bin-Nufair se hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne apne walid se, unhon-ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke aazad karda ghulam Hazrat Soban (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Hijjatul-wada ke mauqe par mujh se farmaya is gosht ko) sath ley janey ke liye) durust kar lo. unhon-ne kaha : phir maine usko taiyaar kya aur aap us gosht ko tanaawul farmatey rahe yahan tak ke Madina pahunch gaey."
"5113","Muhammad bin-Mubarak ne kaha : hamein Yahya bin Hamza ne isi sanad ke sath hadis bayan ki aur Hijjatul-wada mein ke alfaz nahi kahey ."
"5204","abu-Zubair ne kaha : maine Hazrat Jabir-bin-Abdullah (Raziallahu anhu) ko kehtey huey suna, Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne ghadon raughane-zuft miley huey bartan aur lakdi ke bartan se mana farmaya, (aur ( jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke yahan nabeez banaaney ke liye koi aur bartan na milta to pattharon se baney huey badey bartan mein aap ke liye nabeez banai jati."
"5207","Zarar bin Murra abu Sanan ne Maharib bin Disaar se, unhon-ne Abdullah-bin Barida se, unhon-ne apne walid se riwayat ki, Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : maine tum logon ko mashk ke siwa doosrey bartanon mein nabeez banaaney se mana kya tha (ab tum log) sab bartanon mein piyo lekin koi nasha aawar cheez na piyo."
"5208","Alqama bin-Marsad ne ibne-bareeda se unhon-ne apne walid se riwayat ki ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : maine tum ko kuchh bartanon se mana kya tha bartan kisi cheez ko halal kartey hain na haram albatta har nasha aawar cheez haram hai."
"5214","Shoba ne Saeed bin abi burda se unhon-ne apne walid se unhon-ne Hazrat abu-Musa Ash-ari (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mujhey aur Hazrat Muaz-bin-Jabal (Raziallahu anhu) ko Yaman ki taraf bheja maine kaha ya Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ! hamarey ilaaqey mein jo se aik mashroob banaya jata hai usko Muzar kehtey hain aur aik mashroob shehad se banaya jata hai usko Bita kehtey hain. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : har nasha aawar cheez haram hai."
"5384","abu-Hazim ne Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se unhon-ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se usi ki tarah riwayat ki."
"5393","hamein Sufiyan ne Ashas bin abi Shasa se un sab ki sanad ke sath hadis bayan ki aur shak ke baghair salam aam karne aur soney ki anguthi kaha."
"5519","banu-Najjaar ke aazad karda ghulam abu hubaab Saeed bin Yasar ne Hazrat Zaid-bin-Khalid Johni (Raziallahu anhu) se, unhon-ne Hazrat abu Talha Ansari (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, unhon-ne kaha : maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suna, aap farma rahe they us ghar mein Farishtey dakhil nahi hotey jis mein kutta ho, na (is mein jahan ( mujassamey hon."
"5521","Ismail bin Ibrahim ne Dawud se, unhon-ne azra se, unhon-ne Humaid bin Abdur-Rehman se, unhon-ne Sad bin Hisham se, unhon-ne Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat ki, kaha : hamarey yahan aik parda tha jis mein parindey ki tasweer thi, jab koi shakhs andar aata ye tasweer iske samney aa jati to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mujh se farmaya is pardey ko hata 2 kyonke main jab bhi andar aata hun aur us pardey ko dekhta hun to duniya ko yad karta hun. Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ne kaha : hamarey paas aik chadar thi, ham kehtey they ke uske kinaron par silaa hua kapda resham hai, ham us chadar ko pahntey they."
"5522","Muhammad-bin-Musanna ne kaha : hamein ibne-abi Adi aur Abdul-Aala ne isi sanad ke sath ( Dawud se) hadis bayan ki, ibne- Musanna ne kaha : aur is mein unhon-ne. unki murad Abdul-Aala se hai. ye izafa kya : to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne hamein us chadar ko kaatney ka hukm nahi diya."
"5539","Mansoor ne Muslim-bin sabeeh (abu zuha) se riwayat ki, unhon-ne kaha : main Masruq ke sath aik makkaan mein tha jismein Hazrat Maryam (Alaihissalam) ki tasaweerein thin (ya mujassamey they) Masruq ne kaha : ye Kisraa ki tasweerein hain? maine kaha : nahi ye Maryam (Alaihissalam) ki tasweerein hain. Masruq ne kaha : maine Hazrat Abdullah-bin-Masood (Raziallahu anhu) se suna wo keh rahe they : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : qiyamat ke din sabse zyada azab tasweerein (ya mujassamey) banaaney walon ko hoga."
"5540","Imam Muslim ne kaha : maine Nasar bin Ali jahazmi ke sath Abdul-Aala bin Abdul-Aala se hadis padhi ke hamein Yahya bin abi Ishaq ne (Hazrat Hasan Basri ke bhai) Saeed bin abu Hasan se riwayat bayan ki, kaha : aik shakhs Hazrat Ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) ke paas aaya usne kaha : main ye (jaandaaron ki) tasweerein banata hun, aap mujhey unke mutaalliq fatwa dein. Hazrat Ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha : mere qareeb aao wo qareeb hua unhon-ne phir farmaya mere qareeb aao wo ( mazeed qareeb aaya aap ne iske sar par hath rakh kar farmaya : main tum ko wo baat bataata hun jo maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suni, maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suna, aap farma rahe they : har tasweer banaaney wala jahannam mein hoga aur uski banai hui tasweer ke badley mein Allah Taala aik jaandaar banaeyga wo usey jahannam mein azab dega aur Hazrat Ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) ne farmaya : agar tum ne zaroor ( yahi kaam ( karna hai to darakhton ki aur jin chizon mein jaan nahi unki tasweer banao. Nasar bin Ali ne (jab maine unke samney ye hadis padhi ( uska iqrar kya (ke unhon-ne Abdul-Aala bin Abdul-Aala se isi tarah riwayat ki.)"
"5541","Saeed-bin-abi-Aruba ne nazar bin Anas-bin-Malik se riwayat ki, kaha : main Hazrat Ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) ke paas betha hua tha, aap ne (poochhney walon ke mutaalbey par) fatwey dene shuru kiye aur ye nahi keh rahe they ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne is tarah farmaya hai yahan tak ke aik shakhs ne unse sawal kya ke main ye tasweerein banata hun, Hazrat Ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) ne us se kaha : qareeb aao. wo shakhs qareeb aaya Hazrat Ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha : maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suna, aap farma rahe they. jis shakhs ne duniya mein koi tasweer banai usko is baat ka mukallaf banaya jaeyga ke wo qiyamat ke din usmein Rooh phoonkey aur wo usmein Rooh nahi phoonk sakega."
"5542","Qatada ne nazar bin Anas se riwayat ki ke Hazrat Ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) ke paas aik shakhs aaya aur unhon-ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se usi ki tarah hadis bayan ki."
"5543","ibne-Fuzail ne Umara se, unhon-ne abu-Zura se riwayat ki, unhon-ne kaha : main Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) ke sath Marwan ke ghar gaya, unhon-ne us ghar mein tasweerein dekhin to kaha : maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suna, aap ne farmaya : izzat aur jalaal waaley Allah ne farmaya us shakhs se bada zaalim kon hoga jo meri makhlooq ki tarah makhlooq banaaney chala ho. wo aik zarra to banaein ya aik daana to banaein ya aik jo to banaein!"
"5544","Jarir ne Umara se, unhon-ne abu-Zura se riwayat ki, kaha : main aur Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) Madina mein aik ghar mein gaey jo Saeed ( ibne- Aas ( (Raziallahu anhu) ya Marwan (ibne-Hakam) ke liye banaya ja raha tha, wahan unhon-ne aik musawwir ko ghar mein tasweer banatey huey dekha, unhon-ne kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya aur usi ki tarah riwayat ki aur) Jarir ne) ya aik jau to banaaein (ke alfaz ( bayan nahi kiye."
"5545","Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya is ghar mein Farishtey dakhil nahi hotey jis mein mujassamey (but) ya tasweerein hon."
"5556","Hazrat Umme-Salma (Raziallahu anha) ke aazad karda ghulam naaim abu Abdullah ne hadis bayan ki ke unhon-ne Hazrat Ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) se suna, wo farma rahe they Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne aik gadha dekha jiske chehrey ko nishani lagaaney ke liye daagha gaya tha aap ne usko bahut bura khayal kya, unhon-ne (Hazrat Ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu)) ne kaha : Allah ki qism ! main jo hissey chehrey se sabse zyada door ho iske ilawa kisi jagah nishani sabt nahi karta. phir unhon-ne apne gadhey ke barey mein hukm diya to uski peeth (ke wo hissey jahan dam hilatey waqt lagti hai) par nishani sabt ki gaee ye pahley aadmi hain jinhoney us jagah daaghney ka shuruat kya."
"5557","Hazrat Umme-Salma (Raziallahu anha) ke aazad karda ghulam naaim abu Abdullah ne hadis bayan ki ke unhon-ne Hazrat Ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) se suna, wo farma rahe they Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne aik gadha dekha jiske chehrey ko nishani lagaaney ke liye daagha gaya tha aap ne usko bahut bura khayal kya, unhon-ne (Hazrat Ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu)) ne kaha : Allah ki qism ! main jo hissey chehrey se sabse zyada door ho iske ilawa kisi jagah nishani sabt nahi karta. phir unhon-ne apne gadhey ke barey mein hukm diya to uski peeth (ke wo hissey jahan dam hilatey waqt lagti hai) par nishani sabt ki gaee ye pahley aadmi hain jinhoney us jagah daaghney ka shuruat kya."
"5569","Yahya-bin-Saeed ne Ubaidullah se riwayat ki, kaha : mujhey Umar-bin Naafe ne apne walid se khabar di. unhon-ne Hazrat ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne qaza se mana farmaya, maine Naafe se puchha : qaza kya hai? unhon-ne kaha : bachchey ke sar ke kuchh hissey ke baal moond diye jayen aur kuchh hissey ko chhod diya jaey."
"5570","abu-Usama aur Abdullah-bin-Numair donon ne kaha : hamein Ubaidullah ne isi sanad ke sath hadis bayan ki, aur unhon-ne abu-Usama ki hadis main (qaza ki) tafseer ko Ubaidullah ka qaul qarar diya hai. (unke shagirdon ke samney Ubaidullah ne ye wazaahat Naafe ki taraf mansub kiye baghair bayan ki.)"
"5571","abu-Usama aur Abdullah-bin-Numair donon ne kaha : hamein Ubaidullah ne isi sanad ke sath hadis bayan ki, aur unhon-ne abu-Usama ki hadis main (qaza ki) tafseer ko Ubaidullah ka qaul qarar diya hai. (unke shagirdon ke samney Ubaidullah ne ye wazaahat Naafe ki taraf mansub kiye baghair bayan ki.)"
"5572","Usman bin Usman ghatfaani aur Rooh ( bin-Qasim ( ne Umar-bin Naafe se Ubaidullah ki sanad se usi ki tarah hadis bayan ki aur donon ne tafseer (qaza ki wazaahat ( ko hadis ka la hiqa banaya. ( alag se bayan nahi kya. ("
"5637","Muhammad-bin-Musanna aur Muhammad-bin Bishr ne kaha : hamein Muhammad-bin-Jafar ne hadis bayan ki, kaha : hamein Shoba ne hadis sunai unhon-ne kaha : maine Qatada se suna, unhon-ne Salim se, unhon-ne Hazrat Jabir-bin-Abdullah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki ke Ansar mein se aik shakhs ke yahan ladka paida hua us ne uska naam Muhammad rakhna chaha to wo Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas aaya aur aap se puchha : Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : Ansar ne achchha kya, mere naam par naam rakho, meri kunniyat par (apni ( kunniyat na rakho."
"5669","Yazeed-bin-abi-Habib ne Muhammad-bin-Amr-bin-Ata se riwayat ki, kaha : maine apni beti ka naam barra rakha to Hazrat Zenab binte-abi Salma (Raziallahu anhu) ne mujh se kaha ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne ye naam rakhney se mana farmaya hai. aur (bataya ke) mera naam bhi pahley barra rakha gaya Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : tum log apni paarsaai na bayan karo Allah Taala hi khub janta hai ke tum mein se neku-kaar kon hai? ( ghar ke) logon ne kaha : phir ham iska kiya naam rakhein ? Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : iska naam Zenab rakh do."
"5670","Saeed-bin-Amr-ash-ashi,  Ahmad-bin-Hanbal (Rehmatullahi-alaih) aur abu-Bakar-bin-abi-Sheba ne hamein hadis bayan ki. alfaz imam Ahmed ke hain, ash-ashi ne kaha : hamein Sufiyan-bin-Uena ne khabar di jabke doosrey ne kaha : hamein hadis bayan ki. abu-Zinad se, unhon-ne Aaraj se, unhon-ne Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se, unhon-ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat ki ke Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : Allah Taala ke nazdeek sabse zaleel samjha jane wala naam us shakhs ka hai jo shahanshaah kahlaaey aur ibne-Abi-Sheba ne apni riwayat mein izafa kiya : izzat aur jalaal waaley Allah ke siwa koi ( badhshahat ka ( Malik nahi hai. ash-ashi ka qaul hai : Sufiyan ne kaha : jaisey ( shahanshaah ( hai. aur Ahmad-bin-Hanbal ne kaha : maine abu Amr ( Ishaq-bin-muraar Shebani , nahwi , koofi) se akhna' ke barey mein puchha to unhon-ne kaha : (iske mana hain) auza' (intihai haqeer)."
"5762","Sufiyan-bin-Uena ne hamein Zohri se hadis bayan ki unhon-ne Urwa se, unhon-ne Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat ki, kaha : yahudiyon ki aik jamat ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se milney ke liye ijazat talab ki aur unhon-ne kaha ( اَلسَامُ عَلَيكُم ( (aap par maut ho ! (Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ne kaha : balke tum par maut ho aur laanat ho. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : Aaisha ! Allah Taala har mamley mein narmi pasand farmata hai. Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ne kaha : kya aap ne suna nahi ke unhon-ne kya kaha tha? Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : maine ( وَعَلَيكُم ( (aur tum par ho ( keh diya tha."
"5764","Saleh aur Mamar donon ne Zohri se isi sanad ke sath hadis bayan ki, donon ki hadis mein hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : maine ( علیکم ( keh diya tha aur unhon-ne iske sath واؤ (aur ( nahi lagaya ."
"5826","abu-Zubair ne Hazrat Jaabir (Raziallahu anhu) se aur unhon-ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat ki ke aap ne farmaya : tum mein se koi shakhs Jumey ke din apne bhai ko khada na karey ke phir dusri taraf se aa kar uski jagah par khud baith jaey. balke (jo aaey wo) kahey jagah kushaada (khuli hui) kar do."
"5827","abu-Zubair ne Hazrat Jaabir (Raziallahu anhu) se aur unhon-ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat ki ke aap ne farmaya : tum mein se koi shakhs Jumey ke din apne bhai ko khada na karey ke phir dusri taraf se aa kar uski jagah par khud baith jaey. balke (jo aaey wo) kahey jagah kushaada (khuli hui) kar do."
"5885","Abdur-Rehman-bin-Aswad ne apne walid se riwayat ki, unhon-ne kaha : maine Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se dam karne ke barey mein malum kiya to unhon-ne bataya Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Ansar ke aik ghar ke logon ko har zahreeley janwar ke dank se (shifa ke liye) dam karne ki ijazat ata farmai ."
"5886","Ibrahim ne Aswad se, unhon-ne Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat ki, kaha : Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Ansar ke aik ghar ke logon ko har zahreeley dank ke ilaaj ke liye dam karne ki ijazat di thi."
"5935","Bukair ne kaha ke Aasim bin Umar-bin Qatada ne unhein hadis sunai ke Hazrat Jabir-bin-Abdullah (Raziallahu anhu) ne miqna (bin Sanan taabai ( ki iyaadat ki, phir farmaya : main (is waqt tak) yahan se nahi jaaunga jab tak ke tum pachhney na lagwaa lo, kyonke maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suna hai, aap farmatey hain : yaqinan usmein shifa hai."
"5968","Saeed bin Masruq ne abaaya bin Rifaa se, unhon-ne apne dada se, unhon-ne Hazrat Rafe-bin-Khadeej (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, kaha : maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suna, aap farma rahe they : bukhar jahannam ke josh se hai, usko pani se thanda karo."
"5971","abu-Bakar-bin-abi-Sheba , Muhammad-bin-Musanna , Muhammad-bin-Hatim aur Abu-Bakar bin Naafe ne kaha : hamein Abdur-Rehman-bin-Mehdi ne Sufiyan se hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne apne walid se, unhon-ne Abaya bin Rifaa se riwayat ki, kaha : mujhey Rafe-bin-Khadeej (Raziallahu anhu) ne hadis sunai, kaha : maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suna, aap farmatey they : bukhar jahannam ke josh se hai, usey khud se pani ke zariey thanda karo. (Abu-Bakar) ki riwayat mein khud se ke alfaz nahi hain. neez Abu-Bakar ne kaha ke Abaya bin Rifaa ne ( حدثنی ke bajaey) ( اخبرني Rafe-bin-Khadeej ( kaha."
"5990","Shoba ne Qatada se, unhon-ne abu mutawakkil se, unhon-ne Hazrat Abu-Saeed Khudri (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein aik shakhs hazir hua aur kaha : mere bhai ka pet chal pada hai) dast lag gaey. hain) to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : usko shehad pilao. us ne usey shehad pilaya, wo phir aaya aur kaha : maine usey shehad pilaya hai, us se (daston ki tezi mein) mazeed izafa ho gaya hai Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne teen baar us se wahi farmaya (shehad pilao) jab wo chothi baar aaya to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : usey shehad pilao. usne kaha : maine usey shehad pilaya hai us se daston mein izaafey ke ilawa aur kuchh nahi hua to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : Allah ne sach farmaya hai (ke shehad mein shifa hai) aur tumharey bhai ka pet jhoot bol raha hai. us ne usey (aur) shehad pilaya wo tandurust ho gaya."
"5991","Shoba ne Qatada se, unhon-ne abu mutawakkil se, unhon-ne Hazrat Abu-Saeed Khudri (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein aik shakhs hazir hua aur kaha : mere bhai ka pet chal pada hai) dast lag gaey. hain) to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : usko shehad pilao. us ne usey shehad pilaya, wo phir aaya aur kaha : maine usey shehad pilaya hai, us se (daston ki tezi mein) mazeed izafa ho gaya hai Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne teen baar us se wahi farmaya (shehad pilao) jab wo chothi baar aaya to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : usey shehad pilao. usne kaha : maine usey shehad pilaya hai us se daston mein izaafey ke ilawa aur kuchh nahi hua to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : Allah ne sach farmaya hai (ke shehad mein shifa hai) aur tumharey bhai ka pet jhoot bol raha hai. us ne usey (aur) shehad pilaya wo tandurust ho gaya."
"5995"," "" "" "" "" "" Imam Malik ne Muhammad-bin Munkadir aur Umar-bin Ubaidullah ke aazad karda ghulam abu-Nazar se"
"5996","Abdullaah-bin-Muslima bin Qanab aur Quteba bin Saeed ne kaha : hamein Mughira bin Abdur-Rehman qarshi ne abu-Nazar se hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne Aamir bin Sad-bin-abi-Waqas se, unhon-ne Hazrat Usama-bin-Zaid (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : taaoon azab ki alamat hai, Allah Taala ne apne bandon mein kuchh logon ko taaoon mein mubtlaa kiya , jab tum taaoon ke barey mein suno to wahan mat jao aur jab us sarzameen mein taaoon phail jaey jahan tum ho to wahan se mat bhaago . ye Qanabi ki hadis hai, Quteba ne bhi is tarah bayan kya hai."
"5997","Abdullaah-bin-Muslima bin Qanab aur Quteba bin Saeed ne kaha : hamein Mughira bin Abdur-Rehman qarshi ne abu-Nazar se hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne Aamir bin Sad-bin-abi-Waqas se, unhon-ne Hazrat Usama-bin-Zaid (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : taaoon azab ki alamat hai, Allah Taala ne apne bandon mein kuchh logon ko taaoon mein mubtlaa kiya , jab tum taaoon ke barey mein suno to wahan mat jao aur jab us sarzameen mein taaoon phail jaey jahan tum ho to wahan se mat bhaago . ye Qanabi ki hadis hai, Quteba ne bhi is tarah bayan kya hai."
"5998","Sufiyan ne Muhammad-bin Munkadir se, unhon-ne Aamir-bin-Sad se, unhon-ne Usama (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : ye taaoon aik azab hai jo tum se pahley logon par musallat kya gaya tha, ya ( farmaya : ( Bani-Israeel par musallat kya gaya tha, agar ye kisi ilaaqey mein ho to tum us se bhag kar wahan se na nikalna aur agar kisi (doosri ( sarzameen main ( taaoon ( maujood ho to tum usmein dakhil na hona ."
"5999","Sufiyan ne Muhammad-bin Munkadir se, unhon-ne Aamir-bin-Sad se, unhon-ne Usama (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : ye taaoon aik azab hai jo tum se pahley logon par musallat kya gaya tha, ya ( farmaya : ( Bani-Israeel par musallat kya gaya tha, agar ye kisi ilaaqey mein ho to tum us se bhag kar wahan se na nikalna aur agar kisi (doosri ( sarzameen main ( taaoon ( maujood ho to tum usmein dakhil na hona ."
"6000","ibne-Juraij ne kaha : mujhey Amr-bin-Dinar ne bataya ke Aamir-bin-Sad ne unhein khabar di ke kisi shakhs ne Hazrat Sad-bin-abi-Waqas se taaoon ke barey mein sawal kya to ( wahan maujood (Hazrat Usama-bin-Zaid (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha : main tumhen iske barey mein bataata hun, Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : ye aik azab ya saza hai jisey Allah Taala ne Bani-Israeel ke aik garoh par bheja tha, ya (farmaya :) un logon par jo tum se pehley they, lihaza tum jab kisi sarzameen mein iske (phailney ke) mutaalliq suno to usmein iske hotey huey dakhil na hona aur jab ye tum par waarid ho jaey to us se bhaga karo wahan se na nikalna."
"6001","ibne-Juraij ne kaha : mujhey Amr-bin-Dinar ne bataya ke Aamir-bin-Sad ne unhein khabar di ke kisi shakhs ne Hazrat Sad-bin-abi-Waqas se taaoon ke barey mein sawal kya to ( wahan maujood (Hazrat Usama-bin-Zaid (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha : main tumhen iske barey mein bataata hun, Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : ye aik azab ya saza hai jisey Allah Taala ne Bani-Israeel ke aik garoh par bheja tha, ya (farmaya :) un logon par jo tum se pehley they, lihaza tum jab kisi sarzameen mein iske (phailney ke) mutaalliq suno to usmein iske hotey huey dakhil na hona aur jab ye tum par waarid ho jaey to us se bhaga karo wahan se na nikalna."
"6002","Hammad-bin-Zaid aur Sufiyan-bin-Uena donon ne Amr-bin-Dinar se ibne-Juraij ki sanad ke sath usi ki hadis ki tarah hadis bayan ki."
"6003","Hammad-bin-Zaid aur Sufiyan-bin-Uena donon ne Amr-bin-Dinar se ibne-Juraij ki sanad ke sath usi ki hadis ki tarah hadis bayan ki."
"6015","Aamash ne Habib se, unhon-ne Ibrahim bin Sad-bin-abi-Waqas se riwayat ki, kaha : Hazrat Usama-bin-Zaid (Raziallahu anhu) aur Hazrat Sad (Raziallahu anhu) baithey huey hadisein bayan kar rahe they. to un donon ne kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya, jis tarah un sab ki hadis hai."
"6144","abu-Awana Jareer, Ismail bin Zakariya aur Sufiyan sab ne Suhel se, unhon-ne apne walid se, unhon-ne Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se, unhon-ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat ki, jis tarah Suhel se Khalid ki riwayat hai siwaey akeley Jarir ke unhon-ne apni riwayat ki hui hadis mein kaha : jisne chhipkali ko pehli chot mein mar diya uske liye so nekiyan likhi gain. dusri zarb mein us se kam aur teesri zarb mein us se kam."
"6179","Mamar ne hamein Zohri se khabar di unhon-ne ibne-Musaiyab se, unhon-ne Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki : kaha Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : izzat aur jalaal waaley Allah ne irshad farmaya : ibne-Aadam mujhey taklif deta hai wo kehta hai. haaye zamaney ( waqt) ki naamuraadi! tum mein se koi haaye zamaney ki naamuraadi! ( jaisa jumla ( na kahey , kyonke dehar (ka Malik) main hun. raat aur din ko palat-ta hon aur main jab chaahunga unki bisaat lapet dunga."
"6180","Aaraj ne Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : tum mein se koi shakhs ye na kahey ke haaye zamaney ki naamuraadi! kyonke Allah Taala hi zamaney (ka Malik ( hai."
"6200","Jarir ne Aamash se, unhon-ne Abu-Saleh se, unhon-ne Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : tum mein se koi shakhs (kisi ghulam ko) mera banda na kahey , to tum sab Allah ke bandey ho, albatta ye keh sakta hai: mera jawan, aur na ghulam ye kahey : mera rab (paalne wala) albatta mera saiyyed ( aaqa keh sakta hai)."
"6201","Jarir ne Aamash se, unhon-ne Abu-Saleh se, unhon-ne Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : tum mein se koi shakhs (kisi ghulam ko) mera banda na kahey , to tum sab Allah ke bandey ho, albatta ye keh sakta hai: mera jawan, aur na ghulam ye kahey : mera rab (paalne wala) albatta mera saiyyed ( aaqa keh sakta hai)."
"6410","Jarir aur Shoba ne Mughira se, unhon-ne abu-Waail se, unhon-ne Hazrat Abdullah (bin Masood (Raziallahu anhu)) se aur unhon-ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se Aamash ki hadis ki tarah riwayat ki. Shoba ki Mughira se riwayat (ki sanad) mein ye alfaz hain : maine abu-Waail se suna."
"6414","ibne-abi Adi ne Shoba se, unhon-ne Mabad bin Khalid se, unhon-ne Hazrat Harisa (bin Wahab Khuzai ( (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, ke unhon-ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suna, aap ne farmaya : Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ka hauz ( itna chaudaa hai) jitna sanaa aur Madina ke darmyan (ka fasla ( hai. mustaurid ( ibne-Shaddad ( (Raziallahu anhu) ne un (Hazrat Harisa (Raziallahu anhu)) se kaha : aap ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se nahi suna, ke aap ne farmaya : bartan ? unhon-ne kaha : nahi to mustaurid (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha : usmein bartan sitaron ki tarah nazar aaeingey."
"6415","ibne-abi Adi ne Shoba se, unhon-ne Mabad bin Khalid se, unhon-ne Hazrat Harisa (bin Wahab Khuzai ( (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, ke unhon-ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suna, aap ne farmaya : Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ka hauz ( itna chaudaa hai) jitna sanaa aur Madina ke darmyan (ka fasla ( hai. mustaurid ( ibne-Shaddad ( (Raziallahu anhu) ne un (Hazrat Harisa (Raziallahu anhu)) se kaha : aap ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se nahi suna, ke aap ne farmaya : bartan ? unhon-ne kaha : nahi to mustaurid (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha : usmein bartan sitaron ki tarah nazar aaeingey."
"6505","abu-Usama aur ibne-Numair ne Hisham (bin Urwa ( se, unhon-ne apne walid se, unhon-ne Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat ki, kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas baadiya se kuchh log aaey aur unhon-ne puchha : kya aap log apne bachchon ko kuchh bosa detey hain? logon ne kaha : haan , to un logon ne kaha : lekin Allah ki qism ! ham to apne bachchon ko bosa nahi detey, is par Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : agar Allah Taala ne tumharey andar se rehmat nikal di hai (to kya ho sakta hai ! ( ibne-Numair ki riwayat mein hai : tumharey dil se rehmat nikal di hai."
"6506","Sufiyan-bin-Uena ne Zohri se, unhon-ne abu-Salma se, unhon-ne Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki ke Aqra-bin-Habis (Raziallahu anhu) ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko dekha, aap Hazrat Hasan (Raziallahu anhu) ko bosa de rahe they, unhon-ne kaha : mere das bachchey hain aur maine unmein se kisi ko kabhi bosa nahi diya, to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : jo shakhs raham nahi karta is par raham nahi kya jaeyga."
"6527","Ismail (bin Mina ( ne kaha : hamein Ayub ne abu-Qilaba se hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne Hazrat Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) apni beeviyon ke paas gaey, us waqt Anjasha naam ka aik oont haankney wala un (ke oonton) ko haank raha tha, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : Anjasha tum par afsos! sheeshe (jaisi nazuk khawaateen) ko aahisatagi aur aaraam se chalaao. Ayub ne kaha : abu-Qilaba ne kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne aisa kalima bola ke agar tum mein se koi aisa kalima kehta to tum is par aib lagaatey ."
"6528","Sulaiman Taimi ne Hazrat Anas-bin-Malik (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat bayan ki, kaha : Hazrat Umme-Sulaim (Raziallahu anhu) bhi Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki beeviyon ke sath thin aur aik oont haankney wala unke oont haank raha tha, Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : Anjasha! sheeshe (jaisi nazuk khawaateen) ko aahisatagi aur aa raam se chalaao ."
"6529","Sulaiman Taimi ne Hazrat Anas-bin-Malik (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat bayan ki, kaha : Hazrat Umme-Sulaim (Raziallahu anhu) bhi Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki beeviyon ke sath thin aur aik oont haankney wala unke oont haank raha tha, Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : Anjasha! sheeshe (jaisi nazuk khawaateen) ko aahisatagi aur aa raam se chalaao ."
"6544","Yunus ne ibne-Shahab se isi sanad ke sath Imam Malik ki hadis ki tarah riwayat ki."
"6545","Yunus ne ibne-Shahab se isi sanad ke sath Imam Malik ki hadis ki tarah riwayat ki."
"6625","Hajjaj-bin Muhammad ne kaha : ibne-Juraij ne kaha : mujhey abu-Zubair ne bataya , unhon-ne Hazrat Jabir-bin-Abdullah (Raziallahu anhu) ko ye kehtey huey suna ke unhon-ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se ye suna, aap farmatey they : main aik insan hi hun aur maine apne rab azz-w-jall se ye ahad liya hai ke main musalmanon mein se jis bandey ko bura-bhala karun to ye sab kuchh uske liye pakeezgi aur ajr (ka sabab) bin jaey."
"6626","Rooh aur abu-Aasim donon ne hamein ibne-Juraij se isi sanad ke sath usi ki tarah hadis bayan ki."
"6701","hamein Suwed-bin-Saeed aur Muhammad-bin Abdul-Aala ne hadis bayan ki. padhi. donon ke alfaz miltey-jultey hain. padhi. donon ne kaha : hamein Motamir (bin Sulaiman Taimi ( ne apne walid se riwayat ki, unhon-ne abu-Saleel se aur unhon-ne abu-Hassaan se riwayat ki, unhon-ne kaha : maine Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se kaha : mere 2 bachchey faut ho gaey hain, aap hamein Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki kon si hadis suna saktey hain jis se aap hamein hamarey faut honey walon ke mutaalliq hamarey dilon ki tasalli dila sakein? ( abu-Hassaan ne) kaha : (hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) ne) kaha : haan. (aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : ( chhotey bachchey jannat ke pani ke keedey hain (wo jannat ke andar hi rahtey hain) unmein se koi apne bap . padhi. ya farmaya : apne maan-baap ko milega to wo usey uske kapdey se pakad lega. padhi. ya kaha : uske hath se, jis tarah maine tumharey us kapdey ke kinarey se pakda hua hai, phir us waqt tak nahi hatega . padhi. ya kaha : nahi rukega, yahan tak ke Allah usey aur uske walid ko jannat mein dakhil kar dega aur Suwed ki riwayat main (abu-Saleel se riwayat hai ke bajaey yun) hai : hamein abu-Saleel ne hadis sunai."
"6702","Yahya-bin-Saeed ne Taimi se isi sanad ke sath riwayat ki aur kaha : aap ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se koi aisi baat suni hai jis se aap hamarey faut ho janey walon ke hawale se hamarey dilon ko tasalli dila sakein? (hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) ne) kaha : haan."
"6711","Sufiyan ne Zohri se, unhon-ne Hazrat Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, kaha : aik shakhs ne puchha : Allah ke rasool! qiyamat Kab hogi ? aap ne farmaya : tum ne uske liye kya taiyaar ki hai? us ne zyada chizon ka zikr nahi kya, (chand aik kaamon ka zikr kar saka) usne kaha : aur lekin main Allah aur uske rasool (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se mohabbat karta hun, aap ne farmaya : tum iske sath hogey jis se tumhen mohabbat hai."
"6712","Mamar ne Zohri se riwayat ki, unhon-ne kaha : mujhey Hazrat Anas-bin-Malik (Raziallahu anhu) ne hadis sunai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas aik dehati aaya, usi (pichhli hadis) ki tarah magar (is mein hai ke) usne kaha : maine uske liye kuchh zyada taiyaari nahi ki jis par main apni tareef kar sakun (lekin main Allah aur uske rasool (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se mohabbat karta hun.)"
"6792","Yunus ne ibne-Shahab se riwayat ki, unhon-ne kaha : mujhey Humaid bin Abdur-Rehman-bin-Auf ne hadis bayan ki ke Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : zamana aapas mein qareeb ho jaeyga (waqt bahut tezi se guzarta hua mehsus hoga), ilm utha liya jaeyga, fitney namudaar hongey, (dilon mein) kanjoosi aur hirs daal di jaeygi aur haraj kasarat se hoga. sahaba ne puchha : haraj kya hai? Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : qatl w ghaarat gari."
"6844","Abu-Ishaq ne Amr-bin-Memoon se riwayat ki, kaha : jis shakhs ne das baar :                                                                          (لا اله الا الله وحده لا شريك له له الملك وله لحمد وهو على كل شيء قدير) padha wo us shakhs ki tarah hoga jisne Hazrat Ismail (Alaihissalam) ki nasl se char ghulam aazad kiye hon."
"6845","Shabi ne Rabe-bin-khushaim se usi ki tarah riwayat ki, unhon-ne kaha : maine Rabe se puchha : aap ne ye ( hadis) kis se sunii? unhon-ne kaha : Amr-bin-Memoon se, phir main Amr-bin-Memoon ke paas aaya, unse puchha : aap ne ye (hadis) kis se sunii? unhon-ne kaha : ibne-abi-Lela se, kaha : to main ibne-abi-Lela ke paas aaya aur unse puchha : aap ne ye (hadis) kis se sunii? unhon-ne kaha : maine Hazrat Abu-Ayub Ansari (Raziallahu anhu) se suni , wo usey Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se bayan kartey they."
"6855","Muhammad-bin-Jafar ne kaha : hamein Shoba ne hadis bayan ki, kaha : maine Abu-Ishaq ko abu-Muslim Aghrarr se hadis bayan kartey huey suna, unhon-ne kaha : main Hazrat Abu-Hurera aur Hazrat Abu-Saeed Khudri (Raziallahu anhu) ke barey mein gawahi deta hun, un donon ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke barey mein gawahi di ke aap ne farmaya : jo qaum bhi izzat aur jalaal waaley Allah ko yad karne ke liye baithti hai, unko Farishtey gher letey hain, rehmat dhanp leti hai aur un par itminan qalb nazil hota hai aur Allah unka zikr unmein karta hai jo uske paas hotey hain."
"6856","Abdur-Rehman ne hamein hadis bayan ki, kaha : hamein Shoba ne isi sanad se usi ki tarah hadis bayan ki."
"6879","Abdullah-bin Wahab ne kaha : hamein Amr-bin-Haris ne khabar di ke Yazeed-bin-abi-Habib aur Haaris-bin-Yaqoob ne unhein Yaqoob bin-Abdullah-bin-ashajj se hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne Basar-bin-Saeed se, unhon-ne Sad-bin-abi-Waqas (Raziallahu anhu) se aur unhon-ne Hazrat Khaula binte- hakeem salmiya (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, unhon-ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko ye farmatey huey suna : tum mein se koi shakhs jab kisi manzil par pahunchey to ye kalimaat kahey : main har us cheez ke shar se jo Allah ne paida ki, uske mukammal tareen kalimaat ki panah mein aata hun, is tarah wahan se kooch kar janey tak koi bhi cheez usey nuqsan nahi pahunchaaeygi."
"6918","Rooh-bin-Qasim ne Suhel se, unhon-ne apne walid (Abu-Saleh) se aur unhon-ne Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki ke Hazrat Fatima (Raziallahu anha) aik khidmat guzaar (kaneez) maangney ke liye Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas aaein aur aap se kaam ki shikayat ki to aap ne farmaya : tumhen khidmat guzaar to hamarey yahaan nahi mila. (hamarey ghar mein bhi maujood nahi), farmaya : kya main tumhen aisi baat na bataaun jo tumharey liye khidmat guzaar se bahut behtar hai? jab tum bistar par jao to tentis (33) baar Subhan-Allah kaho, tentis (33) baar الحمدللہ (Alhamdulillah) kaho aur chauntis (34) baar Allahu-akbar kaho."
"6919","Wuhaib ne kaha : hamein Suhel ne isi sanad ke sath (yahi) hadis bayan ki."
"6929","Esa-bin-Yonus ne kaha : hamein Abdul-Malik bin abi Sulaiman ne abu-Zubair se hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne Abdullah-bin Safwan ke betey Safwan se riwayat ki, (hazrat abu-Darda (Raziallahu anhu) ki beti) Darda, un (safwaan) ki zaujiyat mein thi, wo kehtey hain : aur main Sham (Syria) aaya to Hazrat abu-Darda (Raziallahu anhu) ke yahan unke ghar gaya, wo nahi miley, main Hazrat umme-Darda (Raziallahu anhu) se mila to unhon-ne kaha : kya tum is saal Haj ka irada rakhtey ho? maine kaha : ji haan. unhon-ne kaha : hamarey liye khair ki dua karna kyonke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) farmaya kartey they : musalman ki apne bhai ke liye uski peeth peechhey ki gaee dua mustajaab hoti hai, uske sar ke qareeb aik farishta muqarrar hota hai, wo jab bhi apne bhai ke liye duaae-khair karta hai to muqarrar kya hua farishta is par kehta hai : aameen, aur tumhen bhi usi ki tarah ata ho."
"6961","Haddab bin Khalid ne kaha : hamein Hammam ne hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne kaha : hamein Qatada ne Hazrat Anas-bin-Malik (Raziallahu anhu) se hadis sunai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : Allah Taala ko apne bandey ki tauba se, tum mein se kisi aisey shakhs ki nisbat kahin zyada khushi hoti hai jab chatiyal sehraa mein uske (us ( oont (ke aaney) par uski aankh khulti hai jisey wo sehra mein gum kar chuka hota hai."
"6962","Hibban ne kaha : hamein Hammam ne hadis bayan ki. kaha : hamein Qatada ne hadis sunai, kaha : hamein Hazrat Anas-bin-Malik (Raziallahu anhu) ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se usi ki tarah hadis bayan ki."
"6981","Mamar ne kaha : Zohri ne mujh se kaha : kya main tumhen 2 ajeeb hadisein na sunaun? ( phir ( Zohri ne kaha : mujhey Humaid bin Abdur-Rehman ne Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se khabar di, unhon-ne Nabi akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat ki ke Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : aik shakhs ne apne aap par har qism ki zyadti ki (har gunah ka irtikaab karke khud ko mujrim banaya. ( to jab uski maut ka waqt aaya to usne apne beton ko wasiiyat ki aur kaha : jab main mar jaun to mujhey jalaa denaa, phir mujhey reza reza kar denaa, phir mujhey hawa mein, samandar mein uda dena. Allah ki qism ! agar mere rab ne mujhey qaabu kar liya to mujhey yaqinan aisa azab dega jo kisi aur ko na diya hoga. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : unhon-ne uske sath yahi kya. to Allah ne zamin se kaha : jo tuney liya pura wapas kar, to wo (poorey ka pura samney) khada tha. Allah ne us se farmaya : tuney jo kya is par tumhen kis cheez ne uksaaya? usne kaha : mere parwardigar ! teri khashiyat ne. padhi. ya kaha, padhi. : terey khof ne to usi ( baat ( ki bina par us ( Allah ( ne usey bakhsh diya."
"6989","Muhammad-bin-Jafar ne kaha : hamein Shoba ne Amr-bin-Murra se hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne kaha : maine abu-Ubaid ko Hazrat abu-Musa (Raziallahu anhu) se hadis bayan kartey huey suna, unhon-ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat ki ke aap ne farmaya : izzat aur jalaal waala Allah raat ko apna dast (rehmat bandon ki taraf) phaila deta hai taake din ko gunah karne wala tauba karey aur din ko apna dast (rehmat) phaila deta hai taake raat ko gunah karne wala tauba karey (aur wo us waqt tak yahi karta rahega ( yahan tak ke suraj maghrib se tuloo ho jaey."
"6990","Abu-Dawud ne kaha : hamein Shoba ne isi sanad ke sath usi ki tarah hadis bayan ki."
"7016","Ibne-Shahab se riwayat hai, phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne jihad kya Tabook ka (Tabook aik maqam ka naam hai Madina se pandarah manzil par Sham (Syria) ke raaste mein) aur Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ka irada tha Rome (mojooda Itly) aur Arab ke nasara ko dhamkaaney ka Sham (Syria) mein. Ibne-Shahab (Rahmatullahi-alaih) ne kaha : mujh se bayan kya Abdur-Rehman bin-Abdullah-bin Kab-bin-Malik ne unse bayan kya Abdullah-bin Kab ne jo Kab ko pakad kar chalaaya kartey they, unke beton mein se jab Kab ko aankhon se dikhaai dena band ho gaya tha, unhon-ne kaha : maine suna Kab-bin-Malik (Raziallahu anhu) se, wo apna haal bayan kartey they, jab peechhey reh gaey they Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath jange-Tabook mein. saiyedna Kab-bin-Malik (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha : main kisi jihad main Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke peechhey nahi raha siwaey jange-Tabook ke, albatta badr mein peechhey raha, par Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne kisi par ghussa nahi kya jo peechhey reh gaya tha aur badr main to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) musalmanon ke sath Quraish ka qaafila lotney ke liye nikley they lekin Allah ne musalmanon ko unke dushmanon se badha diya (aur qaafila nikal gaya) be waqt aur main Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath maujood tha lailatul-aqba main (lailatul-aqba wo raat hai jab Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Ansar se bait li thi Islam par aur Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki madad karne par aur ye bait jamara Aqba ke paas jo Mina mein hai dobara hui. pehli baar mein baara Ansari they aur dusri baar mein 70 Ansari they) aur main nahi chahta ke us raat ke badley mein jange-badr mein Sharik hota bhale hi jange-badr logon mein us raat se zyada mashhoor hai (yani log usko afzal kehtey hain) aur mera qissa jange-Tabook se peechhey rehney ka ye hai ke jab ye jang hui to main sabse zyada taaqatwar aur maaldaar tha. Allah ki qism us se pahley mere paas 2 oontniyan kabhi nahi huin aur us ladai ke waqt mere paas 2 oontniyan thin. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) us ladai ke liye chaley sakht garmi ke dinon main aur safar bhi lamba tha aur raah mein jangal they ( door dawaaz jin mein pani kam milta aur halaakat ka khof hota (aur muqaabla tha bahut dushmanon se, isliye Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne musalmanon se waazeh taur par farma diya ke ''main us ladai ko jata hoon.'' ( halanke Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki ye aadat thi ke aur ladaaiyon mein apna irada saaf-saaf na farmatey maslihat se taake khabar mashhoor na ho (taake wo apni taiyaari kar lein. phir unse keh diya ke falan taraf unko jana padega, us waqt Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath bahut se musalman they aur koi daftar na tha, jis mein unke naam likhe hotey . saiyedna Kab (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha : to aisey shakhs kam they jo ghayab rehna chahtey aur guman kartey ke ye Amr posheeda rahega jab tak Allah paak ki taraf se koi wahi na utrey aur ye jihad Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne us waqt kya jab phal paak gaey they aur saaya khub tha, aur mujhey un chizon ka bahut shauq tha. aakhir Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne taiyaari ki aur musalmanon ne bhi Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath taiyaari ki maine bhi subah ko nikalna shuru kya is irade se ke main bhi unke sath taiyaari karun lekin har roz main lot aata aur kuchh faisla na karta aur apne dil mein ye kehta ke main jab chaahoon ja sakta hun, (kyonke saman safar ka mere paas maujood tha) yun hi hota raha, yahan tak ke log barabar koshish kartey rahe aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) bhi subah ke waqt nikley aur musalman bhi Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath nikley aur maine koi taiyaari nahi ki. phir subah ko main nikla aur lot kar aa gaya aur koi faisla nahi kya, yahi haal raha yahan tak ke logon ne jaldi ki aur sab mujaahideen aagey nikal gaey, us waqt maine bhi kooch ka irada kya ke unse mil jaun to kash! main aisa karta lekin meri taqdeer mein na tha baad iske jab bahar nikalta Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke janey ke baad to mujh ko ranj hota kyonke main koi pairwi ke laaiq na paata magar aisa shakhs jis par munafiq honey ka guman tha ya mazoor, zaeef aur kamzor logon mein se, khair Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne raah mein meri yad kahin na ki yahan tak ke Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Tabook mein pahunchey, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) logon mein baithey huey they us waqt farmaya : '' Kab-bin-Malik (Raziallahu anhu) kahan gaya?'' eik shakhs bola : bani Salma mein se ya Rasulullah ! uski chaadaron ne usko rok rakha , wo apne donon kinaron ko dekhta hai (yani apne libaas aur nafs mein mashghool aur masroof hai). saiyedna Muaz-bin-Jabal (Raziallahu anhu) ne ye sun kar kaha : tuney buri baat kahi , Allah ki qism ya Rasulullah ! ham to Kab-bin-Malik (Raziallahu anhu) ko achchha samajhtey hain. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ye sun kar chup ho rahe, itney mein Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne aik shakhs ko dekha jo safaid kapdey pahney huey aa raha tha aur ret ko uda raha tha (chalney ki wjah se) Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : ''abu-Khaisma hai.'' phir wo abu-Khaisma hi tha aur abu-Khaisma wo shakhs tha jisne aik saa khajoor sadqa di thi jab munaafiqon ne is par tana kya tha. saiyedna Kab-bin-Malik (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha : jab mujhey khabar pahunchi ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Tabook se lautey Madina ki taraf to mera ranj badh gaya. maine jhoot baatein banaanaa shuru kiin ke koi baat aisi kahun jis se Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ka ghussa mit jaey kal ke roz aur us Amr ke liye maine har aik aqlmand shakhs se madad lena shuru ki apne ghar walon mein se yani unse bhi salaah li (ke kya baat bataaun) jab logon ne mujh se bayan kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) qareeb aa pahunchey us waqt Sara jhoot kaafoor ho gaya aur main samajh gaya ke ab koi jhoot bana kar main Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se najat nahi paaney ka, aakhir maine niyat kar li sach bolney ki, aur subah ko Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) tashrif laey aur jab Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) safar se aatey to pahley masjid mein jatey aur 2 rakatein padhtey, phir logon se milney ke liye baithtey. jab Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ye kar chukey to jo log peechhey reh gaey they, unhon-ne apne uzr bayan karne shuru kiye aur qasmein khaney lagey aisey assi (80) se zyada chand aadmi they. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unki zahir ki baat ko maan liya aur unse bait ki aur unke liye dua ki maghfirat ki aur unki niyat (yani dil ki baat ko) Allah ke sipurd kya, yahan tak ke main bhi aaya jab maine salam kya to aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne tabassum kya lekin wo tabassum jaisey ghusse ki haalat mein kartey hain, phir Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : ''aa!'' main chalta hua aaya aur Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke samney betha Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : ''tu kyon peechhey reh gaya tu ney to sawari bhi khareed li thi.'' maine arz kya : ya Rasulullah! agar main aap ke siwa kisi aur shakhs ke paas duniya ke logon mein se baithta to main ye khayal karta ke koi uzr bayan karke iske ghussa se nikal jaaunga aur mujhey Allah Taala ne zaban ki quwwat di hai (yani mein umda taqreer kar sakta hun aur khub baat bana sakta hun) lekin qism Allah ki main janta hun ke agar main koi jhoot baat aap se keh dun aur aap khush ho jayen mujh se to qareeb hai Allah Taala aapko mere uper ghussa kar dega (yani Allah Taala Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko batla dega ke mera uzr ghalat aur jhoot tha aur Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) naraz ho jaeinge) aur agar main aap se sach sach kahunga to beshak aap ghussa hongey lekin mujhey ummeed hai ke Allah Taala iska anjam b-khair karega. Allah ki qism ! mujhey koi uzr na tha. Allah ki qism ! main kabhi na itna taaqatwar tha, na itna maaldaar tha jitna us waqt tha jab aap se peechhey reh gaya. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : '' Kab ne sach kaha, '' phir Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : '' achchha ja yahan tak ke Allah hukm de terey barey mein.'' main khada hua aur chand log bani-Salma ke daud kar mere peechhey huey aur mujh se kehney lagey : Allah ki qism ! ham nahi jantey tum ko tuney is se pahley koi qasoor kya ho, to tum aajiz kyon ho gaey aur koi uzr kyon na kar diya Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke samney jaisey aur logon ne jo peechhey reh gaey they uzr bayan kiye aur tera gunah mitaaney ke liye Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ka istighfar kafi tha, Allah ki qasam! wo log mujh ko malaamat karne lagey yahan tak ke maine irada kya phir lotun Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas aur apne taiin jhoota karun aur koi uzr bayan karun. phir maine un logon se kaha : kisi aur ka bhi aisa haal hua hai jo mera hua hai. unhon-ne kaha : haan 2 log aur hain, unhon-ne bhi wahi kaha : jo tuney kaha : aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unse bhi wahi farmaya jo tujh se farmaya, maine puchha : wo 2 log kon hain? unhon-ne kaha : Muraara bin Rabee aur Hilal bin Umayya waaqifi (Raziallahu anhu). un logon ne aisey 2 shakhson ka naam liya jo nek they aur badr ki ladai mein maujood they aur pairwi ke qaabil they jab un logon ne un donon shakhson ka naam liya to main chala gaya aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne musalmanon ko mana kar diya tha ke ham teenon aadmiyon se koi baat na karey, un logon mein se jo peechhey reh gaey they, to logon ne ham se parhez shuru kya aur unka haal hamarey sath bilkul badal gaya yahan tak ke zamin bhi maano badal gaee wo zamin hi na rahi jisko main pehchanta tha pachaas raaton tak hamara yahi haal raha mere donon sathi to aajiz ho gaey aur apne gharon mein baith rahe rotey huey lekin main to sab logon mein kam-umr aur zor daar tha, main nikla karta tha aur Namaz ke liye bhi aata aur bazaron mein bhi phirtaa par koi shakhs mujh se baat na karta aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas aata aur Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko salam karta aur Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) apni jagah baithey hotey Namaz ke baad aur dil mein ye kehta ke Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne apne labon ko hilaaya, salam ka jawab dene ke liye ya nahi hilaaya, phir Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke qareeb Namaz padhta aur daz-deeda nazar se (kankhiyon se) Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko dekhta, to jab main Namaz mein hota Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) meri taraf dekhtey aur jab main Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki taraf dekhta to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) munh pher letey yahan tak ke jab musalmanon ki sakhti mujh par lambi hui to main chala aur abu-Qatada (Raziallahu anhu) ke baagh ki diwar par chadha. abu-Qatada (Raziallahu anhu) mere chacha zaad bhai they aur sab logon se zyada mohabbat mujhey unse thi, unko salam kya, to Allah ki qism unhon-ne salam ka jawab tak na diya ( Subhan-Allah Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke taabe aisey hotey hain ke Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke irshad ke samney bhai betey ki marawwat bhi nahi kartey jab tak Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se aisi mohabbat na ho to eman kis kaam ka hai? Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki hadis jab malum ho jaey ke sahi hai to mujtahid aur maulwiyon ka qaul jo uske khilaf ho diwar par maarna chahiye aur hadis par chalna chahiye) maine unse kaha : aey abu-Qataada! main tum ko qism deta hun Allah ki tum ye nahi jantey ke main Allah aur uske rasool se mohabbat rakhta hun, wo khamosh rahe, phir teesri baar qism di to boley : Allah aur uska rasool khub janta hai ye bhi Kab (Raziallahu anhu) se nahi boley balke khud apne mein baat ki aakhir meri aankhon se aansu nikal padey aur main peeth mod kar chala aur diwar par chadha. main Madina ke bazar mein ja raha tha to aik kisaan Sham (Syria) ke kisaanon mein se jo Madina main anaaj bechney ke liye aaya tha, kehney laga : Kab-bin-Malik (Raziallahu anhu) ka ghar mujh ko kon bataaeyga? logon ne usko ishara shuru kya yahan tak ke wo mere paas aaya aur mujhey aik khat diya Ghassaan ke badshah ka, main munshi tha, maine usko padha, usmein ye likha tha, baad hamd w naat ke Kab (Raziallahu anhu) ko malum ho ke ham ko ye khabar pahunchi hai ke tumharey sahib ne yani Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne tujh par jafaa ki hai aur Allah Taala ne tum ko zillat ke ghar mein nahi kya na us jagah jahan tumhara haq zaaye ho to tum ham se mil jao ham tumhari khaatir daari karengey. maine jab ye khat padha to kaha : ye bhi aik bila hai aur us khat ko maine choolhey mein jalaa diya. jab pachaas din mein se chalis (40) din guzar gaey aur wahi na aai to achcha Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ka paigham laney wala mere paas aaya aur kehney laga : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) tum ko hukm kartey hain ke apni biwi se alehda raho maine kaha : main usko talaaq de dun ya kya karun? wo bola : nahi talaaq mat do sirf alag raho aur us se sohbat mat karo aur mere donon sathiyon ke paas bhi yahi payaam gaya. maine apni bevi se kaha : to apne azeezon mein chali ja aur wahin reh yahan tak ke Allah Taala is mamley mein koi hukm de. Hilal bin Umayya (Raziallahu anhu) ki biwi ye sun kar Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas gaee aur arz kya : ya Rasulullah ! Hilal bin Umayya (Raziallahu anhu) aik boodha bekar shakhs hai uske paas koi khaadim bhi nahi to kya aap bura samajhtey hain agar main uski khidmat kya karun? Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : ''main khidmat ko bura nahi samajhta, lekin wo tujh se sohbat na kare.'' wo boli : Allah ki qism ! usko kisi kaam ka khayal nahi aur Allah ki qism ! wo us din se ab tak ro raha hai. mere ghar walon ne kaha : kash! tum bhi Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se apni biwi ke paas rehney ki ijazat ley lo kyonke Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Hilal bin Umayya (Raziallahu anhu) ki aurat ko uski khidmat karne ki ijazat di. maine kaha : main kabhi ijazat na loonga Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se apni bevi ke liye aur malum nahi Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) kya farma dengey, agar main ijazat loon apni biwi ke liye aur main jawan aadmi hun. phir das raaton tak mein usi haal mein raha yahan tak ke pachaas raatein poori huin, us taareekh se jab se Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mana kya tha ham se baat karne se phir pachaaswin raat ko subah ke waqt maine Namaz padhi apne ghar ki chhat par. mein usi haal mein betha tha jo Allah Taala ne hamara haal bayan kya ke mera ji tang ho gaya tha aur zamin mujh par tang ho gaee thi bawajud ye ke itni kushada hai. itney mein maine aik pukarney waley ki awaz suni jo Sala par chadha (Sala aik pahaad hai Madina mein) aur buland awaz se pukara : aey Kab-bin-Malik! khush ho jaa. ye sun kar main sajde mein gira aur maine pehchaana ke khushi aai, phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne logon ko khabar ki ke Allah ne ham ko maaf kya, jab Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) fajr ki Namaz padh chukey. log chaley ham ko khushkhabri dene ke liye to mere donon sathiyon ke paas chand khushkhabri dene waley gaey aur aik shakhs ne mere paas ghoda daudaaya aur aik daudney wala douda Aslam ke qabeeley se meri taraf aur uski awaz ghodey se jald mujh ko pahunchi. jab wo shakhs aaya jiski awaz maine suni thi khushkhabri ki to maine apne donon kapdey utaarey aur usko pehna diye, uski khushkhabri ke sile mein. Allah ki qasam! us waqt mere paas wahi 2 kapdey they. maine 2 kapdey udhaar liye aur unko pehna aur chala Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se milney ki niyat se. log mujh se miltey jatey they giroh giroh aur mujh ko Mubarak baad detey jatey they maafi ki aur kehtey they : Mubarak ho tum ko Allah ki maafi ki tumharey liye yahan tak ke main masjid mein pahuncha . Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) masjid mein baithey they aur Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas log they. Talha bin Ubaidullah (Raziallahu anhu) mujh ko dekhtey hi khadey huey aur daudey yahan tak ke musaafa kya mujh se aur mujh ko mubaarkbaad di. Allah ki qism ! muhajireen mein se unke siwa koi shakhs khada nahi hua, to Kab (Raziallahu anhu) Talha (Raziallahu anhu) ke us ehsan ko nahi bhooltey they. saiyedna Kab (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha : jab maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko salam kya to aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ka chehra Mubarak khushi se chamak damak raha tha. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : '' khush ho ja aaj ka din jo terey liye behtar din hai, jab se teri maan ne tujh ko janaa.'' maine arz kya : ya Rasulullah ! ye maafi aap ki taraf se hai ya Allah ki taraf se? Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : ''Allah ki taraf se.'' aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) jab khush ho jatey to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ka chehra chamak jata maano chaand ka aik tukda hai aur ham is baat ko pehchan letey (yani Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khushi ko) jab main Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke samney betha to maine arz kya : ya Rasulullah ! meri maafi ki khushi mein main apne maal ko sadqa kar dun Allah aur uske rasool ke liye? Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : '' thoda maal apna rakh ley. '' maine arz kya : to main apna hissey khaibar ka rakh leta hun aur maine arz kya : ya Rasulullah ! aakhir sachchai ne mujhey nijat di aur meri tauba mein ye bhi dakhil hai ke hamesha sach kahunga jab tak zinda rahun. Kab (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha : Allah ki qasam! main nahi janta ke Allah Taala ne kisi musalman par aisa ehsan kya ho sach bolney mein jab se maine ye zikr kya Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se jaisa umda andaz se mujh par ehsan kya, Allah ki qism ! maine us waqt se koi jhoot qasdan nahi bola : jab se ye Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se kaha, aaj ke din tak aur mujhey ummeed hai ke Allah Taala baqi zindagi mein bhi mujh ko jhoot se bachaaeyga. Kab ne kaha : Allah Taala ne ye aayatein utaarin لَّقَد تَّابَ اللَّهُ عَلَى النَّبِيِّ وَالْمُهَاجِرِينَ وَالْأَنصَارِ الَّذِينَ اتَّبَعُوهُ فِي سَاعَةِ الْعُسْرَةِ مِن بَعْدِ مَا كَادَ يَزِيغُ قُلُوبُ فَرِيقٍ مِّنْهُمْ ثُمَّ تَابَ عَلَيْهِمْ إِنَّهُ بِهِمْ رَءُوفٌ رَّحِيمٌ ( ١١٧ ( وَعَلَى الثَّلَاثَةِ الَّذِينَ خُلِّفُوا حَتَّىٰ إِذَا ضَاقَتْ عَلَيْهِمُ الْأَرْضُ بِمَا رَحُبَتْ وَضَاقَتْ عَلَيْهِمْ أَنفُسُهُمْ وَظَنُّوا أَن لَّا مَلْجَأَ مِنَ اللَّـهِ إِلَّا إِلَيْهِ ثُمَّ تَابَ عَلَيْهِمْ لِيَتُوبُوا إِنَّ اللَّهَ هُوَ التَّوَّابُ الرَّحِيمُ ( ١١٨ ( يَا أَيُّهَا الَّذِينَ آمَنُوا اتَّقُوا اللَّہَ وَكُونُوا مَعَ الصَّادِقِينَ ( ١١٩ )( التوبة : 117 - ۱۱۹ ( yani ''be shak Allah Taala ne maaf kya Nabi aur muhajireen aur Ansar ko jinhoney sath diya Nabi ka muflisi ke waqt.'' yahan tak ke farmaya : ''wo meharban hai raham wala aur Allah Taala ne maaf kya un teen shakhson ko jo peechhey daley gaey yahan tak ke jab zamin un par tang ho gaee bawajud kushadgi ke aur unke ji bhi tang ho gaey aur samjhey ke ab koi bachao nahi Allah se magar usi ki taraf phir Allah ne maaf kya unko taake wo tauba karein beshak Allah Taala bakhshney wala meharban hai. aey eman waalo! daro Allah Taala se aur sath raho sachchon ke.'' Kab (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha : Allah ki qism ! Allah Taala ne us se badh kar koi ehsan mujh par nahi kya baad Islam ke jo itna bada ho mere nazdeek is baat se ke maine sach bol diya Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se aur jhoot nahi bola, warna tabah hota jaisey jhootey tabah huey. Allah Taala ne jhooton ki jab wahi utari to aisi burai ki ke kisi ki na ki to farmaya : ( سَيَحْلِفُونَ بِاللَّهِ لَكُمْ إِذَا انقَلَبْتُمْ إِلَيْهِمْ لِتُعْرِضُوا عَنْهُمْ فَأَعْرِضُوا عَنْهُمْ إِنَّهُمْ رِجْسٌ وَمَأْوَاهُمْ جَهَنَّمُ جَزَاءً بِمَا كَانُوا يَكْسِبُونَ ( ٩٥ ( يَحْلِفُونَ لَكُمْ لِتَرْضَوْا عَنْهُمْ فَإِن تَرْضَوْا عَنْهُمْ فَإِنَّ اللَّهَ لَا يَرْضَىٰ عَنِ الْقَوْمِ الْفَاسِقِينَ ( ٩٦ ( ) التوبة : 95 - ۹۶ ( ) ''jab tum lot kar aaey to qasmein khaney lagey taake tum kuchh na bolo un se, so na bolo unse wo napak hain, unka thikana jahannam hai ye badla hai unki kamaai ka qasmein khaatey hain tum se ke tum khush ho jao un se. so agar tum khush ho jao unse tab bhi Allah Taala khush nahi hoga badkaaron se.'' saiyedna Kab (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha : ham peechhey daley gaey teenon aadmi un logon se jinka uzr Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne qabool kya jab unhon-ne qism khaai to bait ki unse aur istighfar kya unke liye aur ham ko Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne daal rakha (yani hamara muqaddima daal rakha) yahan tak ke Allah Taala ne faisla kya, usi sabab se Allah Taala ne farmaya ke ''maaf kya un teenon ko jo peechhey reh gaey aur us lafz se (yani ( خُلِّفُوْا ( se) ye murad nahi hai ke ham jihad se peechhey reh gaey balke murad wahi hai hamarey muqaddima ka peechhey rehna aur daal rakhna Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ka usko ba-nisbat un logon ke jinhoney qism khaai aur uzr kya Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se aur Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne qabool kya unke uzr ko."
"7017","Uqail ne ibne-Shahab se Yunus ki sanad ke sath Zohri se bilkul isi tarah riwayat ki."
"7018","Zohri ke bhatijey Muhammad-bin-Abdullah bin Muslim ne hamein apne chacha Muhammad-bin Muslim Zohri se hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne kaha : mujhey Abdur-Rehman bin-Abdullah-bin Kab-bin-Malik ne khabar di ke Abdullah-bin Kab-bin-Malik ne, aur wo Hazrat Kab (Raziallahu anhu) ke naa-beena honey ke baad unka hath pakad kar unki rehnumai kartey they, kaha : maine Kab-bin-Malik (Raziallahu anhu) se suna, wo apni hadis ( apna waqia ( bayan kartey they jab wo jange-Tabook main Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se peechhey reh gaey they, phir unhon-ne (pichhli hadis ki tarah) hadis bayan ki aur is mein Yunus ki riwayat par mazeed ye kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) kam hi kisi ghazwey ka irada farmatey they magar amalan us jang ke honey tak, kisi aur (muhim) ki jahat zahir farmatey yahan tak ke ye jang ( bhi usi nahaj par) hua aur unhon-ne Zohri ke bhatijey ki hadis mein abu-Khaisma ka aur unke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se ja milney ka zikr nahi kya."
"7020","Saeed bin Musaiyab aur Urwa-bin-Zubair aur Alqama bin Waqas aur Ubaidullah bin-Abdullah-bin Utba-bin- Masood se riwayat hai, un sab logon ne Sayeda Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ki hadis riwayat ki jab un par tohmat ki tohmat karne walon ne aur kaha : jo kaha, phir Allah Taala ne paak kya unko unki tohmat se. Zohri ne kaha : un sab logon ne eik-eik tukda us hadis ka mujh se riwayat kya aur kuchh unmein se zyada yad rakhney waley they us hadis ko kuchh se aur zyada Hafiz they aur umda bayan karne waley they usko aur maine yad rakhi har aik se jo riwayat suni aur kuchh ki hadis kuchh ki tasdeeq karti hai. un logon ne bayan kya ke Sayeda Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ne farmaya : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) jab safar ka irada kartey to Qura daltey apni aurton par aur jis aurat ke naam par Qura nikalta, usko safar mein sath ley jatey. Sayeda Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ne kaha : to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Qura daala aik jihad ke safar mein usmein mera naam nikla. main Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath gaee aur ye zikr us waqt ka hai jab parde ka hukm utar chuka tha main apne hodaj mein sawar hoti aur raah mein jab utarti to bhi usi hodaj mein rehti. jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) jihad se farigh huey aur lautey aur Madina se qareeb ho gaey. aik baar Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne raat ko kooch ka hukm diya, main khadi hui jab logon ne kooch ki khabar kar di aur chali, yahan tak ke lashkar ke aagey badh gaee, jab main apne kaam se farigh hui to apne hodaj ki taraf aai aur Sina ko chhuwa, malum hua ke mera haar zifaar ke nageenon ka gir gaya, (zifaar aik gaaun hai Yaman mein) mein lauti aur us haar ko dhoondney lagi uske dhoondney mein mujhey der lagi aur wo log aa pahunchey jo mera hodaj uthatey they, unhon-ne wo uthaya aur mere oont par rakh diya jis par main sawar hoti thi wo ye samjhey ke main usi hodaj mein hun. us waqt auratein halki ( dubli) thin na sandhi thin na moti kyonke thoda khana khaati thin, isliye unko hodaj ka bojh aadat ke khilaf malum na hua, jab unhon-ne usko oont par laada aur uthaya, aur main aik kam-umr ladki bhi thi, aakhir logon ne oont ko uthaya, aur chal diye aur maine apna haar us waqt paya jab Sara lashkar chal diya, main jo unke thikaaney par aai to wahan na kisi ki awaz hai, na koi awaz sunney wala hai, maine ye irada kya ke jahan baithi thi wahin baith jaun aur main ye samjhi ke log jab mujhey na paeingey , to yahin lot kar aaeingey , to main usi thikaaney par baithi thi, itney mein meri aankh lag gaee aur main so rahi , aur Safwan bin muattal Salma zakwaani (Raziallahu anhu) aik shakhs tha, wo aaraam ke liye aakhir raat mein lashkar ke peechhey thehra tha, jab wo rawaana hua to subah ko mere thikaaney par pahuncha, usko aik aadmi ka jussa malum hua, jo so raha hai, wo mere paas aaya aur mujh ko pehchan liya dekhtey hi, isliye ke main parde ka hukm utarney se pahley iske samney hua karti. main jaag uthi, uski awaz sun kar jab us ne ( إِنَّا لِلَّـهِ وَإِنَّا إِلَيْهِ رَاجِعُونَ ( padha mujh ko pehchan kar. maine apna munh dhanp liya apni odhni se. Allah ki qasam! us ne koi baat mujh se nahi ki, na maine uski koi baat suni siwaey (( إِنَّا لِلَّـهِ وَإِنَّا إِلَيْهِ رَاجِعُون ( kehney ke. phir us ne apna oont bithaya aur apna hath mere chadhney ke liye bichhaa diya. main oont par Sawar ho gaee aur wo paidal chala oont ko kheenchta hua, yahan tak ke ham lashkar mein pahunchey aur lashkar ke log utar chukey they sakht do-pahar ki garmi mein, to mere muqaddmey mein tabah huey, jo log tabah huey (yani jinhoney bad-gumaani ki) aur Quran mein jiski nisbat ( تَوَلَّى كِبْرَه ( aaya hai yani baani-mabaani us tohmat ka wo Abdullah-bin-Ubai bin salool (munafiq tha). aakhir ham Madina mein aaey aur main jab Madina mein pahunchi to bimar ho gaee aik mahina tak bimar rahi aur logon ka ye haal tha ke bohtan karne walon ki baton mein ghaur kartey aur mujhey unki kisi baat ki khabar na thi. Mina sirf mujh ko is baat se shak hua ke maine apni bimari main Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki wo shafqat na dekhi thi, jo pahley mere haal par hoti. jab main bimar hui Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) sirf andar aatey aur salam kartey phir farmatey : ''ye aurat kaisi hai.'' so is baat se mujhey shak hota lekin mujhey us kharabi ki khabar na thi, yahan tak ke jab main dubli ho gaee bimari janey ke baad to main nikli aur mere sath mistah ki maan bhi nikli manaase ki taraf (manaase jagah thi Madina ke bahar) aur wo pakhaney ki jagah thi ham logon ke (paakhaaney banney se pahley) ham log raat hi ko nikla kartey aur raat hi ko chaley aatey aur ye zikr us waqt ka hai jab hamarey gharon ke nazdeek pakhaney nahi baney they aur ham pahley Arbon ki tarah jangal mein jaya kartey (paakhaaney ke liye) aur ghar ke paas pakhaney banaaney se nafrat rakhtey, to main chali aur Umme- mistah mere sath thi wo beti thi abu-Raham bin matlab bin abd munaaf ki aur uski maan sakhr bin Aamir ki beti thi jo khala thi saiyedna Abu-Bakar siddeeq (Raziallahu anhu) ki (iska naam Salma tha) uske betey ka naam mistah bin Asaasa bin Ibad bin Muttalib (Raziallahu anhu) tha, gharaz main aur Umme- Mistah donon jab apne kaam se farigh ho chukein to wapas apne ghar ki taraf aa rahi thin, itney mein umme-Mistah ka paon uljhaa apni chadar main aur boli: halaak hua mistah . maine kaha : tuney buri baat kahi. to bura kehti hai us shakhs ko jo badr ki ladai mein Sharik tha. wo boli: aey naadaan ! tuney kuchh nahi suna. Mistah (Raziallahu anhu) ne kya kaha? maine kaha : kya kaha is ne mujh se bayan kya jo bohtan lagaaney walon ne kaha tha. ye sun kar meri bimari badh gaee, aik aur bimari badhai. main jab apne ghar pahunchi to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) andar tashrif laey aur salam kya aur farmaya : ''ab us aurat ka kya haal hai?'' maine kaha : aap mujh ko ijazat detey hain apne maan-baap ke paas janey ki. aur mera us waqt ye irada tha ke main maan-baap ke paas ja kar us khabar ki tehqeeq karun. aakhir Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mujh ko ijazat di aur main apne maan-baap ke paas aai. maine apni maan se kaha : ammaan! ye log kya bak rahe hain. wo boli: beta ! to uska khayal na kar aur usko badi baat mat samajh Allah ki qism aisa bahut kam hua hai ke kisi mard ke paas aik khoobsurat aurat ho jo usko chahta ho aur uski saukanein bhi hon aur saukanein uske aib na nikaalein. maine kaha : Subhan-Allah ! logon ne to ye kehna shuru kar diya. main saari raat roti rahi. subah tak mere aansu na thahrey, aur na neend aai subah ko bhi mein ro rahi thi aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne saiyedna Ali-bin abi-Talib aur saiyedna Usama-bin-Zaid (Raziallahu anhu) ko bulaya kyonke wahi nahi utri thi aur un donon se mashwara liya mujh ko juda karne ke liye (yani talaaq dene ke liye) saiyedna Usama-bin-Zaid (Raziallahu anhu) ne to wahi raey di jo wo jantey they Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki bevi ke haal ko aur uski ismat ko aur Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki mohabbat ko iske sath. Mina unhon-ne kaha : ya Rasulullah! Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) aap ki bevi hain aur ham to siwa behtri ke aur koi baat uski nahi jantey. saiyedna Ali-bin abi-Talib (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha : Allah Taala ne aap par tangi nahi ki aur Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ke siwa auratein bahut hain aur agar aap londi se poochhiye to wo aap se sach keh degi (laundi se murad Barira hai jo Sayeda Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ke paas rehti thi) Sayeda Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ne kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Barira ko bulaya aur farmaya : ''aey Bareera! tu ney kabhi Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se aisi baat dekhi hai jis se tujh ko uski paakdaamni mein shak padey?'' Barira ne kaha : qism uski jisne aapko sachcha paighambar karke bheja hai agar main unka koi kaam dekhti kabhi to main aib bayan karti. is se zyada koi aib nahi hai ke Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) kam Umr ladki hai, aata chhod kar ghar ka so jati hai, phir bakri aati hai aur usko kha leti hai. ( matlab ye hai ke unmein koi aib nahi jis ko aap poochhtey hain na iske siwa koi aib hai jo aib hai wo yahi hai ke bholi bhaali ladki aur kam umri ki wjah se ghar ka bando-bast nahi kar sakti) Sayeda Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ne kaha : phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) member par khadey huey aur Abdullah-bin-Ubai salool se badla chaha. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya member par : ''aey musalman logo! kon badla lega mera us shakhs se jiski sakht baat eza dene wali mere ghar walon ki nisbat mujh tak pahunchi. Allah ki qasam! main to apni ghar wali (yani Sayeda Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ko) nek samajhta hun aur jis shakhs se ye log tohmat lagaatey hain (yani Safwan bin muattal (Raziallahu anhu) se) usko bhi nek samajhta hun aur wo kabhi mere ghar mein nahi gaya magar mere sath.'' ye sun kar saiyedna Sad-bin-Muaz Ansari (Raziallahu anhu) (jo qabila Aus ke sardaar they) khadey huey aur kehney lagey : ya Rasulullah! main aap ka badla leta hun. agar tohmat karne wala hamari qaum Aus mein se hai to ham uski gardan maartey hain aur jo hamarey bhaiyon khazraj mein se hai to aap hukm kijiye ham aap ke hukm ki tameel karengey (yani uski gardan maarengey) ye sun kar saiyedna Sad-bin-Ubada (Raziallahu anhu) khadey huey aur wo khazraj qabeele ke sardaar they aur nek aadmi they lekin us waqt unko apni qaum ki hamiiyat aa gaee aur kehney lagey : aey Sad-bin-Muaz! qism Allah ki baqa ki, to hamari qaum ke shakhs ko qatl na karega, na kar sakega. ye sun kar Usaid-bin-Huzair (Raziallahu anhu) jo Sad-bin-Muaz (Raziallahu anhu) ke chachazaad bhai they khadey huey aur Sad-bin-Ubada (Raziallahu anhu) se kehney lagey : tuney ghalat kaha : qism Allah ki baqaa ki! ham usko qatl karengey aur to munafiq hai jab to munaafiqon ki taraf se ladta hai. gharaz ke donon qabeeley Aus aur khazraj ke log uth khadey huey aur qareeb tha ke kusht w khoon shuru ho aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) member par khadey huey they unko samjha rahe they aur unka ghussa faro kar rahe they yahan tak ke wo khamosh ho gaey aur Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) bhi khamosh ho rahe. Sayeda Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ne kaha : main us din bhi Sara din roti rahi ke mere aansu na thamtey they aur na neend aati thi, phir dusri raat bhi roti rahi ke na aansu thamtey they, na neend aati thi aur mere bap ne ye guman kya ke rotey-rotey mera kalejaa phat jaeyga mere maan-baap mere paas baithey they aur main ro rahi thi, itney mein Ansar ki aik aurat ne ijazat mangi . maine usko ijazat di wo bhi aa kar roney lagi, phir ham usi haalat mein they ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) tashrif laey aur salam kya aur baithey aur jis roz se mujh par tohmat hui thi us roz se aaj tak Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) mere paas nahi baithey they aur aik mahina yunhi guzra tha mere muqaddime mein koi wahi nahi utri. Sayeda Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ne kaha : phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne tashahud padha baithtey hi aur farmaya : aey Aaisha! mujhko tumhari taraf se aisi-aisi khabar pahunchi hai, phir agar tum paakdaaman ho to an-qareeb Allah Taala tumhari paakdaamni bayan kar dega aur agar tuney gunah kya hai to tauba kar aur bakhshish maang Allah se us waastey ke banda jab gunah ka iqrar karta hai aur tauba karta hai Allah usko bakhsh deta hai.'' Sayeda Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ne kaha : jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) apni baat tamam kar chukey to mere aansu bilkul band ho gaey yahan tak ke aik qatra bhi na raha. maine apne bap se kaha : aap jawab dein meri taraf se Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko us muqaddime mein jo Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya, mere bap boley : Allah ki qism mein nahi janta kya main jawab dun Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko) Subhan-Allah bap to muhibbe-rasool they bhale hi unki beti ka muqaddima tha par Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke samney dam na maara). maine apni maan se kaha : tum jawab do meri taraf se Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko . wo boli : Allah ki qism mein nahi janti kya jawab dun Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko . aakhir maine khud hi kaha aur main kam-umr ladki thi maine Quran nahi padha hai lekin main qism Allah ki ye janti hun ke tum logon ne is baat ko yahan tak suna ke tumharey dil mein jam gaee aur tum ne usko sach samajh liya (ye Sayeda Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ne ghussey se farmaya, warna sach kisi ne nahi samjha, bajuz tohmat karne walon ke) phir agar tum se kahun mein be-gunah hun aur Allah Taala janta hai ke main be-gunah hun to bhi tum mujh ko sachcha nahi manney ke, aur agar main aik gunah ka iqrar kar loon jisko maine nahi kya hai aur Allah Taala janta hai ke main usse paak hun to tum mujh ko sachcha samjhogey aur main apni aur tumhari misl siwaey iske koi nahi paati jo Yusuf (Alaihissalam) ke bap ki thi (Yaqoob (Alaihissalam) ki aur Sayeda Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ko ranj mein unka naam yad na aaya Yusuf (Alaihissalam) ka bap kaha) jab unhon-ne kaha : (فَصَبْرٌ جَمِيلٌ وَاللَّهُ الْمُسْتَعَانُ عَلَى مَا تَصِفُونَ) yani ab sabr behtar hai aur tumhari us guftgu par Allah hi ki madad darkaar hai, phir maine karwat mod li aur main apne bichhoney par let rahi aur main Allah ki qism us waqt janti thi ke main paak hun aur Allah Taala zaroor meri paaki zahir karega lekin Allah ki qism mujhey ye guman na tha ke meri shaan mein Quran utrega jo padha jaeyga (qiyamat tak) kyonke meri shaan khud mere guman mein is laaiq na thi ke Allah izzat aur buzurgi wala mere muqaddime mein kalam karey aur kalam bhi aisa jo padha jaey albatta mujh ko ye ummeed thi ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) khuwab mein koi mazmoon aisa dekhengey jis se Allah Taala meri paaki zahir kar dega. Sayeda Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ne kaha : to Allah ki qism Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) apni jagah se nahi uthey they aur na ghar walon mein se koi bahar gaya tha ke Allah Taala ne apne paighambar (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) par wahi bheji aur utara Quran ko. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko wahi ki sakhti malum honey lagi yahan tak ke Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke jism Mubarak par se mauta ki tarah pasiney ke qatrey tapakney lagey, jaadon ke dinon mein us kalam ki sakhti se jo Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) par utra (is liye ke badey shehanshaah ka kalam tha) jab ye haalat Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki jati rahi (yani wahi khatm ho chuki) to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) hansney lagey aur awwal Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne ye kalima munh se nikala. farmaya : ''aey Aaisha! khush hoja Allah Taala ne tujh ko be-gunah aur paak farmaya'' meri maan ne kaha : uth aur Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki tareef kar aur shukr kar aur Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sar ka bosa ley. maine kaha : Allah ki qism main to Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki taraf nahi uthungi aur na kisi ki tareef karungi siwaey Allah Taala ke usi ne meri paaki utari. Sayeda Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ne kaha : Allah Taala ne ( إِنَّ الَّذِينَ جَاءُوا بِالْإِفْكِ عُصْبَةٌ مِّنكُمْ لَا تَحْسَبُوهُ شَرًّا لَّكُم بَلْ هُوَ خَيْرٌ لَّكُمْ ( ) ۲۴ - النور : ۱۱ ( aakhir tak das aayaton ko to Allah ne un aayaton ko meri paaki ke liye utara. saiyedna Abu-Bakar siddeeq (Raziallahu anhu) ne jo Mistah (Raziallahu anhu) se azeez daari ki wjah se sulook kya kartey they ye kaha : ke Allah ki qism ! ab main usko kuchh na doonga kyonke usne Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ki nisbat aisa kaha to Allah ne ye aayat utari ( وَلاَ يَأْتَلِ أُولُو الْفَضْلِ مِنْكُمْ وَالسَّعَةِ أَنْ يُؤْتُوا أُولِى الْقُرْبَى ( se ( أَلاَ تُحِبُّونَ أَنْ يَغْفِرَ اللَّهُ لَكُمْ ( aakhir tak. Hibban bin-Musa ne kaha : Abdullah-bin-Mubarak ne kaha : ye aayat badi ummeed ki hai Allah ki kitab mein kyonke usmein Allah Taala ne naate-daaron ke sath achcha sulook karne mein bakhshish ka wada kya. saiyedna Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha : Allah ki qasam! main ye chahta hun ke Allah mujh ko bakhshey, phir Mistah (Raziallahu anhu) ko jo kuchh diya kartey they wo jari kar diya aur kaha : main kabhi band na karunga. Sayeda Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ne kaha : aur Rasulullah ne Ummul-Momenin Zenab binte-Jahash (Raziallahu anha) se mere baab mein puchha : jo wo janti hun ya unhon-ne dekha ho. unhon-ne kaha : (halanke wo saukan thin) ya Rasulullah ! main apne kaan aur aankh ki ehtiyat rakhti hun (yani bin suney koi baat suni hai nahi kehti aur na bin dekhey ko dekhi kehti hon) main to Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ko nek hi samajhti hun. Sayeda Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ne kaha : Zenab (Raziallahu anha) hi aik bevi thin jo mere muqabil ki thin Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki beeviyon main aur Allah Taala ne unko us tohmat se bachaya unki parhezgari ki wjah se aur unki behan Hamna binte-Jahash (Raziallahu anha) ne unke liye tassub kya aur unke liye ladin to jo log tabah huey unmein wo bhi thin (yani tohmat mein Sharik thin) Zohri ne kaha : to un logon ka ye aakhir haal hai jo ham ko pahuncha."
"7076","Sheban ne kaha : hamein Qatada ne Hazrat Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki ke ahale-Makka ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se mutalba kya ke aap unhein (apni nabwooat ki sachchai ki) koi nishani dikhaaein to aap ne unhein chaand ke 2 tukdey hona dikhaya."
"7077","Mamar ne hamein Qatada se, unhon-ne Hazrat Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se Sheban ki hadis ke ham mana riwayat ki."
"7080","abu-Bakar-bin-abi-Sheba ne hamein hadis bayan ki, kaha : hamein abu-Muawiya aur abu-Usama ne Aamash se hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne Saeed-bin-Jubair se, unhon-ne abu Abdur-Rehman Salma se aur unhon-ne Hazrat abu-Musa (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : takleef deh baatein sun kar Allah se zyada sabr karne wala koi nahi, iske sath dusron ko Sharik thehraya jata hai aur uski aulad banai jati hai phir bhi wo unhein aafiyat mein rakhta hai aur unhein rizq ata karta hai."
"7081","Wakee ne kaha : hamein Aamash ne hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne kaha : hamein Saeed-bin-Jubair ne abu Abdur-Rehman Salma se, unhon-ne Hazrat abu-Musa (Raziallahu anhu) se aur unhon-ne Nabi akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se usi ki tarah riwayat ki, siwaey Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke us qaul ke : aur uski aulad banai jati hai unhon-ne us ( qaul ( ko bayan nahi kya."
"7111","Leis ne Bukair se unhon-ne basar-bin Saeed se, unhon-ne Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se aur unhon-ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat ki ke aap ne farmaya : tum mein se kisi shakhs ko mahz iska amal nijat nahi dilaaey ga . aik shakhs ne kaha : Allah ke rasool! aapko bhi nahi? aap ne farmaya : mujhey bhi nahi magar ye ke Allah Taala apni taraf se mujhey apni rehmat se chipa ley, lekin tum seedhey rastey par chalo."
"7112","Amr-bin-Haris ne Bukair-bin-Ashajj se isi sanad ke sath riwayat ki magar (is mein) kaha : apni rehmat aur Fazal se aur unhon-ne : aur lekin tum seedhey rastey par chalo. bayan nahi kya."
"7138","abu-Hazim ne Hazrat Sahal-bin-Sad (Raziallahu anhu) se, unhon-ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat ki ke aap ne farmaya : jannat mein aik darakht hai, aik sawar uske saaey mein sau saal tak chalta rahe to bhi usko tay na kar sakey."
"7141","Yaqoob bin Abdur-Rehman qaari ne hamein abu-Hazim se hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne Hazrat Sahal-bin-Sad (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : jannat waley jannat ke bula khaney ko is tarah dekhengey jis tarah tum log aasman mein sitaarey ko dekhtey ho."
"7144","Ata-bin-Yasar ne Hazrat Abu-Saeed Khudri (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : ahle-jannat fazeelat mein baahami farq ki bina par apne uper bula khaanon mein rehney walon ko is tarah dekhengey jis tarah tum aasman ke mashriqi ya maghribi kinarey mein chamaktey huey tanha sitaarey ko dekhtey ho. unhon (sahaba (Rizwaanullahi anhum ajmaeen) ( ne kaha : Allah ke rasool (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) kya wo anbiya (Alaihissalam) ke rehney ki jaghein hongi jin tak doosra koi nahi pahunch sakta ? Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : kyon nahi, us zaat ki qism jiske hath mein meri jaan hai ! ye aisey mard hongey jo Allah Taala par eman laey aur unhon-ne rasulon ki tasdeeq ki."
"7256","Mamar ne Hammam-bin-Munabba se riwayat ki kaha : ye hadisein hain jo Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) ne hamein Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se bayan ki unhon-ne kai hadisein zikr ki unmein se (eik ye thi) aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : qiyamat us waqt qaaim nahi hogi yahan tak ke musalmanon ki do badi jamatein aapas main hi jang karein gi. un donon ke darmyan badi qatl aur ghaaratgari hogi jabke donon aik hi ( baat yani haq ki nusrat ka ( daawa karti hongin."
"7301","Aaraj ne Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : qiyamat us waqt tak qaaim nahi hogi, yahan tak ke aik shakhs doosrey aadmi ki qabr ke paas se guzrey ga to kahega : kash! ! uski jagah main hota."
"7302","abu-Hazim ne Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya is zaat ki qism jiske hath mein meri jaan hai ! duniya us waqt tak rukhsat nahi hogi, yahan tak ke aik shakhs ( kisi ki) qabr ke paas se guzrey to is par lot-pot hoga aur kahega : kaash! ! us qabr waley ki jagah main hota aur uske paas Deen nahi hoga, bas aazmaish hogi."
"7319","aur abu-Muawiya ne Dawood-bin-abi-hindsey unhon-ne abu-Nazara se unhon-ne Hazrat abu-Saeed (Raziallahu anhu) se aur unhon-ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se usi ki tarah riwayat ki."
"7325","abu-Usama ne hamein hadis bayan ki kaha : hamein Shoba ne abu-Tayyah se hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne kaha : maine abu-Zura se suna, unhon-ne Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se aur unhon-ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat ki ke aap ne farmaya : meri ummat ko Quraish ka ye qabila halaak karega. unhon-ne ( sahaba kiram (Rizwaanullahi anhum ajmaeen)) ne arz ki, phir aap hamein kya (karne ka ( hukm detey hain? aap ne farmaya : kaash! ! log unse alag ho jaaein."
"7329","Mamar ne hamein Hammam-bin-Munabba se hadis bayan ki, kaha : ye hadisein hain jo Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat kin, unmein se (ye hadis bhi) hai : aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : Kisraa halaak ho gaya, phir uske baad Kisraa nahi hoga, aur qaisar bhi halaak ho jaeyga phir uske baad koi qaisar nahi hoga aur un donon ke khazaaney Allah ki raah mein taqseem kiye jaengey."
"7330","Hazrat Jaabir-bin-Samra (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : jab Kisraa halaak ho jaeyga to uske baad koi Kisraa nahi hoga. ( aagey ( unhon-ne Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) ki hadis ki manind (tarah) zikr kiya."
"7331","Qutaiba-bin-Saeed aur abu-Kamil Jahdari ne kaha : hamein abu-Awana ne Samak-bin-Harab se hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne Hazrat Jaabir-bin-Samra (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, kaha : maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna : musalmanon ya ( farmaya : ( mominon ki aik jamat aale-Kisraa ke khazaaney ko , jo safaid (Imaarat) mein hai zaroor-zaroor fateh karegi. Quteba ne musalmanon ki (jamat) kaha aur kisi shak ka izhar nahi kiya."
"7332","Shoba ne Samak-bin-Harab se riwayat ki, unhon-ne kaha : maine Hazrat Jaabir-bin-Samra (Raziallahu anhu) se suna, kaha : maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suna, ( aagey ( abu-Awana ki hadis ke ham mana hadis bayan ki."
"7333","Abdul-Azeez-bin-Muhammad ne soor-bin-Zaid-daili se, unhon-ne abu-ghais se aur unhon-ne Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : tum ne aisey Shahar ke barey mein suna hai jiski aik taraf khushki mein hai aur dusri taraf samandar mein hai? unhon (sahaba (Rizwaanullahi anhum ajmaeen)) ne arz ki, ji haan , Allah ke rasool ! Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : qiyamat qaaim nahi hogi yahan tak ke iske khilaf banu-Ishaq mein se sattar (70) hazaar log jihad karengey, wahan pahunch kar wo utrein gey to hathiyaron se jang karengey na teer-andazi karengey, wo kahengey , ''لاالٰہ الا اللہ Allah ki qism اکبر'' to us ( Shahar ( ki aik taraf gir jaeygi. Saur ne kaha : main hi janta hun ke unhon (abu-Huraira (Raziallahu anhu)) ne wahi (kinara) kaha (aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : jo samandar mein hai. phir wo dusri baar ''لاالٰہ الا اللہ Allah ki qism اکبر'' kahengey to us ( Shahar (ka doosra kinaaraa bhi gir jaeyga. phir wo teesri baar ''لاالٰہ الا اللہ Allah ki qism اکبر'' kahengey to unke liye rasta khul jaeyga aur wo us ( Shahar ( mein dakhil ho jaeinge aur ghaneemat ka maal hasil karengey. jab wo maale-ghanimat taqseem kar rahe hongey to aik cheekhti hui awaz aaeygi jo kahegi : dajjal namudaar ho gaya. chunanche wo (musalman) har cheez chhod dengey aur wapas palat padein gey."
"7334","Sulaiman-bin-Bilal ne kaha : hamein soor-bin-Zaid daili ne isi sanad ke sath usi ki tarah hadis bayan ki."
"7335","Muhammad-bin-Bashir ne kaha : hamein Ubaidullah ne Naafe se, unhon-ne Hazrat ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) se aur unhon-ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat ki ke Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : yahood tum se jang karengey aur tum unhein achi tarah qatl karogey yahan tak ke patthar kahega : aey musalman ! ye Yahudi hai, aagey badh , usko qatl kar."
"7336","Yahya ne hamein Ubaidullah se isi sanad ke sath riwayat ki aur apni hadis mein kaha : ye Yahudi mere peechhey hai."
"7337","Umar-bin-Hamza ne kaha : maine Salim ko kehtey huey suna : hamein Hazrat Abdullah-bin-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) ne bataya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : tum aur yahood aapas mein jang karogey, yahan tak ke patthar kahega : aey musalman ! ye mere peechhey aik Yahudi hai, aagey badh , usey qatl kar de."
"7338","ibne-Shahab ne kaha : mujhey Saalim-bin-Abdullah ne hadis bayan ki ke Hazrat Abdullah-bin-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) ne unhein khabar di ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : Yahudi tum se jang karengey (aakhirkaar) tumhen un par tasallut ata kar diya jaeyga, yahan tak ke patthar (bhi) kahega : aey musalman ! ye Yahudi mere peechhey hai, usko qatl kar do."
"7339","Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : qiyamat qaaim nahi hogi, yahan tak ke musalman yahudiyon ke khilaf jang ladein gey aur musalman unko qatl karengey. yahan tak ke Yahudi darakht ya patthar ke peechhey chhipey ga aur patthar ya darakht kahega : aey musalman ! aey Allah ke bandey ! mere peechhey ye aik Yahudi hai aagey badh , usko qatl kar de, siwaey gharqad ke darakht ke (wo nahi kahega) kyonke wo yahood ka darakht hai."
"7340","abul-Ahwas aur abu-Awana donon ne Samak se aur unhon-ne Hazrat Jaabir-bin-samra (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, kaha : maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna : qiyamat se pahley kai kazzaab (jhoote) hongey. abul-Ahwas ki hadis mein unhon ( abu-Bakar-bin-abi-Sheba ( ne mazeed kaha ke maine unse puchha : kya aap ne ye ( baat ( Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suni? unhon-ne kaha : haan."
"7341","aur ibne-Musanna aur ibne-Bashar ne mujhey hadis bayan ki, donon ne kaha : hamein Muhammad-bin-Jafar ne hadis bayan ki, kaha : hamein Shoba ne Samak se isi sanad ke sath usi ki tarah riwayat ki. Samak ne kaha : maine apne bhai ko kehtey huey suna ke Hazrat Jaabir (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha : un ( jhooton ( se bach kar raho."
"7342","Aaraj ne Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se aur unhon-ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat ki ke Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : qiyamat qaaim nahi hogi, yahan tak ke dajjaalon aur kazzaabon (jhooton) ko bheja jaeyga jo tees ke qareeb hongey. unmein se har aik dawa karta hoga ke wo Allah ka rasool hai."
"7343","Hammam-bin-Munabba ne Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se aur unhon-ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se usi ki tarah riwayat ki, magar unhon-ne kaha : yahan tak ke wo (shaitan ki taraf se) maboos bin kar (bhejey hue) aaeingey."
"7354","Yunus ne ibne-Shahab se riwayat ki ke Saalim-bin-Abdullah ne unhein bataya , unhein Hazrat Abdullah-bin-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) ne khabar di ke saiyedna umr (Raziallahu anhu) Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath chand logon mein ibne-Sayyaad ke paas gaey yahan tak ke usey bani-maghaala ke qil'ey ke paas ladkon ke sath kheltey huey dekha un dinon ibne-Sayyaad jawaani ke qareeb tha. usko khabar na hui yahan tak ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne uski peeth par apna hath maara. phir Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne us se puchha ke kya to is baat ki gawahi deta hai ke main Allah Taala ka rasool hun? ibne-Sayyaad ne Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki taraf dekha aur kaha ke main gawahi deta hun ke tum ummiyeenn ke rasool ho (ummi kehtey hain un-padh aur be-taleem ko). phir ibne-Sayyaad ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se kaha ke tum is baat ki gawahi detey ho ke main Allah Taala ka rasool hun? Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne is baat ka kuchh jawab na diya? (aur us se musalman honey ki darkhaast na ki kyonke Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) iske musalman honey se maayoos ho gaey aur aik riwayat mein saad mohmila se yani Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne usko laat se maara) aur farmaya ke main Allah par aur uske rasulon par imaan laya. phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne us se puchha ke tujhey kya dikhai deta hai? wo bola ke mere paas kabhi sachcha aata hai aur kabhi jhoota. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke tera kaam gad-bad ho gaya (yani mila-jula haq aur baatil donon se). phir Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke maine tujh se poochhney ke liye aik baat dil mein chhipaai hai. ibne-Sayyaad ne kaha ke wo dukkha ( dhuaan ( hai. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke zaleel ho, to apni qadr se kahan badh sakta hai? saiyedna umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha ke ya Rasulullah ! mujhey chhodiye mein iski gardan maarta hun. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke agar ye wahi (yani dajjal) hai to to usko mar na sakega aur agar ye wo (dajjal) nahi hai to tujhey iska maarna behtar nahi hai."
"7355","Saalim-bin-Abdullah ne kaha : maine Hazrat Abdullah-bin-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) se suna, wo kehtey hain is (pichhle waqiey) ke baad Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) aur Hazrat Ubai-ibne-Ka'b Ansari (Raziallahu anhu) khajooron ke us baagh mein gaey jis mein ibne-Sayyaad tha, baagh mein dakhil honey ke baad Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) khajooron ke tanon ki aad mein honey lagey taake us se pahley ke ibne-Sayyaad aapko dekhey aap uski koi baat sun lein, wo bistar par aik narm chadar main (usey odh kar leta) hua tha. uske andar se uski gungunaahat ki awaz aa rahi thi. jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) khajoor ke darakhton ki aad ley rahe they, to ibne-Sayyaad ki maan ne Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko dekh liya aur wo ibne-Sayyaad se kehney lagi saaf !  aur ye ibne-Sayyaad ka naam tha. ye Muhammad (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) (aaey) hain. ibne-Sayyaad uchhal kar khada ho gaya. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : agar wo usko (usi haalat mein) chhod deti to wo (apna mamla) waazeh kar deta."
"7368","Muhammad-bin-Jafar ne hamein hadis bayan ki kaha : hamein Shoba ne abdul-Malik-bin-Umair se hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne Rabai-bin-Hirash se unhon-ne Hazrat Huzefa (Raziallahu anhu) se aur unhon-ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat ki ke Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne dajjal ke barey mein, (farmaya) be-shak uske sath  pani hoga aur aag hogi uski aag (asl mein) thanda pani hoga aur uska pani aag hogi to tum log (dhokey mein) halaak na ho jana."
"7369","Hazrat abu Masood (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha : maine bhi ye hadis Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suni thi."
"7370","Shuaib-bin-safwaan ne hamein abdul-Malik-bin-Umair se unhon-ne Rabai-bin-Hirash se unhon-ne Aqba-bin-Amr-abu-Masood Ansari (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, (Rabai ne) kaha : main un ( Aqba-bin-Amr (Raziallahu anhu)) ke sath Hazrat Huzaifa-bin-yamaan (Raziallahu anhu) ke paas gaya Aqba (Raziallahu anhu) ne unse kaha : aap ne dajjal ke mutaalliq Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se jo hadis suni hai wo mujhey bayan kariye. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : dajjal nikley gaa us ke sath pani hoga aur aag hogi. jo logon ko pani nazar aa raha hoga (wo) aag hogi aur jo logon ko aag nazar aa rahi hogi. wo thanda meethaa pani hoga tum mein se jo shakhs usko paaey wo usmein kood jaey jo usey aag nazar aa rahi ho. bila shubah wo meethaa pakeeza pani hoga. Hazrat Aqba (Raziallahu anhu) ne Hazrat Huzefa (Raziallahu anhu) ki tasdeeq kartey huey kaha, aur maine (bhi) ye hadis suni thi."
"7371","Nuaim-bin-abi-Hind ne Rabai-bin-Hirash se riwayat ki kaha : (eik baar jab) Hazrat Huzefa (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha : dajjal ke sath jo kuchh hoga uska mujhey khud uski nisbat zyada ilm hai uske sath aik dariya pani ka hoga aur aik dariya aag ka hoga. jo tumhen nazar aayega ke wo aag hai, wo pani hoga aur jo tumhen nazar aayega ke wo pani hai, wo aag hogi. tum mein se jo shakhs usko paaey aur pani peenaa chahey wo us dariya se piye jo usey nazar aata hai ke wo aag hai. bila shubah wo usey pani paaeyga . Hazrat abu Masood (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha : maine bhi Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko isi tarah farmatey huey suna tha."
"7372","abu-Salma se riwayat hai unhon-ne kaha : maine Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se suna, unhon-ne kaha : ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : kya main tumhen dajjal ke mutaalliq aisi baat na bataaun jo kisi Nabi ne apni ummat ko nahi batai. wo yaqeeni taur par kaana hoga. uske sath jannat aur jahannam ki tarah (do jaghein samney) aaein gi. jiske barey mein wo kahey ke jannat hai wo (asl mein) jahannam hogi. maine isi tarah tumhen us se khabardar kar diya hai. jis tarah Hazrat Nuh (Alaihissalam) ne uske barey main apni qaum ko khabardaar kiya tha."
"7373","abu khaisma Zuhair-bin-Harab aur Muhammad-bin-Mehran razi ne mujhey hadis bayan ki. alfaz razi ke hain. kaha : hamein Waleed-bin-Muslim ne hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne kaha : hamein Abdur-Rehman-bin-Yazeed-bin-Jaabir ne Yahya-bin-Jaabir qaazi teiswin se unhon-ne Abdur-Rehman-bin-Jubair-bin-Nufair se. unhon-ne apne walid Jubair-bin-Nufair se aur unhon-ne Hazrat nawaas-bin-samaan (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, unhon-ne kaha : ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne aik subah dajjal ka zikr kiya. aap ne us (ke zikr ke dauran) mein kabhi awaz dheemi ki kabhi unchi ki. yahan tak ke hamein aisey laga jaisey wo khajooron ke jhund mein maujood hai. jab Sham ko ham aap ke paas (dobara) aaey to aap ne ham mein us (shadeed tassur) ko bhaanp liya. aap ne ham se puchha tum logon ko kya hua hai? ham ne kaha Allah ke rasool ! subah ke waqt aap ne dajjal ka zikr farmaya to aap ki awaz mein (aisa) utaar-chadhaao tha ke ham ne samjha ke wo khajooron ke jhund mein maujood hai. is par Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne irshad farmaya : mujhey tum logon (haazirin) par dajjal ke alawa doosrey (jahannam ki taraf bulaney walon) ka zyada khof hai agar wo nikalta hai aur main tumharey darmyan maujood hun to tumhari taraf se uske khilaf (uske inkar ke liye) dalaayel dene wala main hunga aur agar wo nikla aur main maujood na hua to har aadmi apni taraf se hujjat qaaim karne wala khud hoga aur Allah har musalman par mera khaleefa (khud nigahbaan) hoga. wo guchchhey daar baalon wala aik jawan shakhs hai uski aik aankh be-noor hai. main aik tarah se usko abdul-azeez-bin-qatan se tashbeeh deta hun. tum mein se jo usey paaey to uske samney sura kahaf ki shuruati aayatein padhey. wo Iraq aur Sham (Syria) ke darmyan aik rastey se nikal kar aayega. wo daain taraf bhi tabahi machaaney wala hoga aur baain taraf bhi. aey Allah ke bando ! tum Sabit qadam rehna. ham ne arz kiya Allah ke rasool ! zamin mein uski tezi ki raftaar kya hogi ? aap ne farmaya : badal ki tarah jiske peechhey hawa ho. wo aik qaum ke paas aayega unhein dawat dega wo is par imaan laaengey aur uski baatein maanein gey. to wo aasman (ke badal) ko hukm dega. wo barish barsaey ga aur wo zamin ko hukm dega to wo faslein ugaaey gi. Sham ke oqaat mein unke janwar ( charaagaahon se) wapas aaeingey to unke kohan sabse zyada oonchey aur than intihai zyada bharey huey aur kokhein phaili hui hongi. phir aik (aur) qaum ke paas aayega aur unhein (bhi) dawat dega. wo uski baat thukraa dengey. wo unhein chhod kar chala jaeyga to wo qahat ka shikar ho jaengey. unke maal maweshi mein se koi cheez unke hath mein nahi hogi. wo (dajjal) banjar zamin mein se guzrey ga to us se kahega apne khazaaney nikal to us (banjar zameen) ke khazaaney is tarah (nikal kar) uske peechhey lag jaengey jis tarah shehad ki makkhiyon ki raaniyaan hain. phir wo aik bhar-poor jawan ko bulaeyga aur usey talwaar mar kar (yakbaargi) do hisson mein taqseem kar dega jaisey nishana banaya janey wala hadaf (yakdam tukdey ho gaya) ho. phir wo usey bulaeyga to wo (zinda hokar) dekhtey huey chehrey ke sath hanstaa hua aayega. wo (dajjal) usi aalim mein hoga jab Allah Taala Masih-bin-Maryam (Alaihissalam) ko maabood farma dega. wo dimashq ke hissey mein aik safaid meenaar ke qareeb do kesri kapdon mein do farishton ke kandhon par hath rakhey huey utrein gey. jab wo apna sar jhukaay gey to qatrey girein gey aur sar uthayen gey to us se chamaktey motiyon ki tarah pani ki boondein girein gi. kisi kaafir ke liye jo aap ki saans ki khushbu paaeyga marney ke siwa koi chaara nahi hoga. unki saans (ki khushbu) wahan tak pahuncheygi jahan tak unki nazar jaeygi. aap (Alaihissalam) usey dhoondein gey to usey lud ( LUDIYA (ke darwazey par paeingey aur usey qatl kar dengey. phir Esa-bin-Maryam (Alaihissalam) ke paas wo log aaeingey jinhein Allah ne us ( dajjal ke daam mein aaney) se mehfooz rakha hoga to wo apne hath unke chehron par pherein gey aur unhein jannat mein unke darjaat ki khabar dengey. wo usi aalim mein hongey ke Allah Taala Esa (Alaihissalam) ki taraf wahi farmaeyga maine apne (paida kiye huey) bandon ko bahar nikal diya hai unse jang karne ki taqat kisi mein nahi. aap meri bandagi karne walon ko ikattha karke taur ki taraf ley jayen aur Allah yaajooj maajooj ko bhej dega. wo har unchi jagah se umadtey huey aaeingey. unke pahley log (meethey pani ki bahut badi jheel) buhaira tabriya se guzrengey aur is mein jo (pani) hoga usey pee jaeinge phir aakhiri log guzrengey to kahengey. kabhi is (buhaira) mein (bhi) pani hoga. Allah ke Nabi Hazrat Esa (Alaihissalam) aur unke sathi mahsoor ho kar reh jaengey. yahan tak ke unmein se kisi aik ke liye bail ka sar us se behtar (qeemti) hoga jitney aaj tumharey liye so Dinar hain. Allah ke Nabi Esa (Alaihissalam) aur unke sathi gid-gidaa kar duaein karengey to Allah Taala un (yaajooj maajooj) par unki gardanon mein keedon ka azab nazil kar dega to wo aik insan ke marney ki tarah (yakbaargi) iska shikar ho jaengey. phir Allah ke Nabi Esa (Alaihissalam) aur unke sathi utar kar (maidaani) zamin par aaeingey to unhein zamin mein baalisht bhar bhi jagah nahi milegi. jawan ki gandagi aur badboo se bhari hui na ho. is par hazarat Esa (Alaihissalam) aur unke sathi Allah ke samney gid-gidaaein gey to Allah Taala bakhti oonton ke jaisi lambi gardanon ki tarah (ki gardanon waale) parindey bhejeyga jo unhein uthayen gey aur jahan Allah chaahega ja phenkei gey. phir Allah Taala aisi barish bhejeyga jis se koi ghar enton ka ho ya oon ka (khema) oat muhaiya nahi kar sakega. wo zamin ko dho kar sheeshey ki tarah (saaf) kar chhodegi. phir zamin se kaha jaeyga apne phal ugaao aur apni barkat lota lao to us waqt aik anaar ko poori jamat khaaey gi aur uske chhilkey se saaya hasil karegi aur doodh mein (itni) barkat dali jaeygi ke oontni ka aik baar ka doodh logon ki aik badi jamat ko kafi hoga aur gaaey ka aik baar ka doodh logon ke qabeeley ko kafi hoga aur bakri ka aik baar ka doodh qabeeley ki aik shaakh ko kafi hoga. wo usi aalim mein reh rahe hongey. ke Allah Taala aik umda hawa bhejeyga wo logon ko unki baghlon ke nichey se pakdey gi aur har momin aur har musalman ki Rooh qabz kar leygi aur bad tareen log baqi reh jaeinge wo gadhon ki tarah (bar-sare-aam) aapas mein ikhtilat (milap) karengey to unhi par qiyamat qaaim hogi."
"7374","Ali-bin-Hujr Sadi ne hamein hadis bayan ki kaha : hamein Abdullah-bin-Abdur-Rehman-bin-Yazeed-bin-Jaabir aur Waleed-bin-Muslim ne hadis bayan ki (Ali) ibne-hijr ne kaha : aik ki hadis doosrey ki hadis mein shamil ho gaee hai. unhon-ne Abdur-Rehman-bin-Yazeed-bin-Jaabir se usi ki sanad ke sath jis tarah ham ne zikr kiya usi ke mutabiq bayan kiya aur us jumley ke baad usmein kabhi pani tha mazeed bayan kiya phir wo (aagey) chalein gey yahan tak ke wo Jabal khumr tak pahunchein gey aur wo baitul-maqdis ka pahaad hai to kahengey jo koi bhi zamin mein tha ham ne usey qatl kar diya aao ! ab usey qatl karein jo aasman mein hai phir wo apne teeron (jaisey hathiyaaron) ko aasman ki taraf chalaaein gey. to Allah Taala unke hathiyaaron ko khoon aalud karke unhi ki taraf wapas bhej dega aur ibne-hijr ki riwayat mein hai maine apne (paida kiye huey) bandon ko utara hai kisi aik ke paas bhi unse jang karne ki taqat nahi."
"7375","Saleh ne ibne-Shahab se riwayat ki kaha : mujhey Ubaidullah-bin-Abdullaah-bin-Utba ne bataya ke Hazrat Abu-Saeed Khudri (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha : aik din Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne hamarey sath dajjal ke barey mein lambi guftgu farmai. usmein aap ne hamarey samney jo bayan kiya usmein (ye bhi) tha ke aap ne farmaya : wo aayega is par Madina ke rastey haram kar diye gaey hongey. wo Madina se muttasil (lagi hui) aik narm shoreeli zamin tak pahunchega uske paas aik aadmi (Madina se) nikal kar jaeyga jo logon mein se behtreen ya behtreen logon mein se aik hoga aur us se kahega. main gawahi deta hun ke to wahi dajjal hai jiske barey mein Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne apni guftgu mein hamein bataya tha. to dajjal (apne sath maujood logon se) kahey) ga tum logon ka kya khayal hai ke agar main is shakhs ko qatl kar dun aur phir usey zinda kar dun to kya is mamley main tumhen koi shak (baqi) rahega? wo kahengey nahi. wo us shakhs ko qatl karega aur dobara zinda kar dega. jab wo us shakhs ko zinda karega to wo us se kahega . Allah ki qism ! tumharey barey mein mujhey ab se pahley is se zyada baseerat (sujh-bujh) kabhi hasil nahi thi. farmaya : dajjal usey qatl karna chaahega lekin usey us shakhs par tasallut hasil nahi ho sakega."
"7376","Shuaib ne Zohri se isi sanad ke sath usi ki tarah riwayat ki."
"7377","abu wddaak ne Hazrat Abu-Saeed Khudri (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : dajjal niklega to mominon mein se aik shakhs uska rukh karey gaa usey aslaha bardaar muhaafiz yani dajjal ke aslaha bardaar muhaafiz milein gey aur us se poochhein gey. kahan jana chahtey ho? wo kahega . main us shakhs ki taraf jana chahta hun jo (ab) namudaar hua hai wo us se kahengey. kya tum hamarey rab par imaan nahi rakhtey? wo kahega, hamarey rab (ki ruboobiyat (khudaai) aur sifaat (khubiyon)) mein koi posheedgi nahi wo (uski baat par mutmain na hotey huey) kahengey. isko qatl kar do. phir wo aik doosrey se kahengey. kya hamarey rab ne hamein mana nahi kiya tha ke us (ke samney pesh karne) se pahley kisi ko qatl na karo. wo usey dajjal ke paas ley jaengey. wo momin jab usey dekhega to kahega logo ! ye wahi dajjal hai jiska zikr Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya tha. farmaya : to dajjal iske barey mein hukm dega to us (ke aaza ( ko kheench kar baandh diya jaeyga phir wo kahega. usey pakdo aur iska sar aur munh tod do. to (mar-mar kar) iska pet aur iski kamar choodi kar di jaeygi. farmaya : phir wo (dajjal) kahega . kya tum mujh par imaan nahi laaogey? farmaya : to wo kahega tum jhootey (bnaawati) Masih ho. farmaya : phir iske barey mein hukm diya jaeyga to uski peshani se usey aari ke sath chira jaeyga yahan tak ke iske donon paon alag alag kar diye jaengey. farmaya : phir dajjal donon tukdon ke darmyan chalega . phir us se kahega. khadey ho jao chunanche wo seedha khada ho jaeyga farmaya : wo phir us se kahega kya mujh par imaan latey ho? wo kahega . (is sab kuchh se) tumharey barey mein meri baseerat mein izaafey ke siwa aur kuchh nahi hua. farmaya : phir wo shakhs kahega logo ! ye (dajjal) ab mere baad logon mein kisi ke sath aisa nahi kar sakega. farmaya : dajjal usey zabah karne ke liye pakdega to uski gardan se uski hansli ki haddiyon tak (ka hissa) taanbey ka banaya jaeyga wo kisi tareeqey se (usey zabah) na kar sakega. farmaya, to wo iske donon paon aur donon hathon se pakad kar usey phainkey ga . log samjhein gey us (dajjal) ne isey aag mein phenk diya hai jabke (asl mein wo) jannat mein daal diya jaeyga. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : shahadat mein rabbul-aalameen ke samney ye shakhs sab logon se bada hai."
"7378","Ibrahim-bin-Humaid Ruwasi ne Ismail-bin-abi-Khalid se unhon-ne Qais-bin-abi-Hazim se aur unhon-ne Hazrat Mughira-bin-Shoba (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, unhon-ne kaha : ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se dajjal ke barey mein jitna maine puchha us se zyada kisi ne nahi poochha. aap ne farmaya is (ke hawale) se tumhen kya baat itna thakaa rahi hai? wo tumhen nuqsan nahi pahunchaeyga. kaha : maine arz ki, Allah ke rasool (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ! log kehtey hain uske sath khaney (ke dher) aur (pani ke) dariya hongey. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : Allah ke nazdeek wo us se haqeer tar hai. (ke aisi chizon ke zariey se musalmanon ko gumrah kar sakey.)"
"7379","Hushaim ne Ismail se unhon-ne Qais se aur unhon-ne Hazrat Mughira-bin-Shoba (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki kaha : Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se dajjal ke barey mein jitna maine puchha us se zyada kisi ne nahi poochha, aap ne farmaya : tumharey sawal ka (sabab) kya hai? kaha : maine kaha wo (log) kehtey hain uske sath roti aur gosht ke pahaad aur pani ka dariyaa hoga farmaya : wo Allah ke nazdeek is se zyada haqeer (tuchh) hai."
"7380","Wakee , Jareer, Sufiyan , Yazid-bin-Harun aur abu-Usama sab ne Ismail se isi sanad ke sath Ibrahim-bin-Humaid ki tarah riwayat ki aur Yazeed ki hadis mein mazeed ye hai ke Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mujh se farmaya : mere betey !"
"7381","Muaz Anbari ne kaha : hamein Shoba ne Nauman-bin-Saalim se hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne kaha : maine Yaqoob-bin-Aasim-bin-Urwa-bin-Masood Saqafi se suna, wo kehtey hain maine Hazrat Abdullah-bin-Amr (Raziallahu anhu) se suna, unke paas aik shakhs aaya aur kaha : ye kya hadis hai jo aap bayan kartey hain. ke falan-falan baat honey tak qiyamat qaaim ho jaeygi unhon-ne Subhan-Allah ! ya 'لاالہ الااللہ' ya us jaisa koi kalima kaha : (aur kehney lagey ( maine pukhta irada kar liya ke main kisi ko kabhi koi baat bayan nahi karunga . maine ye kaha tha tum log thodey waqt baad bahut bada mamla dekhogey. Baitullah ko jalaa diya jaeyga aur ye hoga aur ye hoga. phir kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : meri ummat mein dajjal namudaar hoga aur chalis (40) mujhey yad nahi ke chalis (40) din (farmaey) ya chalis (40) mahiney ya chalis (40) saal rahega to Allah Taala Hazrat Esa (Alaihissalam) ko bhej dengey. wo is tarah hain jaisey Hazrat Urwa-bin-Masood (Raziallahu anhu) aap usey dhoondein gey aur usey halaak kar dengey. phir log saat (7) saal tak is haalat mein raheingey. ke koi se do aadmiyon ke darmyan dushmani tak na hogi phir Allah Taala Sham (Syria) ki taraf se aik thandi hawa chalaaey ga to poori zamin par aik bhi aisa aadmi nahi rahega jiske dil mein zarra barabar bhalai ya imaan hoga. magar wo hawa uski Rooh qabz karegi yahan tak kaha agar tum mein se koi shakhs pahaad ke jigar mein ghus jaeyga to wahan bhi wo (hawa) dakhil ho jaeygi. yahan tak ke uski Rooh qabz kar leygi. unhon-ne kaha : ye baat maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suni. aap ne farmaya : parindon jaisa halkaapan aur darindon jaisi aqlein rakhney waley bad tareen log baqi reh jaengey. na achchhai ko achchha samjhein gey na burai ko bura jaanein gey. shaitan koi shakl ikhtiyar karke unke paas aayega aur kahega : kya tum meri baat par amal nahi karogey? wo kahengey to hamein kya hukm deta hai? wo unhein but poojney ka hukm dega wo usi haalat mein raheingey unka rizq utartaa hoga unki ma'eeshat (arthviyavastha) bahut achi hogi. phir Saur phoonkaa jaeyga jo bhi usey suney ga wo gardan ki aik taraf ko jhukaaey ga aur dusri taraf ko uncha karega (gardanein tedhi ho jaeyngi) sabse pahlaa shakhs jo usey suney gaa wo apne oonton ke hauz ki lipaai kar raha hoga. wo pachhaad kha kar gir jaeyga aur doosrey log bhi gir (kar mar) jaengey. iske baad Allah Taala aik barish nazil farmaeyga . jo aik phuwaar ki tarah hogi. ya saaey ki tarah hogi. shak karne waley Nauman (bin-Saalim) hain us se insanon ke jism ug aaeingey. phir Saur mein dusri baar phoonk maari jaeygi. to wo sab log khadey huey dekh rahe hongey, ( zinda ho jaeinge ( phir kaha jaeyga logo ! apne parwardigar ki taraf aao ! aur (farishton se kaha jaeyga :) unko la khada karo unse sawal poochhey jaengey. hukm diya jaeyga aag mein bhejey janey walon ko (apni safon se) bahar nikaalo , puchha jaeyga kitnon mein se (kitney?) kaha jaeyga har hazaar mein se na-sau-ninyaanwe (999). unhon-ne kaha : to ye wo din hoga jo bachchon ko boodha kar dega aur wahi din hoga jab pindli se parda hata (kar deedaar jamaal karaya) jaeyga."
"7382","Muhammad-bin-Jafar ne kaha : hamein Shoba ne Nauman-bin-Saalim se hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne kaha : maine Yaqoob-bin-Aasim-bin-Urwa-bin-Masood se suna, unhon-ne kaha : maine aik shakhs ko suna, us ne Hazrat Abdullah-bin-Amr (Raziallahu anhu) se kaha : aap ye kehtey hain ke falan-falan (baat poori ho janey) par qiyamat qaaim ho jaeygi. Hazrat Abdullah-bin-Amr (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha : maine ye irada kar liya hai ke main tum logon ko koi hadis na sunaun. maine to ye kaha tha ke tum thodi muddat ke baad aik bada mamla dekhogey to Baitullah ke jalney ka waqia ho gaya. Shoba ne ye alfaz kahey ya us se miltey-jultey alfaz kahey. Hazrat Abdullah-bin-Amr (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : meri ummat mein dajjal namudaar hoga aur (uske baad Muhammad-bin-Jafar ne) Muaz ki hadis ki tarah hadis bayan ki aur apni hadis mein kaha : koi aik shakhs bhi jiske dil mein zarra barabar imaan ho, nahi bachey ga magar wo (hoga) uski Rooh qabz kar leygi Muhammad-bin-Jafar ne kaha : Shoba ne mujhey ye hadis kai baar sunai aur maine (kai baar) usey unke samney dohraya."
"7383","Muhammad-bin-Bashir ne abu-Hayyan se, unhon-ne abu-Zura se aur unhon-ne Hazrat Abdullah-bin-Amr (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, kaha : maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se aik aisi hadis suni hai jis ko sunney ke baad main usey bhula nahi. maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna : namudaar honey wali sabse pahley nishani maghrib se suraj ka tuloo hona aur din chadhey logon ke samney zamin ke chaupaaey ka nikalnaa hai. unmein se jo bhi nishani dusri se pahley zahir hogi, dusri uske baad jald namudaar ho jaeygi."
"7384","Abdullah-bin-Numair ne kaha : hamein abu-Hayyan ne Abu-Zaraa se bayan kiya, kaha : musalmanon mein se teen shakhs Madina mein Marwaan-bin-Hakam ke paas baithey they aur usey qiyamat ki nishaniyan bayan kartey huey sun rahe they ke unmein se pehli dajjal ka zuhoor hoga, is par Hazrat Abdullah-bin-Amr (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha : (tum log yun samjho ke) Marwan ne kuchh bhi nahi kaha (kyonke uski baat Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke farman ke mutabiq nahi) maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se aik hadis suni thi jisey main bhula nahi. maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna. phir usi (pichhli hadis) ki tarah bayan kiya."
"7385","Sufiyan ne abu-Hayyan se aur unhon-ne abu-Zura se riwayat ki, unhon-ne kaha : logon ne mardaan ki maujoodgi mein qiyamat ke barey mein muzaakra kiya to Hazrat Abdullah-bin-Amr (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha : maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna. ( aagey ( un donon ki hadis ki tarah bayan kiya aur din chadhney ke waqt ka zikar nahi kiya."
"7386","ibne-bareeda ne hamein hadis bayan ki, kaha : mujhey Aamir-bin-Sharaheel-Shabi ne jinka talluq shaabu-hamdaan se tha, hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne Suhak-bin-Qais (Raziallahu anhu) ki behen saiyeda Fatima-binte-Qais (Raziallahu anhu) se sawal kiya, wo awwaleen hijrat karne walon mein se thin ke aap mujhey Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki aisi hadis bayan karein jo aap ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se (bilaa-waasta) suni ho. wo bolin ke achchha , agar tum ye chahtey ho to , main bayan karun gi. unhon-ne kaha ke haan, bayan karo. Sayeda Fatima (Raziallahu anha) ne kaha ke maine ibne-Mugheera (Raziallahu anhu) se nikah kiya aur wo un dinon Quraish ke umda jawaanon mein se they, phir wo Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath pahley hi jihad mein Shahid ho gaey. jab main bewa ho gaee to mujhey Abdur-Rehman-bin-Auf (Raziallahu anhu) ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sahaba mein se chand ke sath aa kar nikah ka paigham diya aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne apne Maula Usama-bin-Zaid (Raziallahu anhu) ke liye paigham bheja aur main Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki ye hadis sun chuki thi ke jo shakhs mujh se mohabbat rakhey, usko chahiye ke Usama (Raziallahu anhu) se bhi mohabbat rakhey. jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mujh se is barey mein guftgu ki to maine kaha ke mere kaam ka ikhtiyar Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko hai, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) jis se chaahein nikah kar dijiye. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke tum umme-Sharik (Raziallahu anhu) ke ghar chali jao aur umme-Sharik (Raziallahu anhu) Ansar mein aik maaldaar aurat thi aur Allah ki raah mein bahut zyada kharch karti thin, uske paas mehman utartey they. maine arz kiya ke bahut achchha, main umme-Sharik (Raziallahu anhu) ke paas chali jaaungi. phir Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke umme-Sharik (Raziallahu anhu) ke paas mat ja uske paas mehman bahut aatey hain aur mujhey bura malum hota hai ke kahin teri odhni gir jaey ya teri pindliyon par se kapda hat jaey aur log terey badan mein se wo dekhein jo tujhey bura lagey ga. tum apne chacha ke betey Abdullah-bin-Amr-bin-Umme-Maktoom (Raziallahu anhu) ke paas chali jao aur wo bani-fahar mein se aik shakhs tha aur fahar Quraish ki aik shaakh hai aur wo us qabeele mein se tha jis mein se Sayeda Fatima (Raziallahu anha) bhi thin. phir Sayeda Fatima (Raziallahu anha) ne kaha ke main unke ghar mein chali gaee. jab meri iddat guzar gaee to maine pukarney waley ki awaz suni aur wo pukarney wala Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ka manaadi tha, wo pukar raha tha ke Namaz ke liye jama ho jao. main bhi masjid ki taraf nikli aur maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath Namaz padhi. main us saf mein thi jis mein auratein logon ke peechhey thin. jab Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Namaz padh li to member par baithey aur Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) hans rahe they. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke har aik aadmi apni Namaz ki jagah par rahe. phir farmaya ke tum jantey ho ke maine tumhen kyon ikattha kiya hai? sahaba boley ke Allah aur uska rasool (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) khub jantey hain. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke Allah ki qism maine tumhen raghbat (dilchaspi) dilaane ya daraane ke liye jama nahi kiya, balke isliye jama kiya ke Tameem daari (Raziallahu anhu) aik nasrani tha, wo aaya aur us ne bait ki aur musalman hua aur mujh se aik hadis bayan ki jo us hadis ke muwafiq hai jo main tum se dajjal ke barey mein bayan kiya karta tha. us ne bayan kiya ke wo yani Tameem samandar ke jahaz mein tees aadmiyon ke sath sawar hua jo lakhm aur juzaam ki qaum mein se they, to unse aik mahina bhar samandar ki lahrein khelti rahin. phir wo log samandar mein doobtey suraj ki taraf aik jazeerey ke kinarey ja lagey. to wo jahaz se pulwar (yani chhoti kashti) mein baithey aur jazeerey mein dakhil ho gaey wahan unko aik janwar mila jo ke bhari dam , bahut baalon wala ke iska aglaa pichhlaa hissey baalon ke hujoom se malum na hota tha. logon ne us se kaha ke aey kambakht to kya cheez hai? usne kaha ke main jaasus hun. logon ne kaha ke jaasus kya? usne kaha ke us mard ke paas chalo jo dair (rahibon ki imaarat) mein hai, ke wo tumhari khabar ka bahut mushtaaq (khahishmand) hai. Tameem (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha ke jab us ne mard ka naam liya to ham us janwar se darey ke kahin shaitan na ho. Tameem (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha ke phir ham daudtey huey (yani jaldi) 'dair' mein dakhil huey. dekha to wahan aik badey qad ka aadmi hai ke ham ne itna bada aadmi aur waisaa sakht jakdaa hua kabhi nahi dekha. uske donon hath gardan ke sath bandhey huey they aur donon raanon se takhnon tak lohey se jakdaa hua tha. ham ne kaha ke aey kambakht ! to kya cheez hai? usne kaha tum meri khabar par qaabu pa gaey ho (yani mera haal to tum ko ab malum ho jaaeyga), tum apna haal bataao ke tum kon ho? logon ne kaha ke ham Arab log hain, samandar mein jahaz mein sawar huey they, lekin jab ham sawar huey to samandar ko josh mein paya phir aik mahiney ki muddat tak lahar ham se khelti rahi , phir ham is jazeerey mein aa lagey to chhoti kashti mein baith kar jazeerey mein dakhil huey, to hamein aik bhari dam ka aur bahut baalon wala janwar mila, ham uske baalon ki kasarat ki wjah se uska aglaa pichhlaa hissey na pehchantey they. ham ne us se kaha ke aey kambakht ! to kya cheez hai? usne kaha ke main jaasus hun. ham ne kaha ke jaasus kya? usne kaha ke us mard ke paas chalo jo 'dair' mein hai aur wo tumhari khabar ka bahut mushtaaq hai. to ham teri taraf daudtey huey aaey aur ham us se darey ke kahin bhoot-paret na ho. phir us mard ne kaha ke mujhey baisaan ke nakhlistaan (khajuron) ki khabar do. ham ne kaha ke to uska kon sa haal poochhta hai? usne kaha ke main uske nakhlistaan (khajur ke paidon) ke barey mein poochhta hun ke wo phal detey hai? ham ne us se kaha ke haan, phal detey hai. usne kaha ke khabardaar raho an-qareeb wo na phaley gein. usne kaha ke mujhey tabriya ke dariya ke barey mein batlao . ham ne kaha ke to us dariya ka kon sa haal poochhta hai? wo bola ke usmein pani hai? logon ne kaha ke usmein bahut pani hai. usne kaha ke albatta uska pani an-qareeb khatm ho jaeyga phir usne kaha ke mujhey zughar ke chashmey ke barey mein khabar do. logon ne kaha ke uska kya haal poochhta hai? usne kaha ke us chashmey mein pani hai aur wahan ke log us pani se kheti kartey hain? ham ne us se kaha ke haan ! usmein bahut pani hai aur wahan ke log uske pani se kheti kartey hain. usne kaha ke mujhey ummiyon ke paighambar ke barey mein khabar do unhonne kya kiya? logon ne kaha ke wo Makka se nikley hain aur Madina mein gaey hain. usne kaha ke kya Arab ke log unse ladey? ham ne kaha ke haan. usne kaha ke unhon-ne Arbon ke sath kya kiya ? ham ne kaha ke wo apne gird aur pesh ke Arbon par ghalib huey aur unhon-ne unki itaat ki. usne kaha ke ye baat ho chuki? ham ne kaha ke haan. usne kaha ke khabardaar raho ye baat unke haq mein behtar hai ke paighambar ke perokar hon aur albatta main tum se apna haal kehta hun ke main Masih (dajjal) hun aur albatta wo zamana qareeb hai ke jab mujhey nikalney ki ijazat hogi. isliye main niklun ga aur sair karunga aur kisi basti ko na chhodunga jahan chalis (40) raat ke andar na jaun, siwaey Makka aur taiba ke , ke wahan jana mujh par haram hai yani mana hai. jab main un donon bastiyon mein se kisi ke andar jana chaahoon ga to mere aagey aik farishta badh aayega aur uske hath mein nangi talwaar hogi, wo mujhey wahan janey se rok dega aur albatta uske har aik naakey par Farishtey hongey jo uski chaukidaari karengey. Sayeda Fatima (Raziallahu anha) ne kaha ke phir Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne apni chhadi member par mar kar farmaya ke taiba yahi hai, taiba yahi hai, taiba yahi hai. yani taiba se murad Madina Munawra hai. khabardaar raho ! bhala main tum ko is haal ki khabar de nahi chuka hun? to ashaab ne kaha ke haan. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke mujhey Tameem (Raziallahu anhu) ki baat achi lagi jo us cheez ke muwafiq hui jo maine tum logon se dajjal aur Madina aur Makka ke haal se farma diya tha. khabardaar ho ke wo Sham (Syria) ya Yaman ke samandar mein hai? nahi balke wo mashriq ki taraf hai, wo mashriq ki taraf hai, wo mashriq ki taraf hai (mashriq ki taraf bahare-Hind hai shayad dajjal bahare-Hind ke kisi jazeera mein ho (aur Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mashriq ki taraf ishara kya. Sayeda Fatima binte-Qais (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha ke ye hadis maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se yad rakhi hai."
"7387","sayyaar-abul-hakam ne kaha : hamein Shabi ne hadis bayan ki, kaha : ham Hazrat Fatima binte-Qais (Raziallahu anhu) ke yahan gaey, unhon-ne hamein taaza khajooron ka tohfa diya jinko ibne-taab ki taaza khajoorein kaha jata tha aur jau ke sattu pilaaey, maine unse us aurat ke barey mein puchha jis ko teen talaaqein di gaee hon ke wo iddat kahan guzaarey gi? unhon-ne kaha : mujhey mere shauhar ne teen talaaqein di thin to Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mujhey ijazat di thi ke main apne ghar walon ke darmyan iddat guzaar loon, (hazrat Fatima (Raziallahu anha) ne) kaha : phir (iddat ke baad) logon mein ye elaan kiya gaya ke Namaz ki jamat honey wali hai, main bhi doosrey logon ke sath Namaz ke liye chal di, mein aurton ki pehli saf mein thi jo mardon ki aakhiri saf ke peechhey thi. unhon-ne kaha : maine Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suna, aap member par khutba de rahe they, aap ne farmaya : Tameem daari (Raziallahu anhu) ke chacha ke betey (unke qabeeley se talluq rakhney waley rishtedar ( samandar (ke jahaz) mein sawar huey. uskey baad (sayyaar ne poori) hadis bayan ki aur is mein mazeed kaha ke (hazrat Fatima (Raziallahu anha) ne) kaha : aisey lagta hai ke main Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko dekh rahi hun, aap ne apne asaa ko zamin ki taraf jhukaya aur farmaya : ye taiba hai. aap ki murad Madina se thi."
"7388","ghailaan-bin-Jareer ne Shabi se aur unhon-ne Hazrat Fatima binte-Qais (Raziallahu anhu) se hadis bayan ki, kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas Hazrat Tameem daari (Raziallahu anhu) aaey aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko bataya ke wo samandar (ke jahaz) mein sawar huey to unka jahaz rastey se hat gaya, wo aik jazeerey mein ja utrey, wo us jazeerey mein nikal kar pani dhoondney lagey, wahan aik insan se mulaqat hui jo apne baal ghaseet raha tha, phir (poori) hadis bayan ki aur is mein ye bhi kaha : phir us (dajjal) ne kaha : agar mujhey nikalney ki ijazat di gaee to main taiba (Madina) ke siwa tamam shehron mein jaunga, phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) un  (hazrat Tameem daari (Raziallahu anhu)) ko logon ke samney le gaey aur (unki maujoodgi mein) aap ne un (logon) ke samney (ye waqia) bayan kiya. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : ye taiba hai aur wo (shakhs) dajjal hai."
"7389","abu Zinad ne Shabi se aur unhon-ne Hazrat Fatima binte-Qais (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) member par raunaq afroz huey aur farmaya : logo ! mujhey Tameem daari (Raziallahu anhu) ne ye bataya hai ke unki qaum ke kuchh log apne aik jahaz mein samandar mein they, wo jahaz toot gaya aur unmein se kuchh log jahaz ke takhton mein se aik takhtey par Sawar ho gaey aur samandar mein aik jazeerey ki taraf ja nikley aur phir (aagey baqi bachi) hadis bayan ki."
"7390","ibne-Umar auzaye ne Ishaq bin-Abdullah-bin-abi-Talha se riwayat ki, kaha : mujhey Hazrat Anas-bin-Malik (Raziallahu anhu) ne hadis bayan ki, kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : Makka aur Madina ke alawa koi Shahar nahi magar dajjal ! usey raundey ga. un (do shehron) ke raston mein se har rastey par Farishtey saf baandhtey huey pahra de rahe hongey phir wo aik shoreeli zamin mein utrey ga. us waqt Madina teen baar larazey ga aur har kaafir aur munafiq ismein se nikal kar us (dajjal) ke paas chala jaeyga."
"7391","Hammaad-bin-Salma ne Ishaq-bin-Abdullah-bin-abi-Talha se aur unhon-ne Hazrat Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya, iske baad usi (pichhli hadis ki) tarah bayan kiya, magar usmein kaha : chunanche wo (dajjal) jurf ki shoreeli zamin mein aa kar apna khema lagaey ga aur kaha : har munafiq mard aur aurat nikal kar uske paas chaley jaengey."
"7392","Hazrat Anas-bin-Malik (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : isbahaan ke yahudiyon mein se sattar (70) hazaar (yahudi) dajjal ki pairwi karengey, un (ke jismon) par tailsaan ki abaaein (chaadrein) hongi ."
"7393","Hujjaj-bin-Muhammad ne kaha : ibne-Juraij ne kaha ke mujhey abu-Zubair ne hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne Hazrat Jabir-bin-Abdullah (Raziallahu anhu) se suna, wo keh rahe they ke mujhey umme-Sharik (Raziallahu anhu) ne khabar di ke unhon-ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suna, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) farma rahe they : log dajjal se faraar ho kar pahadon mein jaengey. Hazrat umme-Sharik (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha : Allah ke rasool ! us waqt Arab kahan hongey? (jo Deen ke difaa' mein seena-siper ho jatey hain) Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : wo bahut kam hongey."
"7394","abu-Aasim ne ibne-Juraij se isi sanad ke sath (yahi) hadis bayan ki."
"7395","Abdul-Azeez-bin-Mukhtar ne kaha : hamein Ayub ne Humaid-bin-Hilal se hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne aik giroh se riwayat ki jin mein abu-dahma aur abu-Qatada shamil huein, unhon-ne kaha : ham Hazrat Hisham-bin-Aamir (Raziallahu anhu) ke paas se guzar kar Hazrat Imran-bin-Husain (Raziallahu anhu) ke paas jaya kartey they, aik din unhon-ne kaha : tum mujhey chhod kar aisey logon ke paas jatey ho jo mujh se zyada Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir hone-waale nahi they aur na unko mujh se zyada Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki hadison ka ilm hai, maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko ye farmatey huey suna tha : Hazrat Adam (Alaihissalam) se lekar qiyamat tak koi makhlooq (fitna aur fasaad mein) aisi nahi jo dajjal se badi ho."
"7396","Ubaidullaah-bin-Amr ne Ayub se, unhon-ne Humaid-bin-Hilal se aur unhon-ne apni qaum ke teen logon se riwayat ki jin mein abu Qatada bhi shamil hain ke ham Hisham-bin-Aamir (Raziallahu anhu) ke paas se guzar kar Hazrat Imran-bin-Husain (Raziallahu anhu) ke paas jatey they. jis tarah Abdul-Azeez-bin-Mukhtar ki riwayat hai magar unhon-ne kaha : dajjal (ke fitney) se bada koi mamla (pesh nahi aaya)."
"7397","Alaa ke walid (Abdur-Rehman) ne Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : chh (6) chizon ke zuhoor se pahley nek amal karne mein sabqat karo. suraj ke maghrib se tuloo honey, dhuein , dajjal , zamin ke chaupaaey , khas taur par tum mein se kisi aik ko pesh aaney waley mamley ( bimari , aajiz kar deney wala budhapa ya koi rukawat) aur har kisi ko pesh aaney wala mamla. ( maslan : ijtimaaii gumrahi, fitney ke zamaney mein qatle-aam, qiyamat se pahley.)"
"7398","Shoba ne Qatada se, unhon-ne Hasan se, unhon-ne Ziyad-bin-riyah se, unhon-ne Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se aur unhon-ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat ki ke Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : chh (6) chizon ke zuhoor se pahley nek aamal mein sabqat karo : dajjal , dhuaan , zamin ka chaupaaya , suraj ka maghrib se tuloo hona, aam logon ke sath pesh aaney wala mamla ya khususi taur par tum se kisi aik ko pesh aaney wala mamla."
"7399","Hammam ne Qatada se isi sanad ke sath usi ki tarah hadis bayan ki."
"7400","Yahya-bin-Yahya ne hamein hadis bayan ki, kaha : hamein Hammad-bin-Zaid ne khabar di, unhon-ne Mualla-bin-Ziyad se, unhon-ne Muawiya-bin-Qurra se, unhon-ne Ma'qil-bin-Yasaar (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya, isi tarah hamein Qutaiba-bin-Saeed ne yahi hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne kaha, hamein Hammad ne Mualla-bin-Ziyad se hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne is riwayat ko Muawiya bin-Qurra ki taraf lautaaya, unhon-ne Hazrat Ma'qil-bin-Yasaar (Raziallahu anhu) ki taraf aur unhon-ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki taraf mansub kartey huey bayan kiya ke aap ne farmaya : har taraf phaili hui qatl aur ghaarat giri ke dauran mein ibadat (par tawajjoh markooz) karnaa, meri taraf hijrat karne ki tarah hai."
"7401","yahi hadis mujhey abu-Kamil ne bayan ki, unhon-ne kaha : hamein Hammad ne isi sanad ke sath usi ki tarah hadis bayan ki."
"7402","Hazrat Abdullah (bin-Masood (Raziallahu anhu)) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat ki ke aap ne farmaya : qiyamat sirf badtareen logon par hi qaaim hogi."
"7403","Yaqoob ne abu-Hazim se riwayat ki, unhon-ne Hazrat Sehal (Raziallahu anhu) ko kehtey huey suna, unhon-ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suna, aap angoothey ke sath wali (shahadat ki ungli) aur badi ungli ke sath ishara kartey huey farma rahe they : main aur qiyamat is tarah (saath-saath) bhejey gaey hain."
"7404","Muhammad-bin-Jafar ne kaha : hamein Shoba ne hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne kaha : maine Qatada ko suna, kaha : hamein Hazrat Anas-bin-Malik (Raziallahu anhu) ne hadis bayan ki, kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : mujhey aur qiyamat ko in (shahadat aur badi ungliyon) ki tarah (saath-saath) maboos kiya (bheja) gaya hai. Shoba ne kaha : aur maine Qatada se unke hadis bayan karne ke doran mein suna : jitni unmein se aik ungli dusri se badi hai) itney se zamaney ka farq hai) mujhey malum nahi ye (mana) unhon-ne Hazrat Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se naql kartey huey bayan kiya ya khud Qatada ne bayan kiya."
"7405","Khalid-bin-Haaris ne kaha : hamein Shoba ne hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne kaha : maine Qatada aur abu Tayyah ko hadis bayan kartey huey suna, un donon ne Hazrat Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se suna, wo hadis bayan kar rahe they ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : mujhey aur qiyamat ko is tarah maboos kiya (bheja) gaya hai. aur Shoba ne usey bayan kartey huey apni angusht shahadat aur darmyani ungli ko milaya."
"7406","Muaz aur Muhammad-bin-Jafar ne kaha : hamein Shoba ne abu-Tayyah se hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne Hazrat Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se aur unhon-ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se yahi hadis riwayat ki."
"7407","ibne-abi Adi ne Shoba se, unhon-ne Hamza zabi aur abu-Tayyah se, unhon-ne Hazrat Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se aur unhon-ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se un sab ki hadis ki tarah bayan kiya."
"7408","Mabad ne Hazrat Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, kaha Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : mujhey aur qiyamat ko is tarah bheja gaya hai. kaha : aur Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne angusht shahadat aur darmyani ungli ko ikattha kiya."
"7409","Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai kaha : dehaati log (baddoo log) jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas aatey to aap se qiyamat ke mutaalliq sawal kartey ke qiyamat Kab aaeygi? aap unmein sabse kam Umr insan ki taraf dekh kar farmatey : agar ye zinda raha to ye boodha nahi hua hoga ke tum par tumhari (qiyamat ki) ghadi aa jaeygi."
"7410","Sabit ne Hazrat Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki ke aik shakhs ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se sawal kiya : qiyamat Kab qaaim hogi? aur uske paas Ansar mein se aik ladka betha tha jisey Muhammad kaha jata tha to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : agar ye ladka zinda raha to shayad usey budhapa na pahunchega ke (tumhari) qiyamat aa jaeygi."
"7411","Maabad-bin-Hilal Anzi ne Hazrat Anas-bin-Malik (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki ke aik shakhs ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se sawal kiya : qiyamat Kab qaaim hogi ? Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) thodi der khamosh rahe, phir aap ne apne samney baithey azde-shanoo', ke aik ladkey ki taraf nazar ki, phir farmaya : agar ye ladka lambi umr pa gaya to usey budhapa nahi aaya hoga ke (tumhari) qiyamat qaaim ho jaeygi. (Mabad ne) kaha : Hazrat Anas (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha : wo ladka us din mera ham umr tha."
"7412","Qatada ne Hazrat Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, unhon-ne kaha : (us waqt) Hazrat Mughira-bin-Shoba (Raziallahu anhu) ka aik ladka guzra jo mere ham umaron mein se tha to Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : agar isko mohlat mili to isey budhapa nahi aaya hoga ke (tum par) qiyamat aa jaeygi."
"7413","Aaraj ne Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki aur unhon-ne iska silsile Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) tak pahunchaya ke Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : qiyamat aaeygi to aik aadmi ontni ka doodh nikal raha hoga wo bartan uske munh tak na pahuncha hoga ke qiyamat qaaim ho jaeygi aur do aadmi kapdey ka saudaa kar rahe hongey unhon-ne khareedo-farokht (mukammal) nahi ki hogi ke qiyamat qaaim ho jaeygi, aik shakhs apne hauz mein lipaai kar raha hoga wo bahar nahi nikal paya hoga ke qiyamat qaaim ho jaeygi."
"7414","Saleh ne Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : do baar Saur phoonkney ke darmyan chalis (40) ka waqfa hoga. unhon (logon) ne kaha, Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) chalis (40) din? unhon-ne kaha : main inkar karta hun. logon ne kaha : chalis (40) mahiney? unhon-ne kaha : main inkar karta hun. logon ne kaha chalis (40) saal? unhon-ne kaha : main inkar karta hun. phir Allah Taala aasman se pani nazil farmaeyga to log isi tarah ugein gey jis tarah sabza ugtaa hai. unhon-ne kaha : aur insan ka koi hissey nahi, magar wo boseeda ho jaeyga, siwaey aik haddi ke wo damchi ki haddi ka aakhiri hissa hai qiyamat ke din usi se khilqat ki tarkeeb mukammal hogi."
"7415","Aaraj ne Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : damchi ki haddi ke aakhiri sirey ke siwa poorey ibne-Aadam (ke jism) ko mitti kha leygi. usi se insan paida kiya gaya aur usi (aakhiri sirey) se phir (usey jod kar) ikattha kiya jaeyga."
"7416","Mamar ne Hammam-bin-Munabba se hadis bayan ki, kaha : ye hadisein hamein Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se bayan kin, phir unhon-ne kai hadisein zikr kin, unmein se (eik ye) hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : insan ke jism mein aik haddi hai jis ko mitti kabhi na kha sakey gi, usi mein (se) qiyamat ke din usko poora bnaya jaeyga unhon (logon) ne puchha : Allah ke rasool ! wo kon si haddi hai? Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : wo dam ki haddi ka aakhiri sira hey."
"7417","Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : duniya momin ka qaid khaana aur kaafir ki jannat hai."
"7418","Sulaiman-bin-Bilal ne Jafar se, unhon-ne apne walid se aur unhon-ne Hazrat Jabir-bin-Abdullah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) (Madina ki) kisi oopri taraf se dakhil hotey huey bazar se guzrey, log aap ke pahlu mein (aap ke sath chal rahe) they. aap haqeer se kanon waley marey huey memney ke paas se guzrey, aap ne usey kaan se pakad kar uthaya , phir farmaya : tum mein se kon isey aik dirham ke iwaz lena pasand karega? to unhon (sahaba (Rizwaanullahi anhum ajmaeen)) ne kaha : hamein ye kisi bhi cheez ke iwaz lena pasand nahi, ham isey lekar kya karengey? aap ne farmaya : (phir) kya tum pasand kartey ho ke ye tumhen mil jaaey? unhon (sahaba (Rizwaanullahi anhum ajmaeen)) ne kaha : Allah ki qism ! agar ye zinda hota to tab bhi ismein aib tha, kyonke (eik to) ye haqeer se kanon wala hai (bhulaa nahi lagta). phir jab wo maraa hua hai to kis kaam ka? is par Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : Allah ki qism ! jitna tumharey nazdeek ye haqeer hai Allah ke nazdeek duniya is se bhi zyada haqeer hai."
"7419","Muhammad-bin-Musanna Anzi aur Ibrahim-bin-Muhammad-bin-Urwa-saami ne mujhey hadis bayan ki, donon ne kaha : hamein abdul-wahaab Saqafi ne Jafar (sadiq) se hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne apne walid (Muhammad Baqar) se, unhon-ne Hazrat Jaabir (Raziallahu anhu) se aur unhon-ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se usi ki tarah riwayat ki albatta Saqafi ki riwayat mein hai :  (sahaba (Rizwaanullahi anhum ajmaeen) ne kaha :) agar ye zinda hota tab bhi haqeer se kanon wala hona iska aib tha."
"7420","Hammam (bin-Yahya-bin-Dinar) ne hamein hadis bayan ki, kaha : hamein Qatada ne Mutarif se, unhon-ne apne walid (hazrat Abdullah-bin-Shikhkhir (Raziallahu anhu)) se riwayat ki, kaha : main Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir hua jabke aap (sura) (أَلْهَاكُمُ التَّكَاثُرُ) tilawat farma rahe they. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : ibne-Aadam kehta hai mera maal , mera maal. farmaya Adam ke betey ! terey maal mein se terey liye sirf wahi hai jo tum ne kha kar fana kar diya, ya pahan kar puraanaa kar diya, ya sadqa karke aagey bhej diya."
"7421","Shoba, Saeed (bin-abi-Aruba) aur Hisham sab ne Qatada se, unhon-ne Mutarif se aur unhon-ne apne walid se riwayat ki, kaha : main Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein pahuncha.(aagey) Hammam ki hadis ki tarah bayan kiya."
"7422","Hafs-bin-Maisra ne Alaa (bin-Abdur-Rehman) se, unhon-ne apne walid se aur unhon-ne Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : banda kehta hai mera maal , mera maal isliye to iske maal se sirf teen cheezein hain. jo usney khaya aur fana kar diya, jo pehna aur boseeda kar diya, ya jo kisi ko de kar (aakhirat ke liye) zakheera kar liya. iske siwa jo kuchh bhi hai to wo (banda) janey wala aur us (maal) ko logon ke liye chhodney wala hai."
"7423","Muhammad-bin-Jafar ne kaha mujhey Alaa-bin-Abdur-Rehman ne isi sanad ke sath usi ki tarah bayan kiya."
"7424","Abdullah-bin-abi-Bakr ne kaha : maine Hazrat Anas-bin-Malik (Raziallahu anhu) ko kehtey huey suna ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : mayyat ke peechhey teen cheezein hoti hain unmein se do lot aati hain aur aik sath reh jati hai uske ghar waale, uska maal aur uska amal uske peechhey hotey hain, ghar waley aur maal lot aa-tey hain aur aamal sath reh jata hai."
"7425","Yunus ne ibne-Shahab se, unhon-ne Urwa-bin-Zubair se riwayat ki ke Hazrat Miswar-bin-Makhrama (Raziallahu anhu) ne unhein bataya ke Amr-bin-Auf (Raziallahu anhu) jo bani Aamir ke haleef (dost) they, unhon-ne jange-badr mein Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath shirkat ki thi, unhein khabar di ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Hazrat abu Ubaida-bin-jarraah (Raziallahu anhu) ko Bahrain bheja taake wahan ka jiziya ley aaein, Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne b-zaat khud ahale-Bahrain se suleh ki thi aur Alaa-bin-hizrami (Raziallahu anhu) ko un par ameer muqarrar kya tha. Hazrat abu-ubaida (Raziallahu anhu) Bahrain se maal ley aaey, Ansar ne Hazrat abu-ubaida (Raziallahu anhu) ke aaney ki khabar suni to wo sab subah ki Namaz main Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas pahunchey. jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Namaz ada kar li, wapas huey to wo (sahaba (Rizwaanullahi anhum ajmaeen)) Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke samney huey. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne jab unhein dekha to muskuraa diye, phir Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : mera khayal hai ke tum logon ne sun liya hai ke abu-ubaida (Raziallahu anhu) Bahrain se kuchh lekar aaey hain? unhon-ne kaha : Allah ke rasool ! aap ne bajaa farmaya, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : khush ho jao aur uski ummeed rakho jis se tumhen khushi hogi. Allah ki qism ! mujhey tum par faqr (gareebi) ka khof nahi (ke tumhen us se nuqsan pahunchega) lekin mujhey tum par is baat ka khof hai ke duniya isi tarah tum par kushaada kar di jaeygi jis tarah tum se pahley logon par kushaada kar di gaee thi. phir tum usmein aik doosrey ka muqaabla karogey jis tarah un logon ne aik doosrey ka muqaabla kiya aur ye tumhen bhi tabah kar degi jis tarah is ne unko tabah kar diya tha."
"7426","Saleh aur Shuaib donon ne Zohri se Yunus ki sanad ke sath uski hadis ki tarah riwayat ki, magar Saleh ki hadis mein hai : aur ye tumhen bhi is tarah lubhaaey gi (duniya mein magan aur aakhirat se ghaafil kar degi) jis tarah is ne unko lubhaya tha."
"7427","Abdullah-bin-Amr-bin-Aas (Raziallahu anhu) ke Maula Yazeed-bin-abu-Faraas Ribah ne Hazrat Abdullah-bin-Amr-bin-Aas (Raziallahu anhu) se, unhon-ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat ki ke aap ne farmaya : jab Rome (mojooda Itly) aur Faaris fateh ho jaeinge to tum kis tarah ki qaum hogey? Hazrat Abdur-Rehman-bin-Auf (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha, ham wahi baat karengey jiska Allah ne hamein hukm diya hai. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : ya iske bar-aks tum (duniya ke mamley mein) aik doosrey se muqaabla karogey, phir aik doosrey se hasad karne lago gey , phir aik doosrey se munh mod logey phir aik doosrey se bughz mein mubtala ho jaogey. phir miskeen muhajireen ke yahan jaogey aur unmein se kuchh ko (hakim bana kar) dusron ki gardanon par musallat kar doge."
"7428","abu Zinad ne Aaraj se aur unhon-ne Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : jab tum mein se koi shakhs uski taraf dekhey jisey maal aur jamaal mein fazeelat hasil hai to usko bhi dekhey jo us se kamtar hai, jis par (khud) usey fazeelat hasil hai."
"7429","Mamar ne Hammam-bin-Munabba se, unhon-ne Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se aur unhon-ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat ki, bilkul abu-Zinad ki hadis ki tarah."
"7430","Jareer, abu-Muawiya aur Wakee ne Aamash se, unhon-ne Abu-Saleh se aur unhon-ne Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : uski taraf dekho jo (maal aur jamaal mein) tum se kamtar hai, uski taraf mat dekho jo tum se faaiq (achha) hai, ye laaiq tar hai iske ke tum Allah ki nemat ko haqeer na samjho gey. abu-Muawiya ne kaha : (wo nemat ( jo tum par ki gaee."
"7431","Ishaq bin-Abdullah-bin abi Talha ne kaha : mujhey Abdur-Rehman bin abi Umra ne hadis bayan ki, unhein Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) ne hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna : Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) farmatey they ke Bani-Israeel ke logon mein teen aadmi they, aik kodhi safaid dagh waala, doosra ganja aur teesra andha . to Allah Taala ne unko aazmaana chaha to unke paas farishta bhejaa. to wo safaid dagh waley ke paas aaya aur us ne kaha ke tujhey kon si cheez bahut pyari hai? usne kaha ke achchha rang achi khaal aur mujh se ye bimari door ho jaey jiske sabab se log mujh se nafrat kartey hain. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke Farishtey ne is par hath phera . to uski bad-soorti door ho gaee aur usko achchha rang aur achi khaal di gaee. Farishtey ne kaha ke tujhey kon sa maal bahut pasand hai? usne kaha ke oont ya gaaey. (rawi hadis Ishaq bin-Abdullah ko shak hai ke usne oont maanga ya gaaey lekin safaid dagh waley ya ganjey ne unmein se aik ne oont kaha aur doosrey ne gaaey). to usko das mahiney ki gaabhan ontni di aur kaha ke Allah Taala terey waastey usmein barkat de. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke phir farishta ganjey ke paas aaya to kaha ke tujhey kon si cheez bahut pasand hai? usne kaha ke achchhey baal aur ye bimari jati rahe, jiske sabab se log mujh se nafrat kartey hain. phir us ne is par hath phera to uski bimari door ho gaee aur usko achchhey baal miley. Farishtey ne kaha ke tujhey kon sa maal bahut pasand hai? usne kaha ke gaaey . to usko gaabhan gaaey de di gaee. Farishtey ne kaha ke Allah Taala terey maal mein barkat de. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke phir farishta andhey ke paas aaya aur kaha ke tujhey kon si cheez bahut pasand hai? usne kaha ke Allah Taala aankh mein beenaai kar de to main iske sabab se logon ko dekhun . Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke phir Farishtey ne is par hath phera to Allah ne usko beenaai de di. Farishtey ne kaha ke tujhey kon-sa maal bahut pasand hai? usne kaha ke bhed bakri. to usko gaabhan bakri mili. phir un donon (ontni aur gaaey) aur us (bakri) ne bachchey diye. phir hotey-hotey safaid dagh waley ke jangal bhar oont ho gaey aur ganjey ke jangal bhar gaaey bail ho gaey aur andhey ke jangal bhar bakriyan ho gain . Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke muddat ke baad wahi farishta safaid dagh waley ke paas uski pehli sura aur shakl mein aaya, aur kaha ke main mohtaaj aadmi hun, safar mein mere tamam asbaab kat gaey (yani tadbeerein jati rahin aur maal aur asbaab na raha ( , to aaj mere liye Allah ki madad ke siwa aur uske baad teri madad ke baghair manzil par pahunchna mumkin nahi hai, main tujh se iske naam par jisne tujhey suthra rang aur suthri khaal di aur maal aur oont diye, aik oont mangta hun jo mere safar mein kaam aaey. usne kaha ke mujh par logon ke bahut haq hain (yani qarzdaar hun ya gharbaar ke kharch se zyada maal nahi jo tujhey dun). phir farishte ne kaha ke albatta main tujhey pehchanta hun bhala kya to mohtaaj kodhi na tha? ke log tujh se nafrat kartey they, phir Allah ne apne Fazal se tujhey ye maal diya. us ne jawab diya ke maine to ye maal apne bap-dada se paya hai jo kai pusht se naql ho kar aaya hai. Farishtey ne kaha ke agar to jhoota ho to Allah tujhey waisaa hi kar daley jaisa to pahley tha. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke phir farishta ganjey ke paas uski pehli sura aur shakl mein aaya aur us se waisaa hi kaha jaisa safaid dagh waley se kaha tha aur us ne bhi wahi jawab diya jo safaid dagh waley ne diya tha. Farishtey ne kaha ke agar to jhoota ho to Allah tujhey waisa hi kar daley jaisa to tha. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke phir farishta andhey ke paas uski pehli shakl w sura mein gaya, aur kaha ke main mohtaaj aadmi hun aur musaafir hun, mere safar mein mere sab waseeley aur tadbeerein kat gain, to mujhey aaj manzil par Allah ki madad aur uske baad teri madad ke baghair pahunchna mushkil hai. isliye main tujh se us Allah ke naam par, jisne tujhey beenaai di, aik bakri mangta hun taake wo mere safar mein kaam aaey. usne kaha ke beshak main andha tha to Allah ne mujhey (beenaai wali) aankh di, tum un bakriyon mein se jitni chaho ley jao aur jitni chaho chhod jao. Allah ki qasam! aaj jo cheez to Allah ki raah mein lega, main tujhey mushkil mein na daalunga (yani tera hath na pakdunga). to Farishtey ne kaha ke apna maal apne paas rakho, tum teenon aadmi sirf aazmaey gaey they. to tujh se to Allah Taala razi hua aur terey donon sathiyon se naakhush hua."
"7432","Bukair bin Mismar ne kaha : mujhey Aamir-bin-Sad ne hadis bayan ki unhon-ne kaha : Hazrat Sad-bin-abi-Waqas (Raziallahu anhu) apne oonton ke paas they ke unke betey umr (bin Sad) unke paas aaey jab Hazrat Sad (Raziallahu anhu) ne unhein dekha to kaha : main us sawar ke shar se Allah ki panah chahta hun. wo utrey aur un (hazrat Sad (Raziallahu anhu)) se kaha : aap apne oonton aur bakriyon ke paas rihaaish pazeer ho gaey hain aur logon ko chhod diya hai ke wo saltanat ke barey mein aapas mein lad rahe hain (aap bhi apna hissey maangen) Hazrat Sad (Raziallahu anhu) ne unke seeney par zarb lagai aur kaha : khamosh raho ! maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna hai : Allah Taala apne us bandey se mohabbat rakhta hai jo muttaqi ho, ghani ho, gum naam (gosha-nasheen) ho."
"7433","Motamir Abdullah-bin-Numair aur ibne-Bishr ne kaha : hamein Ismail bin Qais ne hadis sunai, kaha : maine Hazrat Sad-bin-abi-Waqas (Raziallahu anhu) ko farmatey huey suna : Allah ki qism ! main Arbon mein se pahla shakhs hon jisne Allah ki raah mein teer chalaaya ham Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath is tarah jangein ladtey they ke hamarey paas khaney ko khaardaar darakht ke patton aur us keekar (ke patton (ke siwa kuchh nahi hota tha. yahan tak ke ham mein se koi bakri ki mengniyon ki tarah paakhaana karta tha phir ab banu-Asad ke log Deen ke mamley mein meri taadeeb karne lagey hain ! (agar ab main Deen se is qadr naa-balad ho gaya hun) tab to main bilkul naakaam ho gaya aur mere amal zaaye ho gaey aur ibne-Numair ne apni riwayat mein tab to nahi kaha."
"7434","Wakee ne Ismail bin abi Khalid se isi sanad ke sath riwayat ki aur kaha : yahan tak ke ham se aik bakrey ki) mengniyon ki) tarah ka paakhaana karta tha jis main aur kuchh (kisi aur khaney ka koi hissey jo usey paakhaana ki shakl se) mila hua nahi hota tha."
"7435","Sheban-bin-Farukh ne hamein hadis bayan ki kaha : hamein Sulaiman-bin Mughira ne hadis bayan ki, kaha : hamein Humaid bin Hilal ne Khalid-bin Umer adwi se hadis bayan ki unhon-ne kaha : aik din (Hazrat umr (Raziallahu anhu) ki taraf se Basra ke aamil (Hazrat Utba-bin- ghazawan (Raziallahu anhu) ne hamein khutba diya aur Allah Taala ki hamd w sana ki phir kaha : be-shak ye duniya khaatmey ke qareeb ho gaee hai aur is (ki mohlat ( mein se thoda sa hissey baqi reh gaya hai jis tarah bartan ke aakhiri qatrey hotey hain jinhein bartan wala undel raha hota hai aur tum is duniya se us ghar ki taraf muntaqil ho rahe ho jis par zawaal nahi aayega . jo tumharey paas hai is mein se behtareen mutaa ke sath aagey jao. kyonke hamein bataya gaya tha ke jahannam ke kinarey se aik patthar phainka jata hai to wo 70 saal girta rehta hai. uski teh tak nahi pahunchta aur Allah ki qasam! ye (jahannam) poori tarah bhar jaeygi. kya tumhen is par tajjub hai? aur hamein bataya gaya ke jannat ke kiwaadon mein se do kiwaadon ke darmyan chalis (40) saal ki masafat hai aur is par aik din aayega jab wo azdahaam ke sabab tang pad jaeyga aur maine dekha ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath (eman laney waale) saat (7) logon mein se saatwan main tha hamarey paas darakhton ke patton ke siwa khaney ki koi cheez nahi hoti thi yahan tak ke hamari baachhein zakhmi ho gain. maine aik chadar uthai to usey apne aur Sad bin Malik (Raziallahu anhu) ke darmyan 2 hisson mein taqseem kar liya aadhi maine kamar par baandhi aur aadhi Sad (Raziallahu anhu) ne ab ham mein se har koi shehron mein se kisi Shahar ka ameer bin gaya hai. main is baat se Allah ki panah mein aata hun ke main apne dil mein bada aur Allah ke nazdeek chhota ho jaun aur kabhi koi nabwooat nahi thi magar khatm ho gaee. yahan tak ke uska pichhla hissey badhshahat mein badal gaya. jald hi tumhen (uska) pata chal jaeyga aur hamarey baad ke ameeron ka (bhi tum log khud) tajriba kar logey."
"7436","Ishaq bin Umar-bin saleet ne mujhey hadis bayan ki, kaha : hamein Sulaiman-bin Mughira ne hadis bayan ki kaha : hamein Humaid bin Hilal ne Khalid-bin Umer se jinhoney jahiliyat ka zamana dekha tha riwayat ki kaha : Hazrat Utba-bin-ghazawaan (Raziallahu anhu) ne hamein khutba diya wo us waqt Basra ke ameer they. (aagey) Sheban ki hadis ki tarah bayan kya."
"7437","Qurra bin Khalid ne Humaid bin Hilal se aur unhon-ne Khalid-bin Umer se riwayat ki, kaha : maine Hazrat Utba-bin- ghazawaan (Raziallahu anhu) se suna, wo keh rahe they, maine dekha main Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath (eman laney waale) saat (7) logon mein se saatwan shakhs tha khaardaar darakhton ke patton ke siwa hamarey paas khaney ko kuchh nahi tha yahan tak ke hamari baachhein zakhmi ho gain ."
"7438","Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai kaha : unhon-ne ( sahaba kiram (Rizwaanullahi anhum ajmaeen) ( ne arz ki, Allah ke rasool! qiyamat ke din ham apne rab ko dekhengey? Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : kya do-pahar ke waqt jab badal na hon tumhen suraj ko dekhney mein koi zahmat hoti hai? unhon (sahaba kiram (Rizwaanullahi anhum ajmaeen) ( ne kaha : nahi aap ne farmaya : chaudahwin ki raat ko jab badal na hon to kya tumhen chaand ko dekhney mein koi zahmat hoti hai? unhon-ne ( sahaba kiram (Rizwaanullahi anhum ajmaeen) ( ne kaha : nahi aap ne farmaya : mujhey us zaat ki qism jiske hath mein meri jaan hai! tumhen apne rab ko dekhney mein us se zyada zahmat nahi hogi jitni zahmat tumhen un donon ko dekhney mein hoti hai. aap ne farmaya : wo ( rab ( bandey se mulaqat farmaeyga to kahega . aey falan ! kya maine tumhen izzat na di thi, tumhen sardaar na banaya tha tumhari shadi na karaai thi ghodey aur oont tumharey ikhtiyar mein na diye they aur tumhen aisa nahi bana chhoda tha ke tum sardaari kartey they aur logon ki aamadni mein se chothai hissey letey they? wo jawab mein kahega . kyon nahi ! ( bilkul aisa hi tha. ( to wo farmaeyga . kya tum samajhtey they ke tum mujh se milogey? wo kahega. nahi. to wo farmaeyga . aaj main isi tarah tumhen bhool jaaunga. jis tarah tum mujhey bhool gaey they phir doosrey se mulaqat karega . aey falan ! kya maine tumhen izzat aur sayaadat se nahi nawaza tha tumhari shadi nahi karaai thi tumharey liye oont aur ghodey musakhkhar nahi kiye they aur tumhen is tarah nahi bana chhoda tha ke tum riyaasat ke mazey letey they. aur logon ke maalon mein se chothai hissey wsool kartey they? wo kahega kyon nahi mere rab! to wo farmaeyga . tumhen is baat ka koi guman bhi tha ke tum mujh se mulaqat karogey ? wo kahega . nahi to. wo farmaeyga ab main bhi isi tarah tumhen bhool jaaunga jis tarah tum mujhey bhool gaey they. phir teesrey se milega. us se bhi wahi farmaeyga. wo kahega . aey mere rab! mein tujh par teri kitaabon aur terey rasulon par eman laya tha aur namazein padhi thin rozey rakhey they aur sadqa diya karta tha jitna uske bas mein hoga (apni neki ki) tareef karega, chunanche wo farmaeyga . tab tum yahin thehro . farmaya : phir us se kaha jaeyga ab ham tumharey khilaf apna gawah laaengey . wo dil mein sochega mere khilaf kon gawahi dega? phir uske munh par mohar laga di jaeygi aur uski raan, gosht aur haddiyon se kaha jaeyga bolo to uski raan uska gosht aur uski haddiyaan uske amal ke mutaalliq bataeingi. ye (is liye) kaha jaeyga ke wo (Allah) uski zaat se uska uzr door kar de. aur wo munafiq hoga aur wahi shakhs hoga jis par Allah Taala sakht naraz hoga."
"7439","Hazrat Anas-bin-Malik (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai kaha : ham Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas ( baithey huey) they ke aap hans padey phir aap ne puchha : kya tumhen ye malum hai ke main kis baat par hans raha hun? ham ne kaha Allah aur uska Rasulul (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) zyada jaanney waley hain. aap ne farmaya : mujhey bandey ki apne rab ke sath ki gaee baat par hansi aati hai wo kahega. aey mere rab! kya toney mujhey zulm se panah nahi di? Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne kaha : wo farmaeyga. kyon nahi! farmaya : banda kahega main apne khilaf apni taraf ke gawah ke siwa aur kisi (ki gawahi) ko jaaiz qarar nahi deta. to wo farmaeyga aaj tum apne khilaf bataur gawah khud kafi ho aur kiraaman katebin bhi gawah hain chunanche uske munh par mohar laga di jaeygi aur uske (apne) aaza se kaha jaeyga bolo, farmaya : to wo uske aamaal ke barey mein bataengey, phir usey aur (uske aaza ke) bolney ko akela chhod diya jaeyga farmaya : to (unki gawahi sun kar) wo kahega door ho jao, main tumhari taraf se (doosron ke saath) lada karta tha."
"7440","abu-Zura ne Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne ( dua kartey huey) farmaya : aey Allah ! Muhammad (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke ghar walon ke rizq ko zindagi bar-qaraar rakhney jitna kar de."
"7441","abu-Bakar-bin-abi-Sheba Amr Naqid Zuhair-bin-Harab aur abu-Kuraib ne kaha : hamein Wakee ne hadis bayan ki kaha : hamein Aamash ne Imaara bin Qaqa se hadis bayan ki unhon-ne abu-Zura se aur unhon-ne Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, unhon-ne kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne dua ki : aey Allah! aale-Muhammad (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ka rizq zindagi bar-qaraar rakhney jitna kar de. aur Amr ki riwayat mein hai : aey Allah! (aale-Muhammad ko zindagi bar-qaraar rakhney jitna) rizq de."
"7442","abu-Usama ne kaha : maine Aamash se suna unhon-ne Ammara-bin-Qaqa se isi sanad ke sath riwayat ki aur kaha : baqadre-kifaayat (kar de)"
"7443","Mansoor ne Ibrahim se unhon-ne Aswad se aur unhon-ne Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat ki, unhon-ne kaha : Muhammad (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke ghar walon ne jab se aap Madina aaey aap ki wafat tak kabhi teen raatein musalsal gehun ki roti sair ho kar nahi khaai."
"7444","Aamash ne Ibrahim se unhon-ne Aswad se aur unhon-ne Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat ki kaha : Rasulullah ne kabhi mutwaatir teen din sair ho kar gehun ki roti nahi khaai yahan tak ke aap apni raah par rawaana ho gaey."
"7445","Abdur-Rehman bin Yazeed ne hamein Aswad se hadis bayan ki unhon-ne Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat ki, unhon-ne kaha : Muhammad (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke ghar walon ne kabhi 2 din lagatar jo ki roti pet bhar kar nahi khaai yahan tak ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki wafat ho gae."
"7446","Aabis ne Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat ki kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke ghar walon ne teen din se zyada kabhi sair ho kar gehun ki roti nahi khaai."
"7447","Hafs bin Ghiyas ne hamein Hisham-bin-Urwa se hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne apne walid se riwayat ki, unhon-ne kaha : Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ne kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke ghar walon ne kabhi teen din sair ho kar gehun ki roti nahi khaai, yahan tak ke aap apni raah par rawaana ho gaey."
"7448","Hilal bin Humaid ne Urwa se aur unhon-ne Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat ki, unhon-ne kaha : aale-Muhammad (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne kabhi musalsal 2 din gehun ki roti sair ho kar nahi khaai magar 2 dinon mein se aik din khajoor hoti thi."
"7449","Yahya bin yaman ne kaha : hamein Hisham-bin-Urwa ne hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne apne walid se aur unhon-ne Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat ki unhon-ne kaha : ham aale-Muhammad (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) aik maah tak is haalat mein rahtey they ke aag nahi jalaatey they bas khajoor aur pani par guzar hoti thi."
"7450","abu-Bakar-bin-abi-Sheba aur abu-Kuraib ne kaha : hamein abu-Usama aur ibne-Numair ne Hisham-bin-Urwa se isi sanad ke sath riwayat ki, ham log usi haalat mein rahtey they. aur unhon-ne aal Muhammad (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ka zikr nahi kya aur abu-Kuraib ne ibne-Numair se marwi (bayan) apni hadis mein mazeed kaha siwaey iske ke hamarey paas (kahiin se) thoda sa gosht aa jata."
"7451","Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) wafat pa gaey aur mere taaqchey mein kisi jigar rakhney waley (zi Rooh) ke khaney ke liye thodey se jo ke siwa kuchh na tha main usmein se (paka kar) khaati rahi yahan tak ke bahut din guzar gaey (eik din) maine unko maap liya to wo khatm ho gaey."
"7452","Yazeed bin Ruman ne Urwa se aur unhon-ne Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat ki ke aap bataya karti thin : Allah ki qasam! mere bhaanjey! ham aik baar pehli ka chaand dekhtey phir (agley mahiney) pehli ka chaand dekhtey 2 mahinon mein teen baar bhi Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke hujron mein choolha na jalaa hota. (Urwa ne) kaha : maine puchha khala to aap ki guzraan ke liye kon si cheez hoti? unhon-ne kaha : 2 kali cheezein : khajoor aur pani. albatta Ansar mein se kuchh (gharaaney) Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke hamsaaey they aur unhein doodh dene wali oontniyan mili hui thin. wo unke doodh mein se kuchh Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein bhej diya kartey to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) wo hamein pilaa detey they."
"7453","Urwa-bin-Zubair ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki ahliya Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat ki, kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) duniya se rukhsat ho gaey aur aap kabhi aik din mein 2 baar roti aur Zaitoon ke tel se sair nahi huey."
"7454","Dawud bin Abdur-Rehman attaar ne hamein khabar di kaha : mujhey Mansoor bin Abdur-Rehman hajabi ne apni walida Safiya se hadis bayan ki unhon-ne Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat ki kaha : jab log 2 siyah cheezein : khajoor aur pani se sair honey lagey to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) rihlat farma gaey."
"7455","Abdur-Rehman (bin Mehdi) ne hamein Sufiyan (Sory) se hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne Mansoor bin Safiya se unhon-ne apni walida se aur unhon-ne Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat ki, kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki rihlat ho gaee aur ham 2 siyah chizon, pani aur khajoor se sair honey lagey."
"7456","(Ubaidullah bin Abdur-Rehman) Ashjai aur abu Ahmed donon ne Sufiyan se isi sanad ke sath hadis bayan ki, magar un donon ki Sufiyan se marwi (bayan) hadis mein hai. (aap tashrif le gaey) jabke (abhi) ham 2 siyah cheezein (pani aur khajoor ( bhi pet bhar ke nahi khaatey they."
"7457","Muhammad-bin Ibad aur ibne-abi-Umar ne hamein hadis bayan ki, kaha : hamein Marwan fazari ne Yazeed bin kaisaan se hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne abu-Hazim se aur unhon-ne Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, unhon-ne kaha is zaat ki qism jiske hath mein meri jaan hai! jabke ibne-Ibad ne kaha is zaat ki qism jiske hath mein Abu-Hurera ki jaan hai! Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne kabhi apne ghar walon ko teen din lagaataar gehun ki roti pet bhar kar nahi khilaai thi yahan tak ke aap duniya se tashrif ley gaey."
"7458","Yahya-bin-Saeed ne hamein Yazeed bin kaisan se hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne kaha : mujhey Hazim ne hadis bayan ki kaha : maine Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) ko kai baar dekha wo ungli se ishara kartey they kehtey they us zaat ki qism jiske hath mein Abu-Hurera ki jaan hai! Allah ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) aur aap ke ghar walon ne kabhi lagatar teen din gandam ki roti sair ho kar nahi khaai thi yahan tak ke aap duniya se rukhsat ho gaey."
"7459","Qutaiba-bin-Saeed aur abu-Bakar-bin-abi-Sheba ne kaha : hamein abu-Ahwas ne Samak-bin-Harab se hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne kaha : maine Hazrat Noman-bin-Bashir (Raziallahu anhu) ko ye kehtey huey suna : kya tum logon ko apni marzi ka khana aur peena muyassar nahi? maine tumharey Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko dekha tha aap ke paas raddi khajoor bhi itni nahi hoti thi jis se aap apna pet bhar lein aur Quteba ne ( بہ ( (jis se) ka zikr nahi kya."
"7460","Zuhair aur Israel donon ne Samak se isi sanad ke sath usi ke mutabiq hadis bayan ki aur Zuhair ki hadis mein mazeed hai aur tum khajooron aur makkhan ki kai qismon ke baghair razi nahi hotey."
"7461","Shoba ne Samak-bin-Harab se hadis bayan ki, kaha : maine Hazrat Noman-bin-Bashir (Raziallahu anhu) ko khutba detey huey suna, kaha : Hazrat umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne is baat ka zikr kya ke logon ne duniya mein se kya kuchh hasil kar liya hai. phir farmaya : maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko dekha tha aap pura din bhook se laut-tey they aur aapko sukhi hui itni sakht khajoor bhi muyassar na hoti thi jis se apna pet bhar letey."
"7462","abu Hani ne abu Abdur-Rehman ko kehtey huey suna : maine Hazrat Abdullah-bin Amr-bin-Aas (Raziallahu anhu) se suna unse kisi aadmi ne puchha tha : kya ham fuqara muhajireen mein se nahi hain? to Hazrat Abdullah (Raziallahu anhu) ne us se kaha : kya tumhari biwi hai jiske paas tum aaraam karne ke liye jatey ho. usne kaha : haan. puchha : kya tumharey paas rihaaish-gaah hai jahan tum rehtey ho? usne kaha : mere paas to khaadim (bhi) hai kaha : phir to tum baadshaahon mein se ho."
"7463","abu Abdur-Rehman ne kaha : Hazrat Abdullah-bin Amr-bin-Aas (Raziallahu anhu) ke paas teen shakhs aaey jabke main unke yahaan tha wo kehney lagey : abu-Muhammad! Allah ki qasam! hamein koi cheez muyassar nahi hai na kharch na sawari aur na saman (wo log waaqeatan faqeer they) Hazrat Abdullah (Raziallahu anhu) ne unse kaha : tum kya chahtey ho? agar tum pasand karo to dobara hamarey paas aao Allah Taala jo tumharey liye muhaiya krega, ham tumhen de dengey. agar chaho to ham tumhara zikr ba-ikhtiyaar Hakim ke paas kar dengey. (wo tumhari zarooraton ka khayal rakhega) aur agar tum chaho to sabr karo maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna : be-shak hijrat karke aaney waley faqeer qiyamat ke roz maaldaron ki nisbat chalis (40) saal pahley jannat mein jaengey. un (sahaba kiram (Rizwaanullahi anhum ajmaeen)) ne kaha : ham sabr karengey. koi cheez nahi maangengey."
"7498","Aqeel ne Zohri se, unhon-ne ibne-Musaiyab se, unhon-ne Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se aur unhon-ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat ki ke Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : momin aik suraakh se 2 martaba nahi dasaa jata."
"7499","ibne-Shahab ke bhatijey ne apne chacha se, unhon-ne ibne-Musaiyab se, unhon-ne Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se aur unhon-ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se usi ki tarah riwayat ki."
"7512","Harun-bin-Maruf aur Muhammad-bin-Ibad ne hamein hadis bayan ki, alfaz donon se miltey-jultey hain jabke siyaaq (sandarbh) Harun ka hai. donon ne kaha : hamein Hatim-bin-Ismail ne Yaqoob-bin-Mujahid-abu-Hazra se hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne Ubada-bin-Waleed-bin-Ubada-bin-Samit se riwayat ki, unhon-ne kaha : main aur mere walid ilm hasil karne ke liye Ansar ke is qabeeley ki halaakat se pahley usmein gaey, sabse pahley shakhs jin se hamari mulaqat hui wo Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sahabi Hazrat abu-yusr (Raziallahu anhu) they, unke sath unka aik ghulam bhi tha jiske paas sahaaif ( dastaawez (ka aik majmooa tha, Hazrat abu-yusr (Raziallahu anhu) ke badan par aik dhaari-daar chadar aur muaafiri ka bana hua aik kapda tha aur unke ghulam ke jism par bhi aik dhaari-daar chadar aur aik muaafiri kapda tha. mere walid ne unse kaha : chacha ! main ghussey ki bina par aap ke chehrey par rang ki tabdili dekh raha hun, unhon-ne kaha : haan , falan-bin-falan , jis ka taalluq banu-haram se hai, ke zimmey mera maal tha, main uske ghar walon ke yahan gaya, salam kiya aur maine puchha : kya wo hai? ghar walon ne kaha : nahi hai phir achcha uska aik kam umr ladka mere samney ghar se nikla , maine us se puchha : teera bap kahan hai? usne kaha : unhon-ne aap ki awaz suni to wo meri walida ke chhappar khat mein ghus gaey hain. maine kaha : nikal kar meri taraf aa jao, mujhey pata chal gaya hai ke tum kahan ho. wo bahar nikal aaya maine puchha : is baat ka baais kya bana ke tum mujh se chhup gaey? usne kaha : Allah ki qism ! main aapko bataata hun aur main aap se jhoot nahi boloon ga , Allah ki qism ! main is baat se dara ke kahin mein aap se baat karun aur jhoot boloon aur main aap se wada karun aur aap ke sath uski khilaf warzi karun. jabke aap Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sahabi hain aur Allah ki qism main tang dast tha. unhon-ne kaha ke maine kaha : Allah ki qism ! usne kaha : Allah ki qism ! maine ( dobara ( kaha : Allah ki qism ! usne kaha : Allah ki qism ! maine ( phir ( kaha : Allah ki qism ! usne kaha : Allah ki qism ! kaha : phir unhon-ne apna saheefa (jis par qarz ki tahreer likhi hui thi) nikala aur apne hath se usko mitaa diya ( phir maqrooz se) kaha : agar tumhen adaaeygi ke liye maal mil jaey to mera qarz lota dena aur nahi to tum bari-uzzimma ho, main gawahi deta hun ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko meri un donon aankhon ki basaarat ne (dekha) aur (ye kehtey huey) unhon-ne apni do ungliyan apni do aankhon par rakhin , aur mere in donon kanon ne suna aur mere is dil ne yad rakha aur unhon-ne apne dil wali jagah par ishara kiya. jabke Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) farma rahe they : jis shakhs ne kisi tang dast ko mohlat di ya uska qarz khatm kar diya Allah Taala apne saaey se is par saaya karega ."
"7513","(Ubada-bin-Waleed ne) kaha : maine unse kaha : chacha jaan ! agar aap apne ghulam ki dhaari-daar chadar ley letey aur usey apna muaafiri kapda de detey ya us se uska muaafiri kapda ley letey aur usey apni dhaari-daar chadar de detey to aap ke jism par aik joda hota aur uske jism par bhi aik joda hota. unhon-ne mere sar par hath phera aur kaha : aey Allah ! isko barkat ata farmaa. bhatijey ! Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko meri aankhon ki basaarat (ne dekha) aur mere do kanon ne suna aur. dil ke maqam ki taraf ishara kartey huey kaha mere dil ne usey yad rakha , jabke aap farma rahe they. un (ghulaamon) ko usi mein se khilaao jo tum khaatey ho aur usi mein se pahnaao jo tum pahntey ho. agar maine usey duniya ki ne'maton mein se (uska hissa) de diya hai to ye mere liye us se zyada aasan hai ke wo qiyamat ke roz meri nekiyan ley jata."
"7514","phir ham (aagey) rawaana huey yahan tak ke ham Hazrat Jabir-bin-Abdullah (Raziallahu anhu) ke paas unki masjid mein hazir huey wo aik kapdey mein usey donon palluon ko mukhalif simton mein kandhon ke uper se guzaar kar baandhey huey Namaz padh rahe they. main logon ko phalaangtaa hua gaya yahan tak ke unke aur qibley ke darmyan ja kar baith gaya. (jab wo Namaz se farigh huey to) maine unse kaha : aap aik kapdey mein Namaz padh rahe hain aur aap ki chadar aap ke pahlu mein padi hui hai? unhon-ne is tarah apne hath se mere seeney mein maara unhon (Ubada) ne apni ungliyan alag kin aur unhein kamaan ki tarah modaa (aur kehney lagey) main (yahi) chahta tha ke tum jaisa koi naa-samajh mere paas aaey aur dekhey ke main kya kar raha hun, phir wo (bhi) is tarah kar liya kare. (phir kaha) Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) hamari is masjid mein tashrif laey aap ke hath mein ibne-taab (ki khajoor ( ki aik shaakh thi aap ne masjid ke qibley ki taraf (wali diwar par) jama hua balgham laga dekha. aap ne khajoor ki shaakh se usko khurch kar saaf kiya phir hamari taraf rukh karke farmaya : tum mein se kon pasand karta hai ke Allah Taala us se ea'raaz (bachey) farmaai (uski taraf nazar tak na karey? ( kaha : to ham sab dar gaey. aap ne phir farmaya : tum mein se kon ye pasand karta hai ke Allah Taala us se bachey? kaha : ham par khof taari ho gaya aap ne phir se farmaya : tum mein se kisey ye baat achchhi lagti hai ke Allah Taala us se ea'raaz farmaey? ham ne arz kiya, Allah ke rasool ! ham mein se kisi ko bhi (ye baat pasand) nahi aap ne farmaya : tum mein se koi shakhs jab Namaz ke liye khada hota hai to Allah tabarak w taala uske samney ki taraf hota hai lihaza usey samney ki taraf hargiz thookna nahi chahiye na daain taraf hi thookna chahiye apni baain taraf baain paon ke nichey thookey. agar jaldi nikalney wali ho to apne kapdey ke sath is tarah (saaf) kare. phir aap ne kapdey ke aik hissey ki doosrey hissey par teh lagai phir farmaya : mujhey khushbu laakar do. qabeeley ka aik naujawaan uth kar apne ghar walon ki taraf bhaagaa aur apni hatheli mein khushbu ley gaya. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne wo (khushbu) li usey chhadi ke sirey par lagaya aur jis jagah sookhaa balgham laga hua tha is par mal di. Hazrat Jaabir (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha : yahan se tum ne apni masjidon mein khushbu lagaani shuru ki."
"7515","(Jaabir (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha) ham Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath wadi bawaat ki jang mein they. aap (qabeela juhaina ke sardaar) majdi-bin-Amr-Juhni ko dhoond rahe they pani dhoney waley aik oont par ham panch (5), chh (6), aur saat (7) aadmi baari-baari baithtey they. Ansar mein se aik aadmi ki apne oont par (baithney ki) baari aai to usne oont ko bithaya aur is par Sawar ho gaya. phir usko uthaya to us (oont ( ne us (ke hukm) par uthney mein kisi had tak der ki to usne kaha : khada ho, tum par Allah laanat kare. is par Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : ye apne oont par laanat karne wala kon hai? usne kaha : Allah ke rasool ! main. aap ne farmaya is se utar jao jis par laanat ki gaee ho wo hamarey sath na chaley apne aapko baddua na do na apni aulad ko baddua do na apne maal maweshi ko baddua do Allah ki taraf se (muqarrar karda qabooliyat ki) ghadi ki muwafiqat (barabari) na karo jis mein (jo) kuchh maanga jata hai wo tumhen ata kar diya jata hai."
"7516","ham Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath rawaana huey yahan tak ke jab kisi had tak Sham ho gaee aur ham Arab ke paaniyon mein se kisi pani ke qareeb pahunchey to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : kon shakhs hai jo ham se pahley ja kar hauz (ke kinarey ko mazbut karne ke liye us) ki lipaai karega aur khud bhi pani piye ga aur hamein bhi pilaaey ga? Hazrat Jaabir (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha : main khada ho gaya aur arz ki. Allah ke rasool ! ye hai wo aadmi Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : kon shakhs Jaabir ke sath jaeyga? to Hazrat jabbaar-bin-sakhr (Raziallahu anhu) khadey huey ham kuwein ke paas gaey aur ham ne ( kuwein se nikal kar) hauz mein aik ya do dol pani daley phir usko mitti se leepaa , baad iske usmein pani bharnaa shuru kiya yahan tak ke labaalab bhar diya. sabse pahley ham ko Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) dikhlai diye. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : ''tum donon shakhs ijazat detey ho (mujh ko pani pilaaney ki apne janwar ko)?'' ham ne arz kiya : haan , ya Rasulullah ! Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne apni ontni ko chhoda , us ne pani piyaa , phir Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne uski baag kheenchi us ne pani peenaa mauqoof (multawi) kiya aur peshab kiya. phir Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) usko alag le gaey aur bitha diya. baad iske Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) hauz ki taraf aaey aur wuzu kiya phir main khada hua Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke wuzu karne ki jagah se (pani lekar) wuzu kiya. jabbaar-ban-sakhr (Raziallahu anhu) qazaey-hajat (zaroorat se farigh honey) ke liye chaley gaey to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Namaz padhney ke liye khadey ho gaey aur mere jism par aik chadar thi. main (eik taraf ( gaya ke is (chadar) ke donon kinaron ko mukhalif simton mein) kandhon par) daalun to wo mujhey poori na aai. iski jhalrein thin maine is (chadar) ko ulat kar iske kinarey badley phir is par apni gardan se zor daala ( gardan jhukaa kar usey iske nichey dabaayaa ( phir aaya aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki baain taraf khada ho gaya. aap ne mere hath se pakad kar mujhey ghumaayaa yahan tak ke mujhey apni daain taraf khada kiya phir jabbaar sakhr (Raziallahu anhu) aaey unhon-ne wuzu kiya aur aa kar Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki baain taraf khadey huey Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne ham donon ke hath pakdey aur hamein dhakel kar apne peechhey khada kar diya. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) lagatar meri taraf dekh rahe they aur mujhey pata nahi chal raha tha phir mujhey samajh aai to aap ne hath se is tarah ishara farmaya : aap ka maqsad tha ke apni kamar baandh lo. jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) (namaz se) farigh huey to farmaya : aey Jaabir ! maine kaha hazir hun Allah ke rasool ! Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : jab kapda khula ho to iske kinaron ko mukhalifat simton mein ley jao aur agar tang ho to usko kamar ke uper baandh lo."
"7517","ham Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath (eik muhim par) gaey. ham mein se har shakhs ki khuraak roz ki aik khajoor thi wo us khajoor ko choostaa rehta aur phir usko apne kapdey mein lapet leta ham apni kamaanon se darakhton ke patey jhaadtey they aur khaatey they yahan tak ke hamari baachhon mein zakhm huey. qism khata hun ke aik din ham mein se aik ghalati se us (eik khajoor ( se mahroom reh gaya ham usey ( sahara de kar) uthatey huey lekar (taqseem karne waley ke paas) gaey aur uske haq mein gawahi di ke usey wo (eik khajoor ( nahi di gaee. wo usey di gaee to usne khud khadey ho kar li."
"7518","ham Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath (eik muhim ke liye) rawaana huey yahan tak ke ham kushaada wadi mein ja utrey Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) qazaey-hajat (zaroorat se farigh honey) ke liye gaey main ( chamdey ka bana hua (pani ka aik bartan lekar aap ke peechhey gaya. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne nazar daudai aisi cheez nazar na aai jiski aap oat ley saktey. wadi ke kinarey par do darakht nazar aaey aap unmein se aik darakht ke paas tashrif le gaey uski tahniyon mein se aik ko pakada aur farmaya : Allah ke hukm se mere mutee' ho jao . to wo nakel daley huey oont ki tarah aap ka farmaanbardaar bin gaya phir doosrey darakht ke paas aaey aur uski tahniyon mein se aik ko pakda aur kaha : Allah ke hukm se mere mutee' ho jao. to wo bhi isi tarah aap ke sath chal padaa yahan tak ke) usey chalaatey huey) donon ke darmyan ke aadhey faasley par pahunchey to aap ne un donon ko jhukaa kar aapas mein mila (kar ikattha kar) diya aap ne farmaya : donon Allah ke hukm se mere aagey mil jao. to wo donon sath mil gaey (aur Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko parda muhaiya kar diyaa) Hazrat Jaabir (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha : main dar se bhaagta hua wahan se nikla ke mere qareeb honey ko mehsus karke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) wahan se ( mazeed ( door) janey par majbur ( na ho jayen aur Muhammad-bin-Ibad ne (apni riwayat mein) kaha : aapko door janey ki zahmat karni padey main (eik jagah ( baith gaya aur apne aap se baatein karne laga. achcha meri nigaah padi to maine dekha ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) tashrif la rahe hain aur dekha ke donon darakht alag-alag ho chukey hain. har aik darakht taney par seedha khada ho gaya hai phir maine dekha ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) aik baar rukey aur apne sar Mubarak se is tarah ishara kiya. abu Ismail ( Hatim-bin-Ismail ( ne apne sar se daain baain ishara kiya. phir aap aagey tashrif laey jab mere paas pahunchey to farmaya : Jaabir ! kya tum ne mere khadey honey ki jagah dekhi thi? maine kaha ji haan. aap ne farmaya : donon darakhton ki taraf jao aur donon mein se har aik se aik (aik ( shaakh kaat lao yahan tak ke aa kar jab meri jagah par khadey ho jao to aik shaakh apni daain taraf daal dena aur aik shaakh baain taraf . Hazrat Jaabir (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha : main utha aik patthar uthaya usey todaa aur usey ghusaayaa jab wo mere ( kaam ke) ke liye tez ho gaya to un donon darakhton ki taraf aaya har aik se aik (aik) shaakh kaati, phir unko ghaseet'taa hua aaya, yahan tak ke aa kar us jagah khada hua jahan pahley Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) khadey huey they, to aik shaakh apni daain taraf daal di aur aik apni baain taraf . phir main aap ke sath ja mila aur kaha : Allah ke rasool ! (jo aap ne farmaya tha) maine kar diya hai wo kis liye tha? farmaya : main do qabron ke paas se guzra unko azab diya ja raha tha. maine unke barey mein shafaat karni chahi ke unse us waqt tak ke liye kami kar di jaey jab tak ye shakhein geeli rahen."
"7519","(hazrat Jaabir (Raziallahu anhu) ne) kaha : phir ham lashkar ke paas aaey to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) farmaya : Jaabir ! wuzu ke pani ke liye awaz do. to maine (har jagah pukar kar) kaha : kya wuzu ka pani nahi hai? kya wuzu ka pani nahi hai? kya wuzu ka pani nahi hai? kaha : maine kaha : Allah ke rasool (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) mujhey qafley mein aik qatra (pani) nahi mila. Ansar mein se aik aadmi tha jo Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke liye apne puraaney mishkeezey mein pani daal kar usey khajoor ki tahni (se bani hui ( khoonti se latkaa kar thanda kiya karta tha. (Jaabir (Raziallahu anhu) ne) kaha : aap ne mujh se farmaya falan-bin-falan Ansari ke paas jao aur dekho uske puraaney mishkeezey mein kuchh hai? kaha : main gaya, iske andar dekha to mujhey us (mishkeezey) ke munh wali jagah par aik qatrey ke siwa kuchh nazar na aaya. agar main usey (doosrey bartan mein) nikaaltaa to uska khushk hissey usey pi leta . main Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein aaya aur kaha : Allah ke rasool ! mujhey us ( mishkeezey (ke munh mein pani ke aik qatrey ke siwa kuchh nahi mila. agar main usey undeloon to uska khushk hissey usey pi lega . Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : jao usey mere paas ley aao . main usey Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas ley aaya. aap ne usey hath mein pakda aur kuchh kehna shuru kiya mujhey pata na chala ke aap ne kya kaha aur us ( mishkeezey ( ko apne donon hathon mein dabaaney aur harkat dene lagey, phir aap ne mujhey wo de diya to farmaya : Jaabir ! pani ( pilaaney (ka bada bartan mangwaao . maine awaz di : sawaaron ka bada bartan (tab) laao. usey utha kar mere paas laya gaya to maine usey Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke samney rakh diya, phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne apna Mubarak hath pyaley mein is tarah kiya, usey phailaayaa aur apni ungliyaan alag-alag kin phir usey bartan ki tahiya mein rakha aur farmaya : Jaabir ! mere hath par pani undel do aur bismillaah padho ! maine usey aap (ke hath ( par undela aur kaha : bismillaah . maine pani ko Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki ungliyon ke darmyan se phoot'tey huey dekha, phir wo bada bartan (pani ke josh se) zor se umadney aur ghoomney laga. yahan tak ke pura bhar gaya to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : Jaabir ! jis-jis ko pani ki zarurat hai usey awaz do. kaha : log aaey aur pani liya, yahan tak ke sab ki zarurat poori ho gaee, kaha : maine elaan kiya koi baqi hai jisey (pani ki) zarurat ho? phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne bartan se apna hath uthaya to wo (usi tarah) bharaa hua tha."
"7555","Sufiyan ne Aamash se unhon-ne Ibrahim se, unhon-ne abu Mamar se aur unhon-ne Hazrat Abdullah (Raziallahu anhu) se (is aayat ke mutaalliq ( riwayat ki : wo log jinhein ye (kaafir) pukaartey hain, wo khud apne rab ki taraf waseela talash kartey hain. (ibne-Masood (Raziallahu anhu) ne) kaha : insanon ki aik jamat jinon ki aik jamat ki parastish karti thi, to jinon ki jamat ne Islam qabool kar liya aur insan badastoor unki ibadat se lagey rahe. is par (ye aayat ( nazil hui : wo log jinhein ye pukaartey hain, wo khud apne rab ki taraf ( kisi nek amal ka ( waseela talash kartey hain."
"7557","Abdullah-bin Utba ne Hazrat Abdullah-bin-Masood (Raziallahu anhu) se (is aayat ke mutaalliq ( riwayat ki : wo log jinhein ye ( kaafir ( pukaartey hain, wo khud apne rab ki taraf ( kisi nek amal ka ( waseela dhoondtey hain. unhon-ne kaha : ye (aayat) Arbon ke aik aisey giroh ke barey mein nazil hui jo jinon ke aik giroh ki ibadat kya kartey they. jinon ne Islam qabool kar liya jabke wo insan jo unki ibadat kya kartey they, unhein pata tak na chala . is par ye aayat utri : wo log jinhein ye ( kaafir ( pukaartey hain, wo khud apne rab ki taraf waseela talash kartey hain."